 point, haven't you?"P\bHm, I guess that's up for you to decide. I'll see you around. Later, \PN."=\r\PN, you did great in the league. I'm so proud of you!"t\bGary: I decided I'm done with Gym battles. I'm gonna head to Hoenn and help my grandfather with his research.""\bGary: Long time no see \PN."S\bI just got back from the Sinnoh region. I've been doing some research there."<\bYou want to see one of the Pokémon I got from there?"[\bGary: You've really gotten strong, though I still think I could beat you if I tried."?\bI'm heading back to Sinnoh soon. I suggest you visit it."\rJigglypuff"Z\bGary: What are you doing here \PN? Shouldn't you be off becoming a Pokémon Master?"`\bI guess you wanted to come see your old pal. I can take a quick break to battle with you."W\bGary: I should get back to work. Researching Pokémon is a never-ending pursuit."K\rMom: How did it go, \PN? Ah, it looks like you got a lovely Pikachu."�\rIt's going to be a wonderful journey, I can just tell. You were in such a rush I didn't have time to give you these earlier. Be sure to use them." \PN obtained Running Shoes."B\rMom: It's going to be a wonderful journey, I can just tell."0\rDon't leave. Wild Pokémon are out there."\rHi \PN, how is it going?"Professor Oak's Lab"�\bOak: \PN, great job in the league. Gary stopped by already and told us he lost. He left before I could ask him to do me a favor, so I'm wondering if you would."J\bWould you head to Valencia Island in the Orange Archipelago for me?"�\bProfessor Ivy is there and has a mysterious Poké Ball she wants me to check out. There is a league there as well that might interest you."E\bHead up to Viridian City. There is a blimp that will take you."]\bOak: Head up to Viridian City. There is a blimp that will take you to Valencia Island."Yes"No[E"\bM. Mime"EUn M. Mime est sur le chemin. Voulez-vous le prendre avec vous ?"&Motismart: Appel entrant de Goh :"A\bGoh: Hé \PN. Tu peux me rejoindre au Parc Cerise ? Merci.")\rMaman: Bienve