 Quantum Transporters here, bringing you to other dimensions in order to satisfy your hunger for more challenges."L\bWatch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"\bMuk! Muk!"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."Rotom!!" [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave."O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."6\bWow! Well done on completing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"Yes"No[�"![DÉMARRAGE EN COURS.......]"[ALERTE ! ALERTE !]"Se téléporter ?"7\bChen: Viens ici et récupère ton Pokédex, \PN.";\bOak: Attends, n'oublie pas ton Pokémon de départ !"+\bOak: Attends, n'oublie pas Pikachu !"|\bHé, quelle surprise, \PN ! Je suis, Hitsukid. Tu dois avoir terminé ton voyage pour devenir Maître Pokémon, j'imagine."M\bMais penses-tu vraiment être le meilleur dresseur de tous les temps ?"�\bNous avons ici deux Transporteurs Quantiques. Ils te permettront de voyager vers d'autres dimensions pour satisfaire ta soif de défis !"a\bFais attention, par contre... Je ressens des ondes de ténacité émanant de ces machines."\\bIl semblerait que de grands défis t'attendent... mais tu es prévenu. BONNE CHANCE !"A\bChen: Ah \PN, comment ça va ? Ton Pikachu se porte bien ?"&\bChen: Si tu le veux, prends-le."A\bChen: Ah \PN, tu as récupéré la GS Ball, n'est-ce pas ?".\bBien, bien. Laisse-moi y jeter un oeil."4\bHmm. Je n'arrive pas à savoir quoi en faire."b\b\PN, est-ce que je peux te demander de la garder encore un peu et de l'apporter à Fargas ?"�\bIl habite à Écorcia, dans la région de Johto. Le plus rapide pour s'y rendre est de passer par la Route 22, juste à côté de la Ligue Pokémon."z\bChen: Le chemin le plus rapide pour rejoindre Johto passe par la Route 22. C'est juste à côté de la Ligue Kanto."e\bChen: Ah, bonjour \PN. Il paraît que tu as fait un beau parcours à la Conférence Argentée."�\bGary a décidé de partir pour Hoenn afin d'y mener quelques recherches. C'est un endroit magnifique si tu cherches un nouveau défi !"�\bRends-toi à Carmin sur Mer. Je vais prévenir le capitaine de ton arrivée. Un navire t'y attend pour t'emmener à destination."E\bParle aussi à mon assistant en bas. Il à un cadeau pour toi."b\bEt le meilleur pour la fin, ta mère a de nouveaux vêtements pour toi. Tiens, les voilà !"|\bIls te vont à ravir ! Si tu préfères tes anciens vêtements, tu peux en changer devant la commode dans ta chambre."�\bChen: Rends-toi à Carmin sur Mer. Je vais prévenir le capitaine de ton arrivée. Un navire t'y attend pour t'emmener à Hoenn."g\bChen: Ah, bonjour \PN. Il paraît que tu as fait un beau parcours à la Conférence d'Éternara."�\bC'est d'ailleurs le moment idéal, puisque la Zone de Combat vient tout juste d'ouvrir ici, à Kanto ! Je te conseille de commencer par l'Usine de Combat, près d'Azuria."@\bChen: Rends-toi à Azuria pour défier la Zone de Combat."O\bChen: Ah, bonjour \PN. Alors comme ça, tu as vaincu la Zone de Combat ?"x\bTu penses à la région de Sinnoh ? Je vais t'organiser un voyage. Comme d'habitude, rends-toi à Carmin sur Mer."B\bEt comme d'habitude, voici de nouveaux vêtements pour toi."D\bChen: Rends-toi à Carmin sur Mer pour embarquer vers Sinnoh."R\bChen: Ah, bonjour \PN. Alors comme ça, tu as terminé la Ligue de Sinnoh ?"�\bJ'ai vu que tu t'en étais très bien sorti. Je suis sûr que tu es prêt pour ton prochain défi. Pourquoi ne pas m'accompagner à Unys ?"T\bRends-toi à Jadielle. Un dirigeable nous y attend pour nous emmener là-bas."W\bEt comme tu t'en doutes certainement, ta mère t'a préparé une nouvelle tenue."Z\bChen: Rends-toi à Jadielle. Un dirigeable nous y attend pour nous emmener là-bas."m\bChen: La Ligue d'Unys me semble être un défi à ta hauteur. J'ai hâte de connaître tes résultats."@Cette ball contient un Pokémon attrapé par le Professeur."C\bChen: Alors, tu veux Pikachu, le Pokémon souris Électrik ?"^\bChen: Malheureusement, c'est le seul qu'il reste, alors je te conseilles de le prendre."\bPikachu"<Pikachu commence à vous suivre.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"=Ondine: Azuria\n Pierre: Argenta\n Jacky: Enclos de Chen",Flora: Doublonville\n Aurore: Vestigion"$Iris: Janusia\n Rachid: Ogoesse"'Lem: Illumis\n Serena: Nénucrique"-Lana: Ekaeka\n Kiawe: Ruines de l'Éveil"=Barbara: Ekaeka\n Chrys: École Pokémon\n Lilie: Ekaeka"Goh: Parc Cerise"?Régis: Bourg Pallette\n Paul: Voilaroc\n Barry: Bonaugure"MNiko: Renouet\n Alain: Laboratoire du Professeur Platana\n Liam: Illumis")Gladio: Ekaeka\n Tilli: Village Toko" \bGrotadmorv ! Grotadmorv !"\PN reçoit un Pokédex!"Tu as déjà un Pokédex."�\bBonjour \PN. J'ai réussi à concevoir une machine capable de capturer l'essence de puissants Dresseurs venant d'une autre dimension."f\bOn les appelle les 'Détenteurs de Pokédex'. N'hésite pas à tester la machine par toi-même."Motisma !!""[DÉMMARAGE EN COURS........]"[DANGER !  DANGER !]"�Se téléporter ?\ch[1,1, Red, Blue, Green, Yellow, Gold, Silver, Crystal, Ruby, Sapphire, Emerald, Diamond, Pearl, Platinum, Black, White, Blake, Whitley, X, Y, Sun, Moon, Henry, Casey, Non]"4Cet endroit... on dirait bien le Bourg Palette."8Cet endroit... on dirait bien l'arène de Jadielle."5Cet endroit... on dirait bien le Plateau Indigo."5Cet endroit... on dirait bien la Forêt de Jade.".Cet endroit... on dirait bien Bourg Geon.",Cet endroit... on dirait bien Jadielle."+Cet endroit... on dirait bien Rosalia.".Cet endroit... on dirait bien Poivressel."0Cet endroit... on dirait bien Bourg-en-Vol."5Cet endroit... on dirait bien la Tour de Combat."1Cet endroit... on dirait bien l'Île de Fer."-Cet endroit... on dirait bien Verchamps."5Cet endroit... on dirait bien le Mont Couronné."<Cet endroit... on dirait bien la Ligue Pokémon d'Unys.".Cet endroit... on dirait bien Méanville."1Cet endroit... on dirait bien Ondes-sur-Mer.",Cet endroit... on dirait bien Pavonnay."-Cet endroit... on dirait bien Cromlac'h."-Cet endroit... on dirait bien Yantreizh.")Cet endroit... on dirait bien Lili'i"5Cet endroit... on dirait bien le Paradis Æther."8Cet endroit... on dirait bien le Sommet de la Tour.":Cet endroit... on dirait bien la Forêt de Sleepwood."�\bChen: \PN, tu es en retard. Tous les Pokémon de départ ont déjà été pris. ...Bon, il en reste bien un, mais il est un peu imprévisible."H\bChen: On dirait que Pikachu n'aime pas rester dans sa Poké Ball."-\bChen: Salamèche, un excellent choix !"+\bChen: Carapuce, un excellent choix !"<\bN'oublie pas de prendre ton Pokédex avant de partir."`\bChen: J'ai appris que tu avais aussi triomphé d'Unys. C'est un travail merveilleux,\PN !"`\bEst-ce que tu as déjà rencontré Motisma ? Je l'ai capturé dans les îles Décolorore."�\bOù ça se trouve ? Oh, c'est un endroit horrible. Je ne voudrais pas te faire subir un tel voyage. J'y suis allé uniquement pour trouver un Motisma."�\bTu as l'intention d'aller à Kalos ensuite ? Excellente idée. J'ai entendu dire qu'une puissance mystérieuse émanait de cette région."P\bRends-toi à Jadielle. Un dirigeable t'y attendra pour t'emmener là-bas."5\bOh, et n'oublions pas tes nouveaux vêtements."V\bChen: Rends-toi à Jadielle. Un dirigeable t'y attendra pour t'emmener là-bas."p\bChen: J'ai appris que tu avais également triomphé de la région de Kalos. C'est un travail merveilleux."l\bC'est aussi un timing parfait. Ta mère vient tout juste de gagner un voyage pour la région d'Alola."v\bJ'ai aussi cet Œuf que je dois faire parvenir à mon cousin Raphaël. Remets-le lui dès que tu seras arrivé."5\bAttends. N'oublie pas tes nouveaux vêtements."%\bChen: Va parler avec ta mère."?\bChen: Tu ne devrais pas être à l'école actuellement ?"i\bChen: Beau travail, \PN. Te voilà enfin Maître d'Alola. C'était un match vraiment passionnant !"�\bJe suis navré de devoir écourter notre entretien, mais un nouveau Professeur ouvre un laboratoire à Carmin sur Mer et j'ai promis d'y assister."�\bJ'ai une idée ! Pourquoi ne viendrais-tu pas avec moi ? Allez, c'est décidé. Ta mère et moi te retrouverons à Carmin sur Mer."�\bNaturellement, ta mère t'a laissé des vêtements ici. Elle avait peur que tu sois si pressé de revoir tes Pokémon que tu en oublies de repasser à la maison."?\bChen: Ta mère et moi te retrouverons à Carmin sur Mer."Y\bChen: Bonjour \PN. Alors, comment se passe ton travail avec le Professeur Cerise ?"}\bChen: Bonjour \PN. Comment se passe ton travail avec le Professeur Cerise ? Est-ce que le Projet Mew avance bien pour Goh ?"f\bChen: Salut \PN. Va voir derrière le laboratoire, j'y ai laissé une petite surprise pour toi."�\bChen: Bonjour \PN. Comment s'est passée ta rencontre avec Paul ? Est-ce qu'il t'a dit qu'il avait reçu une proposition pour devenir Champion d'Arène ?"f\bChen: Beau travail, \PN. Tu es désormais le Monarque. C'est un accomplissement extraordinaire."`\bChen: Te voilà de retour après un autre voyage ? C'est toujours une agréable surprise."�\bTu as accompli tellement de choses depuis ta rencontre avec Pikachu. Les liens que tu as tissés, les régions que tu as explorées... sans oublier tes amis et tes Pokémon."�\bTu n'as jamais cessé de progresser en tant que Dresseur, et je doute que tu aies l'intention de t'arrêter là. La route pour devenir un Maître Pokémon est encore longue."�\bJe suis vraiment fier de toi, \PN. Je te souhaite bonne chance pour ton prochain voyage. Et sache que tu seras toujours le bienvenu ici, à la maison."�\bChen: Je ne sais plus trop ce qu'il te reste à accomplir, \PN. Je peux dire que tu as fait des pas de géant pour devenir un Maître Pokémon."�\bTu pourrais aller retrouver les amis que tu as rencontrés en chemin. Ils aimeraient sûrement te revoir. Je dois avoir une liste de leurs localisations quelque part par ici."~\bIl y a aussi un centre de combat à Port Yoneuve qui pourrait t'intéresser. C'est l'endroit idéal pour tester tes limites.">\bQu'est-ce qu'il y a ? Tu veux me montrer ton Pokédex ?"\bHmm... Voyons voir..."D\bWow ! Félicitations pour avoir complété le Pokédex, \PN !"\bVoici une récompense."\bN'oublie pas \PN, ton aventure ne s'arrête pas là. Il te reste encore tant de choses à explorer dans ce vaste monde !"Oui"Non;[�"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING! WARNING!]"Teleport?"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"m\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have finished your Journey to be a Pokemon Master."5\bBut do you really think you are the very best?"~\bWe have two Quantum Transporters here, bringing you to other dimensions in order to satisfy your hunger for more challenges."L\bWatch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"\bMuk! Muk!"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."Rotom!!" [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave."O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."6\bWow! Well done on completing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"Yes"NoIu;␀}[["1\bCan you push that boulder onto the switch?"6\bOh! The boulder has been moved onto the switch!"\bWell done!",\bOh. The boulder is not on the switch."+This ladder leads to a random dungeon."�The levels of Pokémon within are based on the levels of Pokémon in the player's party. The relevant code is in the script section PokemonEncounterModifiers."KThe positions of the boulders are checked by a Parallel Process event."eThe hole event must have its "Through" option set, to allow boulder events to be pushed onto it."�Which tile puzzle do you want to play?\ch[1,8, Alph,Alph Rotator,Mystic Square,Tile Swap, Tile Swap Rotator,Rubik's Square,Star Rotator,Cancel]"Puzzle solved!"Gave up...["1\bCan you push that boulder onto the switch?"7\bOh!  The boulder has been moved onto the switch!"\bWell done!"-\bOh.  The boulder is not on the switch."+This ladder leads to a random dungeon."�The levels of Pokémon within are based on the levels of Pokémon in the player's party.  The relevant code is in the script section PokemonEncounterModifiers."KThe positions of the boulders are checked by a Parallel Process event."eThe hole event must have its "Through" option set, to allow boulder events to be pushed onto it."�Which tile puzzle do you want to play?\ch[1,8, Alph,Alph Rotator,Mystic Square,Tile Swap, Tile Swap Rotator,Rubik's Square,Star Rotator,Cancel]"Puzzle solved!"Gave up...;["1\bCan you push that boulder onto the switch?"6\bOh! The boulder has been moved onto the switch!"\bWell done!",\bOh. The boulder is not on the switch."+This ladder leads to a random dungeon."�The levels of Pokémon within are based on the levels of Pokémon in the player's party. The relevant code is in the script section PokemonEncounterModifiers."KThe positions of the boulders are checked by a Parallel Process event."eThe hole event must ha