 what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"_\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response. Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep City.",\bCerise: Good luck in your next match.":\bCerise: I heard Goh was in Lilycove City right now."t\bCerise: An unknown Pokémon has been spotted in the Crown Tundra. I'd like the both of you to investigate it."6\bThe train station in Wyndon can take you there."D\bCerise: You need to visit Professor Oak. Give him my regards."2\bCerise: Goh is looking for you in the park."B\bCerise: The Masters Tournament has begun. I believe in you."B\bCerise: I watched all of your battles. You did a great job."e\bGoh is somewhere in the city waiting for you. He had something he wanted to talk to you about."c\bCerise: So the two of you are leaving? As much as I'll miss you, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"h\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city?"�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar"%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun.">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this is Francois."+\bI heard this lab used to be haunted."B\bCerise: Good morning. I have your first assignment for you."X\bA mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Head out and investigate it."L\bBut before you go, I have something that should help the both of you."M\bIf you get lost, you can use it and it will tell you where to go next."7\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. \PN, let's get going.")\bIt's about time this place opened."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at the Kalos League against Drasna."IGengar seems like it trusts you. Would you like to take it with you?"?\rHello. I'm Chrysa, one of Professor Cerise's assistants."4\rI'm excited to have you working here with us."%\rIt was great working with you."1\rJessie: We'll be taking your Pokémon now."(\bMeowth: You don't stand a chance."+\bJames: Don't even try and resist us."\bWobbuffet: Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"^\bCerise: So you and Goh found the rare Pokémon, Lugia. That's quite the achomplishment."T\bI have an idea. Why don't the two of you stay here as my research assistants?"(\bGoh: Really? That would be great!"G\rMom: \PN, how exciting. I'll leave Mimey here to watch over you."6\rI never thought this place would actually open."3\bGoh: I've never seen a mass outbreak before.",\bGoh: I've never been to Galar before."N\bGoh: The World Coronation Series. That sounds right up your alley, \PN."5\bGoh: I'm going to catch a ton of new Pokémon."1\bGoh: You'll do great in your first battle."0\bGoh: Let's find that mysterious Pokémon."4\bGoh: I'm happy we were able to find Magikarp."*\bGoh: You did great in your matches."1\bGoh: I wonder what's going on in Mauville."$\bGoh: That Flygon was intense."<\bGoh: Alola was fun. Maybe we could go again sometime.">\bGoh: I wonder what's causing your Dynamax Band to glow?"V\bGoh: What a journey that was. I'm glad to be getting back to searching for Mew."0\bGoh: Mewtwo gave me a lot to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"No[�"\bM. Mime"0\rChloé : Oui ? Qu'est-ce que tu me veux ?"9\rChloé: Qu'est-ce que je devrais faire de ma vie ?"/\bChen: J'ai hâte de voir tes résultats."/\rTu penses qu'il prend des candidatures ?"\rÉvoli"�\bCerise: Comment s'est passée la mission du Projet Mew ? Pendant ton absence, Sally a appelé. Elle aimerait que tu viennes la voir à son Arène de Corrifey."O\bGoh: Espérons que ce ne soit pas pour d'autres quiz. Prêt à y aller ?"�\bCerise: \PN, c'est terrible. Partout dans le monde, les Pokémon redeviennent des Œufs. Personne ne sait ce qui arrive, ni ce qui se passe !"�\bCerise: Le problème a commencé à Sinnoh, nous devrons donc commencer nos recherches là-bas. Le Professeur Sorbier a peut-être une idée d'où aller."=\bGoh: Ne perdons pas de temps. Tu es prêt à y aller ?"t\bCerise: Merci à tous les deux pour votre réactivité. Grâce à vous, tous les Pokémon sont en sécurité."�\bPour en revenir à des choses plus légères, Alistair, le Champion de l'Arène de Old Chister, aimerait te rencontrer. Il dit qu'il a quelque chose pour t'aider dans tes combats."I\bGoh: J'ai bien besoin de quelque chose de plus relaxant. On y va ?"9\bCerise: Ton ami ne t'attendais pas à Joliberges ?"X\bCerise: J'ai entendu dire que tu devais aller rendre visite à un ami à Algatia."4\bCerise: Bonne chance pour ton prochain match."L\bCerise: J'ai entendu dire que Goh était actuellement à Nénucrique."|\bCerise: Un Pokémon inconnu a été aperçu dans à Couronneige. J'aimerais que vous meniez l'enquête tous les deux."/\bLa gare de Winscor peut vous y conduire."K\bCerise: Tu dois aller voir le Professeur Chen. Passe-lui le bonjour."4\bCerise: Goh te cherches. Il est dans le parc."D\bCerise: Le Tournoi des Maîtres a commencé. Je crois en toi."I\bCerise: J'ai regardé tous tes combats. Tu as fais du bon travail."X\bGoh t'attends quelque part dans la ville. Il souhaite te parler de quelque chose."~\bCerise: Alors, vous partez tous les deux ? Même si vous allez beaucoup me manquer, je sais que c'est ce qu'il y a de mieux."|\bGoh: Merci, Professeur. Je ne manquerai pas de passer vous voir. Mes Pokémon seront entre de bonnes mains avec vous."X\bCerise: Avant que vous ne partiez, j'ai un cadeau pour vous. Faites-en bon usage."�\bJ'ai un dernier conseil pour toi. Pense à regarder ton téléphone souvent et à bien relire tes notes. C'est essentiel pour rester organisé."�\bCerise: J'ai un dernier conseil pour toi. Pense à regarder ton téléphone souvent et à bien relire tes notes. C'est essentiel pour rester organisé."\bPrenez soin de vous."\rDracolosse"\bVoltoutou !"7\bCerise: Merci d'être passé à mon laboratoire."o\bCerise: Il y a un lit à l'étage que vous deux pouvez utiliser. Nous commencerons à travailler demain."h\bCerise: Une apparition massive d'Herbizarre a été signalée en ville. Va voir ce qui se passe !"t\bCerise: L'apparition massive était causée par la Team Rocket ? Je suis contente que tu ais pu t'en charger."�\bMaintenant que c'est réglé, laisse-moi te confier le projet que j'avais prévu. Goh a trouvé un article sur le phénomène qui fait grandir les Pokémon."�\bCela ne se produit que dans la région de Galar, alors j'ai besoin que tu te rendes là-bas pour découvrir ce qu'il s'y passe."A\bTu peux te rendre là-bas en prenant le train à Safrania."F\bCerise: Tu peux aller à Galar en prenant le train à Safrania."s\bCerise: Alors tu as trouvé un Ronflex géant ? Bon travail. Je vais devoir faire des recherches là-dessus."�\bJe ne veux pas t'assommer avec un projet après l'autre. Pourquoi ne ferais-tu pas une pause en allant visiter la Zone de Combat à Hoenn ?">\bTu peux te rendre là-bas en prenant le bateau au port."O\bCerise: Goh m'a dit que tu avais remporté la Coupe Flute. Bon travail !"�\bTu viens juste de rater Goh, par contre. Il a entendu parler d'apparitions de Dracolosse et il est parti essayer d'en capturer un."�\bIl doit être sur l'Île des Dracolosse à l'heure qu'il est. Tu peux le rejoindre en prenant le bateau juste à l'ouest de celui où tu étais."�\bCerise: Ah, vous voilà ! J'ai une excellente nouvelle pour vous deux. J'ai réussi à obtenir deux billets pour le Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial."=\bGoh: Le Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial ? C'est quoi ?"�\bCerise: C'est un peu comme une Ligue, mais au lieu de se dérouler dans une seule région avec un Maître à la clé, ça se passe dans le monde entier pour couronner le Monarque."q\bLa phase finale commencent bientôt. Vous devriez vous dépêcher d'aller à Winscor avant de tout louper."P\bCerise: Comment était le combat ? J'espère que vous vous êtes amusés."�\bCette fois, j'ai besoin que vous vous rendiez tous les deux aux Ruines du Colosse, dans le Désert Délassant. Les Pokémon qui s'y trouvent pourraient avoir un lien avec ceux de Galar."=\bTu peux t'y rendre en passant par la Route 4, à Unys."�\bGoh: Ça à l'air d'être une bonne opportunité pour attraper quelques Pokémon. Je suis prêt si tu l'es. On y va maintenant ?"s\bCerise: Tu es prêt, \PN ? La nouvelle saison du Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial a officiellement commencé."7\bProcédons à ton inscription via ton Motismart."�Motismart: ...Inscription validée : Dresseur \PN. Classe Normale. Un adversaire proche, Vasquez, se trouve à l'Arène de Carmin sur Mer. Prêt pour le combat.".\bGoh: Woah, tu as déjà un adversaire ?"�\bCerise: Il y a déjà plus de 10 000 participants. C'est normal que tout le monde soit impatient de combattre. \PN, vas-y et rejoins-les."G\bCerise: \PN, vas-y et rejoins-les à l'arène de Carmin sur Mer."x\bCerise: Parfait, vous êtes là tous les deux. J'ai besoin que vous vous rendiez à l'Aire de Détente à Sinnoh."}\bDes rumeurs circulent au sujet d'un Pokémon mystérieux qui se cacherait dans un lac local. Va voir si tu peux le trouver."\\bCerise: Je suis contente que vous ayez pu trouver Magicarpe avant la Team Rocket. Il-"~Motismart : Annonce. Le Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial organise un Festival de Combat à Yantreizh, dans la région de Kalos."g\bGoh: C'est à Kalos. C'est un bonne opportunité d'attraper des Pokemon de la région. On y va ?"P\bCerise: Tu as fait ton entrée dans la Classe Super ? C'est fantastique !"�\bCerise: En parlant de ça, je crois que le Maître de Galar dispute un match bientôt. Tu devrais te rendre à Winscor pour aller voir ça."<\bGoh: Je suis prêt à y aller. Prêt à partir, \PN ?"�\bCerise: Alors, comment se passent tes combats ? Si tu veux faire une pause, sache que Goh est au Centre Pokémon en ce moment pour participer à un événement d'échange."K\bCerise: Je crois que Goh te cherchais dans le parc, juste derrière."F\bCerise: Tu as un match à Safrania ? Je ne te retiens pas plus."�\bCerise: Merci de nous avoir rejoints, \PN. Une tempête de sable s'est levée sur Lavandia. Les habitants ont dû être évacués à cause de cela."}\bCe n'est pas tout : un chant d'une beauté envoûtante s'élève de la tempête de sable et semble hypnotiser les citoyens."�\bGoh: Ça ressemble à une mission pour nous. \PN, je sais que tes derniers matchs ont été difficiles. Prêt à tenter le coup ?"�\bCerise: Merci à tous les deux de vous être occupés de ce Libégon. Je me demande ce qui a bien pu le pousser à agir ainsi avec la ville ?"�\bQuoi qu'il en soit, j'ai reçu un appel du Professeur Euphorbe pendant votre absence. Il aimerait que \PN vienne lui rendre visite à Alola. Goh, tu es également le bienvenu."O\bGoh: Merci pour l'invitation. \PN, je crois que je suis prêt. Tu l'es ?"/\bCerise: Comment se passent tes combats ?"B\bCerise: Goh t'attend sur la Route 10. C'est à l'est d'ici."�\bCerise: Goh m'a dit qu'Électhor vous avait donné du fil à retordre. Mais au moins, vous avez réussi à empêcher une nouvelle coupure de courant."V\bCerise: Vous devriez... \PN, c'est quoi cette lumière rouge qui vient de toi ?"^\bGoh: C'est le Poignet Dynamax. Mais on ne peut pas l'utiliser à l'extérieur de Galar."�\bCerise: C'est préoccupant. Tu devrais te rendre à Brasswick, dans la région de Galar, pour rencontrer la Professeure Magnolia. C'est la plus grande experte du Dynamax.":\bTu peux t'y rendre en prenant le train à Safrania."N\bCerise: Tu peux te rendre à Brasswick en prenant le train à Safrania."�\bCerise: Je suis ravi que vous ayez pu empêcher une catastrophe tous les deux. Prenez un peu de repos avant de reprendre vos combats."�\bCerise: Te voilà de retour. Goh s'est impatienté et n'a pas pu t'attendre. Il est parti pour l'Île Zéro. Tu peux t'y rendre en prenant le bateau tout au bout du port."z\bCerise: J'imagine que Mew n'était pas là-bas. C'est dommage, mais j'ai trouvé autre chose de très intéressant."}\bApparemment, on trouve des fossiles rares dans les Terres Sauvages. Vous devriez tous les deux aller mener l'enquête."l\bGoh: Je vais tous les attraper pour compléter encore plus le Pokédex. \PN, tu es prêt à y aller ?"\bCerise: Vous voilà enfin. Ma fille m'a rappelé l'existence de la Forêt de Lumirinthe et des Ponyta et Galopa qui y vivent."k\bJe me demandais si vous pourriez vous y rendre tous les deux pour voir si vous pouvez en trouver un."n\bTu devras partir vers l'ouest depuis Kickenham, puis remonter vers le nord-est à partir d'Old Chister."9\bGoh: Bien sûr, Professeur. \PN, prêt à partir ?"v\bCerise: Tu peux te rendre au Château de la Chevalerie en prenant le dirigeable à Illumis. Bon entraînement !"?\bCerise: Goh t'attends au laboratoire du Professeur Chen."�\bGoh: Professeur, j'ai reçu ma mission de qualification pour le Projet Mew. Je dois trouver un Feunard d'Alola au Mont Couronné."r\bCerise: Merveilleux. \PN, pourquoi ne pas l'accompagner ? Un peu de soutien moral est toujours le bienvenu.":\bGoh: Ce sera avec plaisir ! Tu es prêt à partir ?"�\bCerise: Je suis content que vous soyez de retour. Les habitants de Sinnoh sont en proie à de terribles cauchemars en ce moment. Je soupçonne qu'un Darkrai soit impliqué."z\bLes cauchemars se produisent aux alentours de Floraville. S'il vous plaît, allez voir ce qu'il se passe sur place."?\bGoh: Des cauchemars... Ça m'a l'air sérieux. Allons-y."3\bCerise: Goh t'attends au Désert Délassant."Hydragon"e\rMaman: \PN, qu'est-ce que tu penses de cet endroit ? Je sens que tout va super bien se passer."5\bGoh: Je me demande pourquoi Lugia était ici ?"[\rJ'ai entendu dire que le Professeur Cerise à une fille. Je me demande où elle est."\bEctoplasma",\bGoh: Je me demande ce que veux Sally."�\bGoh: Partout dans le monde, les Pokémon se transforment en Œufs. Nous devons régler ce problème avant qu'il ne soit trop tard."?\bGoh: Heureusement nous avons pu arrêter la Team Rocket."/\bGoh: Tu vas à Algatia ? Amuse-toi bien."L\bGoh: J'ai besoin de ton aide pour ma prochaine mission du Projet Mew."�\bL'objectif est de trouver un Artikodin. Je pense qu'il se cache aux Îles Écume. J'ai entendu dire qu'on peut s'y rendre depuis Cramois'Île."\bTu es prêt à partir ?"_\bGoh: Tu as un nouveau combat, n'est-ce pas ? Je vais t'encourager de toutes mes forces !"N\bGoh: Couronneige... Je me demande bien ce que nous allons y découvrir."h\bGoh: Partir de mon côté me terrifie. Mais je sais que c'est une expérience que je dois vivre.."\bPalarticho"0\bBonjour. Je suis Ren, et voici François.":\bJ'ai entendu dire que ce laboratoire était hanté."C\bCerise: Bonjour. J'ai une première mission à vous confier."f\bUne apparition massive d'Herbizarre a été signalée en ville. Allez sur place pour enquêter."c\bMais avant que vous partiez, j'ai quelque chose à vous donner qui devrait vous être utile."R\bSi tu te perds, tu peux l'utiliser et il t'indiquera où te rendre ensuite."-\bGoh: Merci, Professeur. \PN, allons-y."-\bIl était temps que cet endroit ouvre."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Motismart : Annonce. Nouveau match programmé pour le Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial. La rencontre aura lieu à la Ligue de Kalos contre Dracéna."OEctoplasma semble vous faire confiance. Voulez-vous le prendre avec vous ?"I\rBonjour. Je suis Chrysa, l'un des assistante du Professeur Cerise."4\rJe suis ravi que tu travailles ici avec nous.".\rC'était super de travailler avec vous.";\rJessie: Nous allons prendre tes Pokémon maintenant.".\bMiaouss: Tu n'as pas la moindre chance.".\bJames: N'essaie même pas de résister."\bQulbutoké: Qulbutoké !"\bCanarticho"o\bCerise: Alors comme ça, Goh et toi avez trouvé le Pokémon rare, Lugia ? C'est un véritable exploit !"l\bJ'ai une idée. Pourquoi ne resteriez-vous pas ici tous les deux en tant qu'assistants de recherche ?"(\bGoh: Vraiment ? Ce serait super !"X\rMaman: \PN, c'est génial. Je laisse Mimey ici pour qu'il puisse veiller sur toi."D\rJe n'aurais jamais pensé que cet endroit ouvrirais vraiment."G\bGoh: C'est la première fois que je vois une apparition massive."3\bGoh: Je ne suis jamais allé à Galar avant."`\bGoh: Le Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial... Ça me semble être pile dans tes cordes, \PN."<\bGoh: Je vais attraper une tonne de nouveaux Pokémon."C\bGoh: Je suis sûr que tu vas assurer pour ton premier match."-\bGoh: Trouvons ce mystérieux Pokémon."@\bGoh: Je suis content que nous ayons pu trouver Magicarpe."3\bGoh: Tu étais super pour ton premier match."8\bGoh: Je me demande ce qu'il se passe à Lavandia."(\bGoh: Ce Libégon ne rigolait pas."W\bGoh: C'était génial, Alola. On devrait peut-être y retourner un de ces jours."S\bGoh: Je me demande bien ce qui fait briller ton Poignet Dynamax comme ça..."`\bGoh: Quel voyage c'était... Je suis content de pouvoir reprendre mes recherches sur Mew."6\bGoh: Mewtwo m'a donné matière à réfléchir."/\bGoh: J'ai attrapé beaucoup de Pokémon."�\bGoh: Le Château de la Chevalerie me semble être un excellent moyen d'entraîner certains de mes Pokémon. Je vais peut-être t'y accompagner."U\bGoh: Le Projet Mew m'inquiète... Est-ce que je serai vraiment à la hauteur ?"A\bGoh: Darkrai à l'air dangereux. On devrais se dépêcher."Magnéti"b\bCerise: Merci à toutes et à tous d'être venus pour l'inauguration du Laboratoire Cerise."�\bCerise: Avec votre soutien, je suis certain que nous découvrirons tout ce qu'il y a à savoir sur ce monde et les Pokémon qui l'habitent. Et..."H\bOh ! Il semblerait qu'un Pokémon rare ait été aperçu au port."f\b\PN, ça me semble être pile dans tes cordes. Pourquoi n'irais-tu pas voir ça de plus près ?"f\bJ'avais l'habitude de passer devant cet endroit la nuit. Ça me flanquait toujours la trouille."�Motismart : Annonce. Un nouvel adversaire a été trouvé pour le Tournoi du Couronnement Mondial. Maike, à Safrania, est prête au combat."Oui"Non;[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: Yes? What do you want?",\rChloe: What should I do with my life?"7\bOak: I'm looking forward to seeing your results."-\rDo you think he's taking applications?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: How did the Project Mew mission go? While you were gone, a call from Opal came in. She'd like you to visit her gym in Ballonlea."=\bGoh: Hopefully it's not for more quizzes. Ready to go?"�\bCerise: \PN, it's terrible. Pokémon all over the world are turning back into Eggs. Nobody knows what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"_\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response. Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep City.",\bCerise: Good luck in your next match.":\bCerise: I heard Goh was in Lilycove City right now."t\bCerise: An unknown Pokémon has been spotted in the Crown Tundra. I'd like the both of you to investigate it."6\bThe train station in Wyndon can take you there."D\bCerise: You need to visit Professor Oak. Give him my regards."2\bCerise: Goh is looking for you in the park."B\bCerise: The Masters Tournament has begun. I believe in you."B\bCerise: I watched all of your battles. You did a great job."e\bGoh is somewhere in the city waiting for you. He had something he wanted to talk to you about."c\bCerise: So the two of you are leaving? As much as I'll miss you, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"h\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city?"�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar"%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun.">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this is Francois."+\bI heard this lab used to be haunted."B\bCerise: Good morning. I have your first assignment for you."X\bA mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Head out and investigate it."L\bBut before you go, I have something that should help the both of you."M\bIf you get lost, you can use it and it will tell you where to go next."7\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. \PN, let's get going.")\bIt's about time this place opened."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at the Kalos League against Drasna."IGengar seems like it trusts you. Would you like to take it with you?"?\rHello. I'm Chrysa, one of Professor Cerise's assistants."4\rI'm excited to have you working here with us."%\rIt was great working with you."1\rJessie: We'll be taking your Pokémon now."(\bMeowth: You don't stand a chance."+\bJames: Don't even try and resist us."\bWobbuffet: Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"^\bCerise: So you and Goh found the rare Pokémon, Lugia. That's quite the achomplishment."T\bI have an idea. Why don't the two of you stay here as my research assistants?"(\bGoh: Really? That would be great!"G\rMom: \PN, how exciting. I'll leave Mimey here to watch over you."6\rI never thought this place would actually open."3\bGoh: I've never seen a mass outbreak before.",\bGoh: I've never been to Galar before."N\bGoh: The World Coronation Series. That sounds right up your alley, \PN."5\bGoh: I'm going to catch a ton of new Pokémon."1\bGoh: You'll do great in your first battle."0\bGoh: Let's find that mysterious Pokémon."4\bGoh: I'm happy we were able to find Magikarp."*\bGoh: You did great in your matches."1\bGoh: I wonder what's going on in Mauville."$\bGoh: That Flygon was intense."<\bGoh: Alola was fun. Maybe we could go again sometime.">\bGoh: I wonder what's causing your Dynamax Band to glow?"V\bGoh: What a journey that was. I'm glad to be getting back to searching for Mew."0\bGoh: Mewtwo gave me a lot to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"NoIu;␀3[[%")\rAre you good enough to face Misty?"F\rYou have to face other Trainers to see how good you really are."\bClauncher!"\rPolitoed"Lily: We run the Gym here."\bPsyduck"\rGoldeen"!Violet: We run the Gym here."\bAzurill"\bCorsola"V\bMisty uses Water type Pokémon. They are weak against Grass and Electric types."s\bThey are strong against Fire, Ground, and Rock. Fire, Ice, Steel, and Water moves also don't do much damage."\bHorsea"\bGyarados!"\bLet's battle!"\\bMisty is a Trainer who's going to keep improving. She won't lose to someone like you!"Starmie"g\rMisty: Hi, you're a new face! Only those Trainers who have a policy about Pokémon can turn pro."C\rMy policy is an all out offensive with Water- type Pokémon!".\r