[["\rChansey"'\rWe don't get many visitors here."X\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Cancel]"`\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Cancel]"j\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter, Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Celadon, Cancel]"q\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Celadon,Fuchsia, Cancel]"z\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Celadon,Fuchsia, Cinnabar,Cancel]"\rMime!"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"Yes"No["\rLeveinard"6\rNous n'avons pas beaucoup de visiteurs par ici."e\rMon M. Mime peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1,Jadielle,  Argenta, Azuria, Carmin sur Mer, Annuler]"o\rMon M. Mime peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1,Jadielle,  Argenta, Azuria, Carmin sur Mer, Safrania, Annuler]"|\rMon M. Mime peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1,Jadielle,  Argenta, Azuria, Carmin sur Mer, Safrania, Céladopole, Annuler]"�\rMon M. Mime peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1,Jadielle,  Argenta, Azuria, Carmin sur Mer, Safrania, Céladopole, Parmanie, Annuler]"�\rMon M. Mime peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1,Jadielle,  Argenta, Azuria, Carmin sur Mer, Safrania, Céladopole, Parmanie,  Cramois'Île, Annuler]"\rMime !"/\rBonjour et bienvenue au Centre Pokémon."B\rNous redonnons toute leur santé à vos Pokémon fatigués."/\rVoulez-vous que je soigne vos Pokémon ?"B\rD'accord, je prends vos Pokémon pendant quelques secondes."C\rVos Pokémon semblent avoir été infectés par le Pokérus."\rOn sait peu de choses sur le Pokérus, si ce n'est qu'il s'agit de formes de vie microscopiques qui s'attachent aux Pokémon."U\rOn raconte que les Pokémon infectés se développent exceptionnellement bien."!\rMerci pour votre patience."4\rVos Pokémon sont de nouveau en pleine forme."#\rNous espérons vous revoir !"C\rPour commencer, vous devriez remettre vos Pokémon d'aplomb."B\rVos Pokémon ont été soignés et sont en parfaite santé.")\rNous vous souhaitons de réussir !"Oui"Non;["\rChansey"'\rWe don't get many visitors here."X\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Cancel]"`\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Cancel]"j\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter, Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Celadon, Cancel]"q\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Celadon,Fuchsia, Cancel]"z\rMy Mr. Mime can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Cerulean,Vermilion,Saffron,Celadon,Fuchsia, Cinnabar,Cancel]"\rMime!"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"Yes"NoIu;␀D[[*"1\bHe didn't know about the teleporters, huh?"<\bPlease don't tell him. He might faint from the truth."-\rHello there. You've been invited, huh?"K\rI heard the owner built this secret club for years. Impressive, huh?"B\rOf course, you decide if this is worth the effort. Tee hee."E\bHuff... puff... I have heard rumours. This untold sanctuary..."`\bThe secret hideout where the strongest trainers gather... puff... where legends are born."U\bI climbed so far and high... huff... Finally, I'm here... I need a breather..."<\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! We meet again! WAHAHAHA!"L\bDon't question how I got here so fast. Don't rack your brain over it.">\bAnyway, WELCOME TO THE GRANDEUR CLUB! WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"�\bI have been hearing lots of feedback from everyone, from finishing all of the post game events, waiting for Galar, yadda yadda."u\bPersonally, I was looking for a post-game challenge too. So I built this, with the help of my co-founder, Luc!"|\bBy the looks of it, you ain't no simpleton either! You're like me, somebody looking for a real challenge, am I right?"n\bI guess I am, I can practically smell the excitement on you. Well then, without further ado, take this."M\bLuc and I will be looking forward to your performance here. MUAHAHAHA!"T\bTaking a breather after a loss. It feels sad yet refreshing at the same time."_\bEvery time I go in, it's always a brand-new experience, waiting for me to break through!"\bGood luck!"/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon..."�\bGood view, isn't it? The sunshine's embrace makes you warm. The cool breeze refreshes your senses. What a great place for good ol' lad to tell his legacy."�\bA minor mishap made me bedridden and out of action from work. The pandemic also kept me away from my loved one. I got bored till I found this world. 2 months of running around, gathering allies and defeating foes to the finish line."�\bI craved for more and this world deserved more, but the Driftveil Battle House wasn't a kicker for me. I NEEDED MORE. I seeked. I learned. Finally, I discovered this beautiful land. And with my friends, we're on a mission."�\bTop trainers across the multiverse gathered in the Grandeur Lounge to pit against each other. Challenges expanded and became more fleshed out."{\bBut no, I am still not satisfied. I need to break the limit. I need to give them what they want. I need the BIG BAD."�\bSo we experimented on all possible limits. We broke the constraints. And I had bigger, loftier dreams. Paldea! We fed our desires... till now."p\bEducation. Career. Marriage. Kids. Commitment arises. That's when I knew, our time was limited. Hahahaha."�\bThe world that Reinhart formed. The systems that Luc-ker expanded on. The peak that I envisioned. 5 years. It finally ends here. This is probably the final legacy."�\bMy legacy could've been just been between a few chosen ones. But Reinhart trusted and passed the baton to us to continue this journey in the ways we can, and I am appreciative of that."C\bSo yeah. That's it. Thanks for listening to my yapping. Heh."N\bWere you expecting more? Have you met Luc and Foul through this system?"\b......................"Q\bI guess I could spare some time for you. I did promise the BIG BAD to you."4\bThis shouldn't be difficult for you. Alright?"K\bYou did it. You defeated the BIG BAD. I'm truly proud of you. *sigh*"d\bThis is really finally all over for me. Let me bring you back. And I will go back to my spot."\bAnd goodbye.[*"A\bIl n'était pas au courant pour les téléporteurs, hein ?"V\bNe lui dis pas, je t'en prie. Il pourrait s'évanouir en apprenant la vérité.">\rOh, bonjour. Tu as reçu une invitation, n'est-ce pas ?"o\rJ'ai entendu dire que le propriétaire a mis des années à bâtir ce club secret. Impressionnant, non ?"K\rBien sûr, c'est à toi de décider si ça en vaut la peine. Hi hi !"U\bOuf... Ha... J'ai entendu des rumeurs. Ce sanctuaire dont personne ne parle..."u\bLe repaire secret où se rassemblent les dresseurs les plus puissants... Ha... Là où naissent les légendes."k\bJ'ai grimpé si loin et si haut... Ouf... Enfin, j'y suis... J'ai besoin de reprendre mon souffle..."H\bHé, surprise, surprise ! \PN ! On se retrouve enfin ! WAHAHAHA !"p\bNe cherche pas à savoir comment je suis venu si rapidement. Inutile de te torturer l'esprit pour si peu."J\bQuoi qu'il en soit, BIENVENUE AU CLUB GRANDEUR ! WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA !"�\bJ'ai eu plein de retours de la part de tout le monde : entre ceux qui ont fini tout le post-game et ceux qui attendent Galar, et patati et patata."�\bPersonnellement, je cherchais aussi un défi post-game. Alors j'ai construit cet endroit avec l'aide de mon cofondateur, Luc !"u\bÀ vue de nez, tu n'es pas n'importe qui non plus ! Tu es comme moi, tu cherches un vrai défi, je me trompe ?"n\bJ'imagine que oui, je peux presque sentir ton excitation ! Bien, alors sans plus attendre, prends ceci."D\bLuc et moi avons hâte de voir tes prouesses ici. MUAHAHAHA !"n\bJe souffle un peu après une défaite. C'est triste, mais ça remet les idées en place en même temps."{\bChaque fois que j'y entre, c'est une expérience totalement nouvelle qui m'attend. Je n'ai plus qu'à trouver la faille !"\bBonne chance !"/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon..."�\bJolie vue, n'est-ce pas ? La caresse du soleil réchauffe le cœur. La brise fraîche éveille les sens. Quel endroit idéal pour qu'un vieil homme te raconte sa légende."7\bUn petit accident m'a cloué au lit et empêché de travailler. La pandémie m'a aussi tenu éloigné de la personne que j'aime. Je m'ennuyais à mourir, jusqu'à ce que je découvre ce monde. Deux mois à parcourir les routes, à rassembler des alliés et à vaincre des ennemis jusqu'à la ligne d'arrivée."
\bJ'en voulais plus, et ce monde méritait mieux, mais le Logis de Combat de Port Yoneuve ne m'a pas transcendé. IL M'EN FALLAIT PLUS. J'ai cherché. J'ai appris. Et j'ai fini par découvrir cette terre magnifique. Désormais, avec mes amis, nous avons une mission."�\bLes meilleurs dresseurs de tout le multivers se sont réunis au Salon Grandeur pour s'affronter. Les défis ont pris de l'ampleur et sont devenus bien plus complexes."�\bMais non, ça ne me suffit toujours pas. Il faut que je brise les barrières. Je dois leur offrir ce qu'ils réclament. Il me faut l'ULTIME ANTAGONISTE."�\bNous avons donc testé toutes les limites possibles. Nous avons brisé toutes les contraintes. J'avais des rêves encore plus grands, plus nobles. Paldea ! Nous avons nourri nos désirs... jusqu'à aujourd'hui."�\bLes études. La carrière. Le mariage. Les enfants. Les responsabilités s'accumulent. C'est là que j'ai compris que notre temps était compté. Hahahaha."�\bLe monde façonné par Reinhart. Les systèmes développés par Luc-ker. Le sommet que j'avais imaginé. 5 ans. Tout s'achève enfin ici. C'est probablement notre tout dernier héritage."�\bMon héritage aurait pu rester confiné à quelques élus. Mais Reinhart nous a fait confiance et nous a passé le relais pour continuer ce voyage à notre manière, et j'en suis très reconnaissant."R\bVoilà, c'est la fin de l'histoire. Merci de m'avoir écouté radoter. Heh."]\bTu t'attendais à plus ? Est-ce que tu as déjà croisé Luc et Foul via ce système ?"\b......................"w\bJe peux bien te consacrer quelques instants de plus. Je t'avais promis l'ULTIME ANTAGONISTE, et je tiens parole."J\bÇa ne devrait pas être trop difficile pour toi. On est d'accord ?"_\bC'est fait. Tu as terrassé l'ULTIME ANTAGONISTE. Tu fais ma fierté, vraiment. *soupir*"y\bCette fois, c'est vraiment fini pour moi. Laisse-moi te raccompagner. Quant à moi, je vais retourner à ma place."\bJe te dis au revoir.;[*"1\bHe didn't know about the teleporters, huh?"<\bPlease don't tell him. He might faint from the truth."-\rHello there. You've been invited, huh?"K\rI heard the owner built this secret club for years. Impressive, huh?"B\rOf course, you decide if this is worth the effort. Tee hee."E\bHuff... puff... I have heard rumours. This untold sanctuary..."`\bThe secret hideout where the strongest trainers gather... puff... where legends are born."U\bI climbed so far and high... huff... Finally, I'm here... I need a breather..."<\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! We meet again! WAHAHAHA!"L\bDon't question how I got here so fast. Don't rack your brain over it.">\bAnyway, WELCOME TO THE GRANDEUR CLUB! WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"�\bI have been hearing lots of feedback from everyone, from finishing all of the post game events, waiting for Galar, yadda yadda."u\bPersonally, I was looking for a post-game challenge too. So I built this, with the help of my co-founder, Luc!"|\bBy the looks of it, you ain't no simpleton either! You're like me, somebody looking for a real challenge, am I right?"n\bI guess I am, I can practically smell the excitement on you. Well then, without further ado, take this."M\bLuc and I will be looking forward to your performance here. MUAHAHAHA!"T\bTaking a breather after a loss. It feels sad yet refreshing at the same time."_\bEvery time I go in, it's always a brand-new experience, waiting for me to break through!"\bGood luck!"/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon..."�\bGood view, isn't it? The sunshine's embrace makes you warm. The cool breeze refreshes your senses. What a great place for good ol' lad to tell his legacy."�\bA minor mishap made me bedridden and out of action from work. The pandemic also kept me away from my loved one. I got bored till I found this world. 2 months of running around, gathering allies and defeating foes to the finish line."�\bI craved for more and this world deserved more, but the Driftveil Battle House wasn't a kicker for me. I NEEDED MORE. I seeked. I learned. Finally, I discovered this beautiful land. And with my friends, we're on a mission."�\bTop trainers across the multiverse gathered in the Grandeur Lounge to pit against each other. Challenges expanded and became more fleshed out."{\bBut no, I am still not satisfied. I need to break the limit. I need to give them what they want. I need the BIG BAD."�\bSo we experimented on all possible limits. We broke the constraints. And I had bigger, loftier dreams. Paldea! We fed our desires... till now."p\bEducation. Career. Marriage. Kids. Commitment arises. That's when I knew, our time was limited. Hahahaha."�\bThe world that Reinhart formed. The systems that Luc-ker expanded on. The peak that I envisioned. 5 years. It finally ends here. This is probably the final legacy."�\bMy legacy could've been just been between a few chosen ones. But Reinhart trusted and passed the baton to us to continue this journey in the ways we can, and I am appreciative of that."C\bSo yeah. That's it. Thanks for listening to my yapping. Heh."N\bWere you expecting more? Have you met Luc and Foul through this system?"\b......................"Q\bI guess I could spare some time for you. I did promise the BIG BAD to you."4\bThis shouldn't be difficult for you. Alright?"K\bYou did it. You defeated the BIG BAD. I'm truly proud of you. *sigh*"d\bThis is really finally all over for me. Let me bring you back. And I will go back to my spot."\bAnd goodbye.Iu;␀H[[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are no apricorns."(\bPainting. What a wonderful thing."C\bDo you know of the move Sketch? It can copy almost any move."\bLook at my Pokémon."\bI think I fit in." \rHave you seen my brother?"%\rI need to return his Arcanine.["=\rJ'ai rencontré le garçon le plus mignon aujourd'hui.".\rJ'espère que je le verrais à nouveau."%\bTu aimes les sources chaudes ?"$\bJe devrais y aller, bientôt."m\rIl y a un arbre à Noigrumes par ici. Tu penses qu'on pourrait s'en servir comme combustible un jour ?"/\rLes types Éléctrik sont les meilleurs."Il n'y à pas de Noigrume."0\bLa peinture... Quelle chose merveilleuse."d\bTu connais l'attaque Gribouillage ? Elle permet de copier presque n'importe quelle capacité."\bRegarde mon Pokémon."*\bJe pense que j'ai trouvé ma place."$\rTu aurais pas vu mon frère ?"&\rJe dois lui rendre son Arcanin.;[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are no apricorns."(\bPainting. What a wonderful thing."C\bDo you know of the move Sketch? It can copy almost any move."\bLook at my Pokémon."\bI think I fit in." \rHave you seen my brother?"%\rI need to return his Arcanine.Iu;␀�[["6\bI came to pray for my dearly departed Clefairy."F\rPokémon Tower was erected in the memory of Pokémon that died."\rI am a Channeler."H\rThere are spirits up to mischief. I sense that high in the Tower."A\bI can't stop worrying about everything that happened here." \bWant to learn Worry Seed?"\bDon't stress it."(\rMy Growlithe...\nWhy did you die?"$\rDid you come to pay respects?"(\rBless your Pokémon-loving heart.["A\bJe suis venu prier pour mon Mélofée qui nous a quittés."N\rLa Tour Pokémon a été érigée à la mémoire des Pokémon disparus."\rJe suis une Exorciste."Z\rDes esprits cherchent à nuire. Je sens leur présence, tout là-haut dans la Tour."V\bJe ne peux pas m'empêcher de m'inquiéter après tout ce qui s'est passé ici."&\bTu veux apprendre Soucigraine ?"!\bNe te prends pas la tête.",\rMon Caninos...\nPourquoi es-tu mort ?"%\rE-tu venu pour te recueillir ?"7\rBéni soit ton cœur qui aime tant les Pokémon.;["6\bI came to pray for my dearly departed Clefairy."F\rPokémon Tower was erected in the memory of Pokémon that died."\rI am a Channeler."H\rThere are spirits up to mischief. I sense that high in the Tower."A\bI can't stop worrying about everything that happened here." \bWant to learn Worry Seed?"\bDon't stress it."(\rMy Growlithe...\nWhy did you die?"$\rDid you come to pay respects?"(\rBless your Pokémon-loving heart.Iu;␀_[[",\rBe careful.\nThe upstairs is haunted.[",\rFais attention.\nL'étage est hanté.;[",\rBe careful.\nThe upstairs is haunted.Iu;␀[["\rLeave!"	Ugh!"6\rThe ghosts here are very mischievous. Be alert."5\rWhat are you doing here? Escape while you can!"I warned you.":\rThe others above...\nThey must have been possessed."\rGive me your soul!"NO!"\rSorry! I was possessed!["\rVa-t'en !"
