on Stadium is crammed full with spectators. You can already hear cheers in anticipation of the heated battles."G\bThis is the Pokémon World Coronation Series Masters Tournament."�\bThe biggest tournament in history, where the highest ranked eight, the Masters Eight, determine the greatest Pokémon battler."G\bAnd so, which of them will be crowned the Championships Monarch?".\bNow, let's introduce the Masters Eight."H\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me for your battle against Steven."I\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me for your battle against Cynthia."E\bWe are busy setting up for the finals. Please come back later."O\bIn the meantime, could you help us deal with some commotion in the city?"F\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me for your battle against Leon."N\bSteven: So it will be a battle between us. I wish you the best of luck."I\bLance just became Champion. He's on a roll and he'll win here too."%\bI want to battle Leon one day."g\rDynamax is something that can be done at this stadium. It's not something you can do everywhere."6\bLeon is the clear winner. Plus, he's very cool."%\bGoh: Leon seems really strong."I\bGoh: That was a great battle, \PN. Should we head back to the lab?"Z\rCynthia: I believe you'll do quite well here. I'm also happy to see Iris qualified."@\rCynthia: Are you prepared for our battle? I certainly am.")\rCynthia: I'll be cheering for you."<\bDiantha has to win. She deserves it for her strategy."O\rThe battle against Lance was intense. I couldn't take my eyes off of it."
