\rPid"^\rWelcome to the Pokémon Park! Here you can walk around and interact with some Pokémon."%Lapras seems to trust you a bit.",Would you like to take Lapras with you?"\bButterfree."\bArcan!"\bSlow..."\bHey leave us alone."Lay off.")\bWe just want to use that Pokémon."\bTaur!"\bWeepinbell"\rI'm taking a break."\bDoduo!"Pokémon Park"]\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Exit]"c\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Navel,Exit]"t\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Navel,Seven Grapefruit,Exit]"|\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Navel,Seven Grapefruit,Trovita,Exit]"�\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Navel,Seven Grapefruit,Trovita,Ascorbia,Exit]"�\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Navel,Seven Grapefruit,Trovita,Ascorbia,Kumquat,Exit]"�\bWelcome to the Lapras Launch. Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Valencia,Mikan,Navel,Seven Grapefruit,Trovita,Ascorbia,Kumquat,Pummelo,Exit]"\bThis is our prey."Whatever."9\bWe don't have any other way to travel the islands."\rI love coming here."\bArbok"\bWow! You're from Kanto?"&\bI've always wanted to go there!"\bPika!"\bThis is our Lapras!"Stop messing with us."\bFine it's yours."-\bEvery time I come I see something new."Yes"NoIu;␀�	[["W\bPeople kept catching the Pokémon in the park, so a rule was made to prevent it."1\rOh, you're going to try out the Gyms here?"'\rTake this then. It may help you."V\rThe closest Gym to here is the one that belongs to Cissy. It's on Mikan Island."G\bMy house feels a little different. I just don't know what it is."$\bI'm the Pokémon Move Maniac."?\bI know every single move that Pokémon learn growing up.",\bI'm also a collector of Heart Scales."F\bIf you bring me one, I'll teach a move to one of your Pokémon."?\bOh! That's it! That's an honest to goodness Heart Scale!"F\bLet me guess, you want me to teach one of your Pokémon a move?"%\bWhich Pokémon needs tutoring?"K\bIf your Pokémon need to learn a move, come back with a Heart Scale."?\bHunh? There isn't a single move that I can teach an Egg.":\bNo way, I don't want to go near a Shadow Pokémon.."\bSorry..."I\bIt doesn't appear as if I have any move I can teach to your \v[3]."/\bWhich move should I teach to your \v[3]?"1\PN handed over one Heart Scale in exchange."\bThe Park here is so fun!"+\bToo bad you can't catch any of them."Yes"No["y\bLes gens n'arrêtaient pas de capturer les Pokémon du parc, alors une règle a été instaurée pour l'empêcher.".\rOh, tu vas tenter les arènes du coin ?"/\rPrends ça, alors. Ça pourrait t'aider."`\rL'arène la plus proche d'ici est celle de Cissy. Elle se trouve sur l'Île Dame Blanche."M\bMa maison me semble un peu différente. Je ne sais juste pas pourquoi."*\bJe suis le Maniaque des Capacités."P\bJe connais chaque capacité qu'un Pokémon peut apprendre en grandissant."9\bJe suis aussi un collectionneur d'Écailles Cœur."T\bSi tu m'en apportes une, j'enseignerai une capacité à l'un de tes Pokémon."=\bOh ! Ça y est ! C'est une véritable Écaille Cœur !"Y\bLaisse-moi deviner, tu veux que j'apprenne une capacité à l'un de tes Pokémon ?"*\bQuel Pokémon a besoin d'un cours ?"]\bSi tes Pokémon ont besoin d'apprendre une capacité, reviens avec une Écaille Cœur."K\bHein ? Il n'y a aucune capacité que je puisse enseigner à un Œuf."G\bPas question, je ne veux pas m'approcher d'un Pokémon Obscur..."\bDésolé..."I\bIl ne semble pas que j'aie de capacité à enseigner à ton \v[3]."8\bQuelle capacité dois-je enseigner à ton \v[3] ?"1\PN a donné une Écaille Cœur en échange."*\bLe parc ici est tellement amusant !"1\bDommage qu'on ne puisse en capturer aucun."Oui"Non;["W\bPeople kept catching the Pokémon in the park, so a rule was made to prevent it."1\rOh, you're going to try out the Gyms here?"'\rTake this then. It may help you."V\rThe closest Gym to here is the one that belongs to Cissy. It's on Mikan Island."G\bMy house feels a little different. I just don't know what it is."$\bI'm the Pokémon Move Maniac."?\bI know every single move that Pokémon learn growing up.",\bI'm also a collector of Heart Scales."F\bIf you bring me one, I'll teach a move to one of your Pokémon."?\bOh! That's it! That's an honest to goodness Heart Scale!"F\bLet me guess, you want me to teach one of your Pokémon a move?"%\bWhich Pokémon needs tutoring?"K\bIf your Pokémon need to learn a move, come back with a Heart Scale."?\bHunh? There isn't a single move that I can teach an Egg.":\bNo way, I don't want to go near a Shadow Pokémon.."\bSorry..."I\bIt doesn't appear as if I have any move I can teach to your \v[3]."/\bWhich move should I teach to your \v[3]?"1\PN handed over one Heart Scale in exchange."\bThe Park here is so fun!"+\bToo bad you can't catch any of them."Yes"NoIu;␀"[["8\bDespite the park, we don't get too many visitors."1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rChansey"Yes"No["?\bMalgré le parc, nous n'avons pas beaucoup de visiteurs."/\rBonjour et bienvenue au Centre Pokémon."B\rNous redonnons toute leur santé à vos Pokémon fatigués."/\rVoulez-vous que je soigne vos Pokémon ?"B\rD'accord, je prends vos Pokémon pendant quelques secondes."C\rVos Pokémon semblent avoir été infectés par le Pokérus."\rOn sait peu de choses sur le Pokérus, si ce n'est qu'il s'agit de formes de vie microscopiques qui s'attachent aux Pokémon."U\rOn raconte que les Pokémon infectés se développent exceptionnellement bien."!\rMerci pour votre patience."4\rVos Pokémon sont de nouveau en pleine forme."#\rNous espérons vous revoir !"C\rPour commencer, vous devriez remettre vos Pokémon d'aplomb."B\rVos Pokémon ont été soignés et sont en parfaite santé.")\rNous vous souhaitons de réussir !"\rLeveinard"Oui"Non;["8\bDespite the park, we don't get too many visitors."1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rChansey"Yes"NoIu;␀J[[�"Choose your path."U\bMilo: Well then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"h\rNessa: No matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."i\bKabu: In the end, the match will be decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."G\rBea: I think I'll test that unshakable spirit of yours, shall I?"#\bAllister: H...here...I go..."Y\rOpal: I'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."4\bGordie: Size means strength! Savor this pain!"p\rMelony: All righty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."Q\bAvery: Prepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"-\rKlara: You'll never know what hit you!"O\bPiers: Get ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"M\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"P\bRaihan: Bring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"^\bMustard: Don't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"n\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolutely champion time!"<\bHop: So let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"a\bBede: I suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how pathetic you are and how strong I am."U\rMarnie: It'd be no fun if things ended quick... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"M\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna give it a taste test?"B\rGloria: Ok, wait no further! All pumped up and ready to go!"\\rMagnolia: So, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."(\rSonia: Let's give it our all now!"a\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, then Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"�\bRose: I saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: So let's have a fun and intense battle that both our teams can really enjoy!"k\bLian: I'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or face the wrath of my Pokemon!"1\rArezu: Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"3\rCalaba: Now let's not be distracted further."0\bIscan: N-now, you insist... We can begin."6\rPalina: Without any further, show me your team."1\bMelli: Accept your loss and out of my way!"p\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory loose... Would you honor me with a battle?"F\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win me first!"d\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"E\rCharm: I'm the eldest Fortune, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"I\rClover: I'm the middle Fortune, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"Y\rCoin: I'm the youngest Fortune, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."v\bBeni: You, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to molder all these long years!"P\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every moves!"c\bKamado: We will let fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh. I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"N\rIrida: Let's compare what we know, whose's world is vast in comparison."\\rCyllene: You know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."4\bRei: Now it's time for our partners to shine."=\rAkari: Here I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"x\bLaventon: Come now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"f\rCogita: I will have to pardon this only time, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."f\bVolo: TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"S\bMilo: Hmmm? Oh, you must be one of those challengers, right? My name's Milo."b\bWe're gonna be as tough as weeds! But... that's not gonna keep you down! What a proper job!"O\bWell then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"�\bMilo: Battling with you seems to perk my Grass- type Pokémon right up! I hope that has been a fulfilling Pokémon battle for you too!"3\bWe'll be cheering you on from the bleachers!"o\rNessa: You're one of the ones endorsed by Hitsu, right? You've become something of a hot topic among us."{\rI think you've already realized, but I'm Nessa. I don't doubt that your mind as a Pokémon Trainer must be quite refined."e\rBut no matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."T\rNessa: Your teamwork was just flawless! It's enough to make me a bit jealous."O\rRide that current all the way to the end! Give the crowd what they want!"\bKabu: Every Trainer and Pokémon trains hard in pursuit of victory. But that means your opponent is also working hard to win."q\bI was training right up until the last moment so that I can guarantee you the best match when we face off!"b\bBut in the end, the match is decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."r\bKabu: Clearly, your talent surpassed my many years of experience. I'm glad I could also feel my own growth."`\bAnd I plan to keep growing and battling, until I become an old coot that nobody can beat!"\\rBea: One has to be careful not to let a single victory lull oneself into complacency."Z\rDo you also have an unshakable spirit that won't be moved, no matter what you face?"0\rI think I'll just test that out, shall I?"<\rBea: Facing you gave me all the explanation I needed."k\rBea: It's good to be unshakable in the face of battle. But it's good to be moved by battle, as well."\bAllister: ......Oh. You.")\b...I'm Allister. ...You look well."\bH-here... I go..."<\bAllister: ...That was ace. I will rem... ember you..."%\bG-give it your best out there."�\rOpal: There you are, child. Though you are really lacking in the color pink, you seem like a fine candidate to be my successor."p\rMy morning tea is finally kicking in, and I suppose it's a bit late to introduce myself, but... I'm Opal."S\rI'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."}\rOpal: Still not what I'm looking for... Oh, don't worry yourself about it, child. It's just a matter of my preference."d\rIt's time for me to step out of the spotlight soon. For young, fresh talents to really shine."[\bGordie: The name's Gordie. I admit I feel a little bad for doing this to you, but..."U\bI'm going to use this match to show the crowd that my Pokémon are unbeatable!",\bSize means strength! Savor this pain!"K\bGordie: That was... impressive. Rules are rules. You get to move on."T\bI pride myself on my solid Pokémon. I just need to train harder, that's all."N\rMelony: I am Melony. Well, you'll find my battle style is quite severe."O\rIf You're not careful, I could sweep your feet right out from under you."f\rAlrighty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."w\rMelony: Of course seeing my Pokémon lose is sad, but to meet someone so young with such ability is quite grand."6\rGive the next one a right thrashing, would you?"B\bAvery: Quite the commendable punctuality. My name is Avery."z\bI don't think you're quite up to snuff... And it's up to me, as an elegant adult, to make sure you get the message."J\bPrepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"+\bAvery: Improbable... No, impossible!"P\bPerhaps I am just an average man who gave everything he possibly could..."d\rKlara: Aha, there you are, right on time too! I'm the colorful, caring and charismatic Klara!"h\r......What's with the silence? Am I being mocked... by a kid?! Gosh, you're a pain in the neck..."&\rYou'll never know what hit you!"K\rKlara: Huh?! No no no! NO no no! There must be some kind of mistake!"M\rAaagh! Why can't I win?! All that effort, and nothing to show for it?!"]\bPiers: *sigh*... So you're finally here, huh? Reckoned nobody was comin' to challenge."~\bThe only thing a humble singer can do is sing a humble song. I still hope you enjoy the battle, though you know you'll lose!"H\bGet ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"J\bPiers: Piers doesn't do encores, but I admit I'm tempted right now."2\bLet's meet up again for a battle some time!"J\bPeony: Gahahaha! Aren't you the brave one, pickin' a fight with me!"@\bCan't say I hate you buttin' in here... The name's Peony!"F\bBrace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"Q\bPeony: Gahahaaa! Look at me, takin' a thrashin' from a youngster like you!"[\bThat was one ultra-mega-heated final battle! Hats off to you. In more ways than one!"h\bRaihan: Oh! If it isn't the Trainer endorsed by the Hitsu! Let's see... What was your name again?"r\bAh, right! \PN! And if Hitsu himself recognized your potential... Then I guess you'll be quite the Trainer."H\bBring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"|\bRaihan: In the aftermath of that furious battle... I feel as pure and refreshed as when the sky clears after a storm."V\bI might have lost, but I still look good. Maybe I should snap a quick selfie..."\\bMustard: Why, hello there! I'm pleased as cheese that you could join me for a battle."B\bYou seem to be the hardworking type too! My name's Mustard!"U\bDon't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"|\bMustard: Strength ebbs and flows in an endless cycle. One moment you grasp it, and the next, it slips from your hand."o\bYou young folks grow so fast! It never ceases to amaze me. Congratulations, from the bottom of my heart!"W\bLeon: It probably goes without saying, but... hello! I'm Galar's Champion, Leon!"|\bI love giving it everything I've got as a Trainer and seeing my team give everything they've got to seize another victory!"f\bI can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"`\bLeon: You've beat even the unbeatable Champion! I offer you my heartfelt congratulations!"�\bI hope this isn't the last time I get to meet you in battle! Keep challenging me so that I can keep reaching ever greater heights!"U\bHop: It's me, Hop! It's time for my new legend to begin here with my Pokémon!"}\bMy goal's to take on my bro. But not just that, I want to beat him! I want to be the one who beats the unbeatable Champion!"V\bSo let's show everyone the greatest battle ever, to be one step closer to Leon!"E\bHop: That was a real nail-biter of a match! I'm happy for you!"X\bI'm a bit disappointed in myself, but you won't get me so easily next time, mate!"w\bBede: What a joke. It's positively criminal of you, wasting my time here. So why don't you walk out of here now?"t\bYou're aware that I was chosen by Hitsu and Galar's Chairman himself, so that makes me more amazing than you!"[\bI suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how strong I am and how pathetic you are."j\bBede: This isn't what I planned. If I was able to defeat you, then everything would've been fine..."W\bNext time... I'll prove I'm a notch above the competition to everyone before me."g\rMarnie: Fancy seein' you again. I'm Marnie. Seems like I'm gonna have to watch out for you, huh?"[\rWhat're you gawkin' at? It's exactly what you think. I'm goin' to be the one to win."P\rIt'd be no fun if things ended just yet... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"k\rMarnie: Ok, I got to see a lot of the good points of you and your Pokémon! Guess that's not so bad!"V\rJust so y'know... I still haven't decided if I'm gonna cheer for you... See ya!"w\bVictor: Victor here. I've just finished cooking something tasty back there... Would you like to have some later?"V\bNo? I'm pretty confident when it comes to cooking and Pokémon battles, y'know."B\bWanna have a taste test? My Pokémon are prepped and ready!"W\bVictor: Thorough preparation is important for both cooking and Pokémon battles."a\bYour teamwork is just like a bowl of great curry! I gotta learn the secret to your recipe!"h\rGloria: Pleased to meetcha! I'm Gloria! And everywhere is a great stage for adventure and battle!"|\rAnd all that got me more peckish than usual. I think I'll make some sandwiches after this! It'll really hit the spot!">\rOk, wait no further! I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"U\rGloria: Strength is hard to obtain, and even harder to keep! Or so they say..."P\rWith your performance, there's no doubt you'll be smashing all obstacles!"}\rMagnolia: Oh goodness, dear me. I'm sorry. I didn't even notice my guest! My name is Magnolia. Welcome, young trainer!"m\rAs you know, we Dynamax our Pokémon today using the energy from Wishing Stars that have fallen to us."b\rDynamaxing draws out the true strength from the trust between a Pokémon and their Trainer."R\rSo, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."~\rMagnolia: You have certainly grown strong in the face of adversity, dearie. It's up to you to figure out what to do with it."{\rThere are things that only young people like you can do, and there are other things that only you can do. Dream big."{\rSonia: Name's Sonia. I'm the professor's assistant. I've been on a journey to solve the Galar region's biggest mysteries!"o\rAh, here! It's a book I wrote! I even signed it - that makes it a collector's item. Don't want it? Okay."!\rLet's give it our all now!"e\rSonia: Whoa, what's all this about all of a sudden? I've never seen anything like this before!"7\rYour feat today is gonna be featured in my book!"�\rOleana: So, you got through all they have to stop you. I would expect nothing less of the Trainers handpicked by Hitsu himself."h\rBut I am afraid it is now time for you to go home. I'll treat you to something truly spectacular."T\rOnce I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"z\rOleana: Arghhh! This is inexcusable... What was I thinking... Anyone who's made it this far would be no pushover..."E\rEverything I did, I did to further the chairman's own goals..."\bRose: Ladies and gentlemen! To everyone watching from the lobby and from home, you have all been waiting for this big moment!"~\bBefore I get carried away, please allow me to introduce myself once again. My name is Rose, and it is a pleasure to be here."�\bI saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"�\bRose: Hmm, this isn't looking too good for me... Most impressive, \PN. I wouldn't expect any less from a challenger endorsed by Hitsu."�\bIt's too bad, but it can't be helped... I do tend to ramble on, I know. I love to make speeches. But I think I can stop talking now."^\rMai: Trying to bring out the best in our partners is one thing we might have in common."i\rDo you feel confident that you can lead your Pokémon in battle? Well, I guess such talk can wait."V\rSo let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"s\rMai: Through battling, I feel that I'm coming to a greater understanding both of you and of my own Pokémon."U\rI hope I can come to understand the feelings of wild Pokémon in this way too."h\bLian: I'm Lian. I've already deduced that you've come here well-prepared. Such an earnest desire."5\bBut I must turn you away, even if it pains me."h\bI'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or... face the wrath of my Pokemon!"n\bLian: I apologize for becoming briefly incomposed. I may've been defeated, but my passion still stands!"L\bAnd it seems we've settled things here. Don't get cold feet after me!"_\rArezu: You've got quite the reputation, you know. I mean, your journey is one to reckon."S\rSome people are actually kinda scared of you for doing something so amazing."A\rI'm Arezu, by the way! Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"G\rArezu: My luck's run out, though... as you can most likely tell."P\rBut you're amazing, you know that? Your display of control was beautiful!"c\rCalaba: That's Warden Calaba to you. Ho? Now would you look at that... I've heard about you."N\rThe chosen one? More like a whelp in my view. Waste no more of my time."+\rNow let's not be distracted further."f\rCalaba: I owe you an apology. I treated you with disrespect, thinking you were just some whelp."|\rI didn't even have the courtesy to listen to you. You'd think someone who's lived as long as I have would be more patient."8\bIscan: Give me a moment... So, um... I'm Iscan..."j\bWell, sudden visits give me quite a shock... I do hope you'll give me advance notice in the future.",\bN-now, if you insist... We can begin."z\bIscan: Your nerves aren't just steel... They're... titanium. It's positively frightening how, um, fearless you are."5\bI'll, um... I'll just take my leave here then."z\rPalina: You're that child who they speak of. Your strength must be amazing, and yet... you have such a gentle face."^\rI believe you have the potential to do great things. But let's not force that onto you.".\rWithout further ado, show me your team."Q\rPalina: That was a splendid match! I'm so proud of both you and your team."I\rThank you, truly, for battling together with me. It means so much."a\bMelli: Heh, it looks like even a slight breeze could topple you. Can you really defeat me?"Q\bStop trying to humiliate yourself. I can't be stopped by the likes of you!".\bAccept your loss and get out of my way!"\\bMelli: Listen here! Neither I nor my Pokemon admit defeat just yet. That was a fluke!"u\bHowever! I will withdraw to allow them to recover. There's no shame in a tactical retreat. Keep your guard up!"j\bIngo: Good day, good trainer. Pleased to properly meet you. Your presence... reminded me of... uhh."�\bI recall faintly, that I had a partner once, who looked... like me. His name escapes me; all I could remember was my own name."d\bPerhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"�\bIngo: Sometimes I find myself saying things without knowing where the words come from... yet those words seem to fill me with power."z\bAh, but now I've sidetracked us with this talk. Please convey my well wishes to your next challenger. Hurry onward!"m\rSabi: My clairvoyance told me... You're super talented, right? I bet you're gonna be fun to play with!"T\rI'm Sabi! I know why you're here too! To get to the end and get your rewards!">\rWell, you'll get it... if you can win against me first!"G\rSabi: Wow, you caught us AND you beat us. You've won my respect!"�\rOooh, and one more thing: Am I even really clairvoyant? Am I really having fun, or am I bored? Hmm. No one but me could really know, right?"c\bGaeric: Let's begin with some proper introductions! I am Gaeric. And you must be \PN, right?"o\bOn what grounds do you come here seeking for the title of the best? What does your heart tell you to do?"a\bIf that is what you hope to accomplish, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"O\bGaeric: I'm tough as an iceberg, but you smashed me through and through!"@\bI suppose you can get on with it now. This one's alright!"S\rCharm: Now who might you be? Not some stray traveler, from the looks of you."c\rI bring good luck to my sisters wherever I go, and ill luck to anyone who crosses our paths."6\rI'm the eldest, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"S\rCharm: You're really going to insist on getting in the way, you little runt?"L\rNow I know more about how you fight, and I won't hold back next time."Q\rClover: Your luck's just run out. A vicious trap, laid out by yours truly."V\rThought you spotted a four-leaf clover? Well, I'll soon have you seeing double!"@\rI'm the middle sister, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"N\rClover: This place... You gotta be kidding me! It wasn't a fair battle!"]\rWe were basically goin' easy on you! I'll make you regret that confidence next time!!!"�\rCoin: I should introduce myself properly... before I show you poor fool how wrong it was to assume that you could ever beat me."X\rHeads, I win, and tails, you lose. You've got no chance in this game of fortunes."K\rI'm the youngest, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."W\rCoin: What a blithering mooncalf I am. I guess I lose the coin toss sometimes..."V\rYou will pay for this embarrassment. I swear I will make you pay with interest!";\bBeni: Lively and kicking, are you? Good to see that."�\bI heard you managed to quell your foes one after another, oh, did it ever make my blood run hot and my heart pound... At last... at last..."u\bYou, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder for all these long years!"|\bBeni: It doesn't matter to me who wins and who loses. I'm here to show you how a ninja fights, the style of a dying breed!"S\bAnyway, they say hunger is the best seasoning. I'm going off to eat my fill."m\rZisu: The name's Zisu. Captain of the Security Corps. So you're the one that everyone's talking about?"P\rI see you've got some fight in you. Figured I'd give what advice I could."G\rShow me what you can do. I'll carefully observe your every move!"\rZisu: Strong style, agile style... You know what is right for a given situation, and direct your Pokemon with a little nudge."N\rYou are a true veteran in Pokemon battles. That's a lot coming from me!"a\bKamado: I have been waiting for you! I am Kamado, commander of the Galaxy Expedition Team!"V\bHrrrm! You've got vigor, I'll give you that! You've come far enough to face me."S\bLet fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!";\bKamado: You truly are a force to be reckoned with..."r\bI'm grateful to you for showing me what a heartening presence Pokémon can be. We must spar again sometime!"u\bAdaman: Look who's being punctual! Good to finally meet you, stranger! I'm Adaman, leader of the Diamond Clan."|\bTime is all about change, and we can't live in fear of that. We can only try to change the time we live in for the better."l\bOh, look at the time. I'll cut the greetings then! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"S\bAdaman: Well, you've done it! That was amazing! I'm still shaking, even now."V\bNext time we'll come at you even harder and give you a battle you won't forget!"Y\rIrida: This stage is just for the both of us. I'm Irida, leader of the Pearl Clan!"`\rThe world before our eyes grows broader when we achieve true understanding with Pokémon."?\rLet's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."`\rIrida: Your sheer power, it's as unfathomably vast as space itself. I'm in awe before it."i\rI know I may never come to understand everything out there, but I'll keep my heart open to trying."\\rCyllene: I am the captain of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps. You may call me Cyllene."O\rWe are here to prove our capability in taming and handling our Pokémon."S\rYou know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."�\rCyllene: I set a high hurdle to judge whether a stranger like yourself could be worthy, but you cleared it. You've passed your trial."O\rBe proud. Present yourself orderly for whoever may come before you next."@\bRei: I'm Rei, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps!"�\bI want to conduct survey work so I can reach a point where if I meet a Pokémon, we can understand each other, even without battling."?\bHow about you then? It's time for our partners to shine!"b\bRei: The way you fight alongside your Pokémon - you don't seem scared of battling one bit."@\bFair enough. We'll just have to catch up the best we can."Z\rAkari: Hi! I'm Akari, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps! Nice to meet you!"h\rOur job as the Survey Corps is to research Pokémon and find out what kind of creatures they are!"6\rHere I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"q\rAkari: I guess doing research tasks and learning is one thing, and using that knowledge well is another..."^\rBattling certainly has its merits... I think I understand my Pokémon a bit better now."K\bLaventon: Ah! You gave me quite the shock, coming to me like that..."]\bOh yes, and...what might your name be? Oho! So you're called \PN! My name is Laventon."S\bI am something of a scholar seeking to deepen our understanding of Pokémon."n\bCome now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"[\bLaventon: Splendiferous results! I daresay you've earned yourself a pat on the back!"Q\bYou know, I expect great things of you. Carry on the good fight out there!"�\rCogita: First off, no "mistress," thank you. Just Cogita. It seems I'll be able to fulfil my duty at long last, thanks to you."c\rIndeed, I am to guide you, lost one. For the task of preventing great disaster falls to you."l\rThis is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."c\rCogita: There is nobility in knowing what must be done and seeing to it. You see, don't you?"y\rI have passed on to you all there is to pass. Where history goes from here... I leave it to you to see it through."�\bVolo: Ever since I was young, whenever I encounterd something painful or heartbreaking... I couldn't help but wonder why life was so unfair and why I was cursed to live through such things."�\bEventually, I chose to direct all my energy into my own natural curiosity and ambition. And what tickled my curiosity stronger than anything else were the mysteries to be found in legends, in history, in ruins..."�\bEver since I becoming convinced that Arceus really does exist, I also realised I need to be able to subjugate its power... TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"�\bVolo: I've devoted myself to Arceus beyond any other! I worshiped it as the creator of our entire world! I dedicated all of my passion and interest to studying it! All the time I've spent poring over the legends... Everything that I've done!"�\bDo you mean to tell me that this world doesn't need to be remade? Then, my journey is over. My story ended when I lost to you."The door is locked..."c\bBrock: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"\\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you. It makes me sleepy to be here alone."V\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well... I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you... You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"J\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon? Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."T\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"y\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac! I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."]\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day! The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"f\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected! I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"f\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill! I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"r\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"c\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Y\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here! No holds barred. No hard feelings!"}\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."Z\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring shame to us by losing!"k\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills. But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."Y\rDon't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"p\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon? Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."b\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you! That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"X\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! You defeated me, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine!"�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."H\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed. Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with. There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."u\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I'm an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they're fans of mine!"�\rOften, they'll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."V\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"\\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That's true of people and Pokémon alike!"p\rI've definitely noticed what your good points are! I'll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."h\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon! Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"x\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic! Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"~\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"V\rMina: Hrmmm! Well, this is frustrating. I failed to really use my full power..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"f\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can't let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."W\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it? Come on, let's try to cheer up!"o\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."Z\bDon't take it too serious now. You'll tire yourself out if you're always in a rush."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."`\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."q\bIt's been a while since I've walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It's a nice feeling."N\bNow I've got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."u\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together! There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."e\bYou'll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can't be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"d\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose. They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."\\rSelene: Alola! I'm Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"Y\rLet's be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"g\bElio: Alola! My name's Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."4\bI'd be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"u\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."Q\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an expert authority of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."g\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."M\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute! Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"f\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different. But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."e\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members. To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"V\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine. Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."?\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well. Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."k\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terrors are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."n\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughened ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"O\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon. Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."S\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"|\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon. They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"_\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style. You shocked me through and through."}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"v\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."j\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?! You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"m\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."H\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again? So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don't expect to be forgiven. I'm simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Titan Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Titan Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"b\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"T\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong. Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."G\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here? On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughen ourselves by digging up Fossils."k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."n\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me! Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"@\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or I'm fining you 10 million!"W\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger. That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal relationship between Pokémon and people!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"T\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what? More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."O\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."X\bI'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!""\bAllister: H-here... I go..."@\rOpal: Show me what you can do when you go all out, child."C\rMelony: You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid!"=\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle!"l\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"9\bHop: Let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"J\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna have a taste test?"5\rGloria: Ok, I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"\\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"Z\bRose: Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: Let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"6\rPalina: Without further ado, show me your team."j\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"N\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win against me first!"_\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, we must judge whether are you up to the task!"z\bBeni: You are the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder all these long years!"O\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every move!"4\bKamado: Which of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh, I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"F\rIrida: Let's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."t\rCogita: This is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."p\bVolo: IT'S TIME TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever! Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen. Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat. I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."m\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy. ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."~\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe.";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here? On an adventure?"V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded."I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here...";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"y\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!">\bHitsu: You bought a Backstage Pass to meet us? *laughs*"W\bYou know what that means, right? BONUS ROUND! And I can't take no for an answer."@\bLet's not delay any further, shall we? Please! Defeat me!"�\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master! Other than that, I have nothing much to say now, besides well done! The meet and greet is over. Ciaoz~"�\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA. Come back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Bye~"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."k\bLuc: Ara ara, you bought a pass just to meet us again? Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er for that? Just kidding."\bSay less. Let's battle!"w\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost. Well done, and cheers for meeting me! Hasta la vista!"i\bHaha, no hard feelings mate, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."g\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me? Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!";\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me, on your own accord?"\bFascinating indeed."G\bNow amuse me by engaging in a battle with me! Surprise surprise!"u\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter, there are those who possess much greater power than I do. You may leave after me."L\rVermint: Oh? You've made it this far and you're still moving forward."<\rVery well, let's see if you can keep that enthusiasm!"P\rVermint: I see... I've lost. I look forward to seeing your progress, \PN."*\rBut remember, I am always watching."B\rVermint: You lack strength and the resolve to move forward."S\rYou shall not pass this horizon where both of your passion and resolve meet."Y\rVermint: My, my quite surprising You've decided to battle me without true resolve?".\rLet's see if you can stay enthusiastic."C\rVermint: That's surprising... My Minuend was wrong for once."Z\r\PN, I'm looking forward towards your progress. And remember, I am always watching."[\rVermint: A battle without true resolve just shows that you're not on the right path."B\rFind your own resolve and I shall judge it with my Minuend."2\bLuc-ker: \PN, huh? Should've expected that."<\bWell, since you're here, lemme tell you a lil' story."�\bOnce upon a time, a teenager stumbled upon this world. He roamed the world far and wide, seeking to experience Ash's journey for himself."�\bUntil one day, he'd finished the journey. But with nothing else to do in the world at that time, he decided to start over again, and again, and again.":\bBut of course, all good things must come to an end."�\bOne day, when trying to exploit the system that he thought he'd grown so used to, it forcefully ejected him out, back into his original world.":\bAnd then after a while, he forgot about this world."9\bThat was, until that world experienced a pandemic."|\bThe teenager, now a few years older with some more knowledge and common sense, wanted to help out in improving this world."Y\bSo he reached out to this world's creator, and was given the opportunity to do so."Q\bAnd that's when I was born. Luc-ker. (the hyphen is important by the way!)"b\bA bit of trivia: That actually wasn't my original name! But that really doesn't matter now."�\bAll you need to know is that I've been helping improve this world's systems for many years now, taking breaks every now and again."A\bOf course, I would eventually meet Hitsu during this time."}\bWhen he first came up with the idea of the Grandeur Club, I never thought I'd be the one to facilitate it, but here we are."j\bWith trainers coming from all over the Pokémon universe, this is our love letter to the franchise."}\bIf you couldn't tell, we also loved Pokémon Masters. So we wanted some trainers from there that you could battle here too!"�\bI'm very happy with what we've accomplished. Of course, there were many, many struggles, but we've overcome them to get where we are today."@\bAnd now, we're at the end of our shared journey together."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"G\bWhat, you thought that was a hint to us adding in Gen 9? Hahaha!"�\bNah, I just liked the sound of saying that. Gen 9 isn't going to be added into the game unfortunately (or fortunately for myself, actually)."v\bThat being said, I do have to say ariagato to you as well, \PN. Without you, we would've never gotten this far."q\bAs a thank you for letting us experience the end of our journey together, let me reward you with a battle."\\bOh, you want to face off against me at my full power? You never cease to surprise me."y\bVery well. But don't say you weren't warned - this battle will use the mechanics of the Sync and Titan Challenges."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!" \bThat didn't work, did it?"~\bLuc: Phew! Even while breaking multiple system limits, I still can't beat you. You're truly an incredible trainer, \PN."g\bOf course, I could've broken more limits, but I really don't want to destroy this world, y'know?"~\bHere's where I'd give you a reward, but I've been programmed to not give you any if you've decided to only bully me :<("N\bAnyway, your reward for beating me. Three very special bo'ohw'o'wo'ers."D\bLuc: Thanks for letting me go all-out! That felt pretty good."v\bDon't worry too much about the fact that you couldn't beat me! I was breaking multiple system limits after all."j\bBut then again... I did warn you. You should know from the trainers from the Sync challenge, right?"_\bBut then again... I did warn you. All's fair when it comes to the Grandeur Club, y'know?"i\bYou also did put up a pretty good fight, and pushed me to limits that no other trainer has before.")\bAnyway, that's all for this place!"6\bCome, let me take you back to where you belong."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"-\bBlue: Show it to us - your true power!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"j\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! Here, come battle with me!"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"b\bFalkner: I'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"�\bMorty: With a little more, I could see a future in which I meet the Pokémon of rainbow colors. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"U\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? May you prove it to me...?"I\bPryce: I, Pryce - the winter trainer - shall demonstrate my power!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!",\bWill: Losing is not an option for us!"O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon...":\bBruno: Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go.">\bLance: It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"7\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"Z\bNorman: You'd better give it your best shot. I'll do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"k\rPhoebe: Don't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show us. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give us your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"!\bRoark: This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"]\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because I know how to focus. Get ready to lose!"V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."U\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"�\bBrycen: Receiving the support of your Pokémon makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"a\bHilbert: I'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"w\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"W\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"}\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"o\bGhetsis: We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"9\rViola: Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"U\bGrant: I hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."?\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance!"e\bRamos: The survival of plants is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"h\rValerie: The elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."S\rOlympia: This is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"�\bWulfric: Depending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."#\rMalva: I'm burning up, runt!"r\bSiebold: To devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."i\bWikstrom: Let us alll give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"@\rDrasna: Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"�\rDiantha: You know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."p\rShauna: I'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"5\bTierno: Anyway, can we have a Pokémon battle?"�\bTrevor: I am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas, but that doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"^\rSerena: Woohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!":\bCalem: All right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"2\bSycamore: Let's all have a Pokémon battle!"?\bLysandre: My desire... it is for a more beautiful world!"H\bIlima: Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!">\rLana: I'm going to show you what a serious Lana can do!"L\bKiawe: I hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"<\rMallow: Let's get us cooking into the heat of battle!"P\bSophecles: Um! Could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling?"O\rMina: Maybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"S\rAcerola: Maybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"\\rHapu: Looks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."`\bNanu: Don't take it too serious now. You'll tire yourself out if you're always in a rush."X\rOlivia: You can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"c\rKahili: Let's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"W\bMolayne: Now I've got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"D\bHala: Old Hala here will also be going all out! Let us clash!"7\bHau: I wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"O\rLillie: I'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"9\bGladion: Battle me. I won't take no for an answer."4\rSelene: I'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!";\bElio: I'd be happy to show you what I am capable of."s\bKukui: Now, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"@\rLusamine: Let's see... Yes, you. \PN. You will battle me."I\bGuzma: Wanna see what destruction looks like? It's your boy Guzma!"�\bEusine: My desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"Y\rCheryl: You're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."?\rMira: Get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"R\bRiley: Now, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."k\bBuck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"A\rMarley: ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best.">\bEmmet: Everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"O\bIngo: I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"J\bNoland: Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"9\rGreta: Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"r\bTucker: Tucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"q\rLucy: I'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."g\bSpencer: If your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"8\rAnabel: Let me see your talent in its entirety..."1\bBrandon: Bring your courage to our battle!"|\bPalmer: Show me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"L\rDahlia: Let us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!",\bThorton: All righty, let's get going!"M\bDarach: Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."R\rArgenta: I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me.""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�\bI recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."5Choose the Pokémon to give Arceus' Blessing to."!<<Imbuing Arceus' Blessing>>"#The trainers are transforming!"RThe security alarm must have been tripped after the battle. What will you do?"0\b???: Ehhh, there really was someone here.",Quick! Scurry back where you came from!"Run! Run for your life!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"�\bMaxie: We, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"	Left"	Down"
Right"Yes"No"Stay and Confront"Return to Lobby"Escape[�"Choose your path."^\bPercy: Eh bien, si on faisait rouler cette botte de foin ? Ça va être quelque chose !"Y\rDonna: Peu importe le plan que tu mijotes, mon partenaire et moi allons le couler."h\bKabu: Au final, le match se décidera selon le camp capable de libérer son véritable potentiel."S\rFaïza: Je pense que je vais tester ton esprit inébranlable, tu veux bien ?"$\bAlistair: J... j'y... vais..."v\rSally: Je vais garder un œil sur toi, mon enfant. Montre-moi ce dont tu es capable quand tu te donnes à fond.">\bChaz: La taille fait la force ! Savoure cette douleur !"{\rLona: Très bien, je suppose que nous devrions commencer. Tu ne pourras pas t'échapper quand je t'aurai gelé sur place."i\bSaturnin: Prépare-toi à découvrir des pouvoirs psychiques qui dépassent l'entendement humain !"8\rSophora: Tu ne sauras jamais ce qui t'a frappé !"d\bPeterson: Prépare-toi pour un pogo d'enfer avec moi et mon équipe ! C'est l'heure du rock !"S\bDhilan: Prépare-toi, je suis plutôt féroce en combat ! Ne t'en fais pas !"_\bRoy: Que la tempête se lève ! Moi, le puissant Roy, je vais tous vous envoyer valser !"_\bMustar: Ne fais pas attendre ce vieil homme trop longtemps ! Dis-moi quand tu es prêt !"|\bTarak: Je sens que mes partenaires trépignent d'impatience... On va passer un moment absolument digne d'un Maître !"P\bNabil: Montrons à tout le monde le plus grand combat de tous les temps !"�\bTravis: Je suppose que je devrais prouver sans l'ombre d'un doute à quel point tu es pathétique et à quel point je suis fort."`\rRosemary: Ce ne serait pas drôle si ça finissait vite... Tu as du répondant ? Classe !"L\bVictor: Mes Pokémon sont parés et prêts ! Tu veux goûter à ça ?"V\rGloria: Ok, n'attendons plus ! Je suis remontée à bloc et prête à y aller !"|\rMagnolia: Alors, \PN. C'est l'heure de me montrer ta véritable force à travers les liens de confiance que tu as tissés."3\rSonya: Donnons tout ce qu'on a, maintenant !"q\rLiv: Une fois que je vous aurai mis en pièces, le Président Shehroz sera un peu plus proche de son but !"�\bShehroz: J'ai vu du talent en toi. Tu me rappelles un peu moi-même, quand j'étais jeune. Montre-moi ton énergie, celle nécessaire pour maintenir en vie ce monde brillant et scintillant !"j\rMai: Alors, ayons un combat amusant et intense que nos deux équipes pourront vraiment apprécier !"�\bLian: Je tiens à progresser davantage, alors retire-toi tant que tu le peux encore. Ou fais face à la colère de mes Pokémon !">\rMarcia: Vraiment ravie de te rencontrer ! Commençons !"E\rLagéna: Maintenant, ne nous laissons pas distraire davantage."?\bGraham: P-puisque tu insistes... Nous pouvons commencer.":\rGarana: Sans plus attendre, montre-moi ton équipe."?\bCamille: Accepte ta défaite et ôte-toi de mon chemin !"\bChammal: Peut-être qu'un combat Pokémon avec toi pourrait débloquer ce souvenir... Me ferais-tu l'honneur d'un duel ?"X\rSabi: Eh bien, tu recevras ta récompense... si tu arrives à me battre d'abord !"s\bGarrett: Si tu espères remporter la victoire, alors nous devons juger si tu es à la hauteur de la tâche !"U\rGarance: Je suis l'aînée des Détroussœurs, et je serai ton porte-malheur !"o\rConstance: Je suis la cadette des Détroussœurs, et je suis un trèfle que tu ne pourras pas cueillir !"x\rHermance: Je suis la plus jeune des Détroussœurs, Hermance, mais je ne suis certainement pas ton porte-bonheur."\bBeni: Toi, voilà un adversaire digne de mes grandes techniques ninja qui ont moisi pendant toutes ces longues années !"f\rBélila: Montre-moi ce que tu sais faire. J'observerai attentivement chacun de tes mouvements !"a\bCormier: Laissons le destin décider de la suite ! Le plus fort d'entre nous l'emportera !"e\bAdamantin: Oh. Je passe les salutations ! Nous n'avons plus de temps à perdre ! Commençons !"U\rNacchara: Comparons nos connaissances, pour voir quel monde est le plus vaste."i\rSelena: Tu sais ce qu'on attend de toi. Maintenant, c'est à toi d'aller jusqu'au bout des choses.";\bAurel: Il est temps pour nos partenaires de briller."H\rLucia: J'y vais ! Prépare-toi à affronter ma pleine puissance !"w\bLavande: Voyons ! Qu'en dis-tu ? Et si nous nous entraidions, pour que je puisse mieux comprendre tes Pokémon ?"q\rPenséa: Je devrai pardonner cette unique fois, afin de renforcer davantage ta détermination. Combattons."z\bVolo: POUR CRÉER UN TOUT NOUVEAU MONDE ! Tout le monde disparaîtra pour le forgeage d'un NOUVEAU MONDE MEILLEUR !"a\bPercy: Hmmm ? Oh, tu dois être l'un de ces challengers, n'est-ce pas ? Mon nom est Percy."s\bNous allons être coriaces comme de la mauvaise herbe ! Mais... ça ne t'arrêtera pas ! Quel beau travail !"]\bEh bien alors, si on faisait rouler cette botte de foin ? Ça va être quelque chose !"�\bPercy: Combattre avec toi semble ragaillardir mes Pokémon Plante ! J'espère que ce combat a été enrichissant pour toi aussi !"0\bNous t'encouragerons depuis les gradins !"o\rDonna: Tu es l'un de ceux recommandés par Hitsu, c'est ça ? Tu es devenu un sujet brûlant parmi nous."�\rJe pense que tu l'as déjà réalisé, mais je suis Donna. Je ne doute pas que ton esprit de Dresseur Pokémon doit être assez affûté."W\rMais peu importe le plan que tu mijotes, mon partenaire et moi allons le couler."q\rDonna: Votre travail d'équipe était tout simplement parfait ! C'est assez pour me rendre un peu jalouse."Q\rSurfe sur ce courant jusqu'au bout ! Donne à la foule ce qu'elle attend !"�\bKabu: Chaque Dresseur et chaque Pokémon s'entraîne dur pour la victoire. Mais cela signifie que ton adversaire travaille tout aussi dur pour gagner."z\bJe me suis entraîné jusqu'au dernier moment pour te garantir le meilleur match possible lors de notre rencontre !"e\bMais au final, le match se décide selon le camp capable de libérer son véritable potentiel."�\bKabu: Clairement, ton talent a surpassé mes nombreuses années d'expérience. Je suis ravi d'avoir pu ressentir ma propre progression."\bEt je compte bien continuer à grandir et à combattre, jusqu'à devenir un vieux croûton que personne ne peut battre !"m\rFaïza: Il faut faire attention à ne pas laisser une seule victoire nous bercer dans la complaisance."b\rAs-tu aussi un esprit inébranlable qui ne flanchera pas, peu importe ce que tu affrontes ?"6\rJe pense que je vais tester ça, tu veux bien ?"R\rFaïza: T'affronter m'a donné toutes les explications dont j'avais besoin."y\rFaïza: C'est bien de rester inébranlable face au combat. Mais c'est bien d'être ému par le combat, également." \bAlistair: ...... Oh. Toi."6\b... Je suis Alistair. ... Tu as l'air en forme."\bJ... j'y... vais..."E\bAlistair: ... C'était génial. Je me... souviendrai de toi..."1\bDonne... le meilleur de toi-même là-bas."�\rSally: Te voilà, mon enfant. Bien que tu manques cruellement de rose, tu me sembles être un excellent candidat pour devenir mon successeur."�\rMon thé du matin commence enfin à faire effet, et j'imagine qu'il est un peu tard pour me présenter, mais... Je suis Sally."o\rJe vais garder un œil sur toi, mon enfant. Montre-moi ce dont tu es capable quand tu te donnes à fond."�\rSally: Toujours pas ce que je recherche... Oh, ne t'en fais pas pour ça, mon enfant. C'est juste une question de préférence personnelle."�\rIl est bientôt temps pour moi de quitter le feu des projecteurs. Pour que les jeunes talents frais puissent vraiment briller."W\bChaz: Mon nom est Chaz. J'avoue que je m'en veux un peu de te faire ça, mais..."]\bJe vais utiliser ce match pour montrer à la foule que mes Pokémon sont imbattables !"8\bLa taille fait la force ! Savoure cette douleur !"Y\bChaz: C'était... impressionnant. Les règles sont les règles. Tu peux continuer."j\bJe suis fier de mes Pokémon de type Roche. J'ai juste besoin de m'entraîner plus dur, c'est tout."^\rLona: Je suis Lona. Eh bien, tu vas trouver que mon style de combat est assez sévère."^\rSi tu ne fais pas attention, je pourrais te faucher l'herbe sous le pied en un instant."z\rTrès bien, je suppose que nous devrions commencer. Tu ne pourras pas t'échapper quand je t'aurai gelé sur place."�\rLona: Bien sûr, voir mes Pokémon perdre est triste, mais rencontrer quelqu'un de si jeune avec une telle habileté est assez grandiose."=\rDonne une bonne correction au prochain, tu veux bien ?"M\bSaturnin: Une ponctualité tout à fait louable. Mon nom est Saturnin."�\bJe ne pense pas que tu sois tout à fait à la hauteur... Et c'est à moi, en tant qu'adulte élégante, de m'assurer que tu reçoives le message."_\bPrépare-toi à découvrir des pouvoirs psychiques qui dépassent l'entendement humain !"0\bSaturnin: Improbable... Non, impossible !"X\bPeut-être ne suis-je qu'un homme ordinaire qui a donné tout ce qu'il pouvait..."w\rSophora: Aha, te voilà, pile à l'heure en plus ! Je suis le colorée, attentionnée et charismatique Sophora !"r\r...... Pourquoi ce silence ? Est-ce que je suis moquée... par un gamin ?! Purée, tu es une vraie plaie..."/\rTu ne sauras jamais ce qui t'a frappé !"]\rSophora: Hein ?! Non non non ! NON non non ! Il doit y avoir une erreur quelque part !"[\rAaagh ! Pourquoi je ne peux pas gagner ?! Tant d'efforts, et rien pour le prouver ?!"k\bPeterson: *soupir*... Alors tu es enfin là, hein ? Je pensais que personne ne viendrait me défier."�\bLa seule chose qu'un humble chanteur puisse faire est de chanter une humble chanson. J'espère tout de même que tu apprécieras le combat, même si tu sais que tu vas perdre !"Z\bPrépare-toi pour un pogo d'enfer avec moi et mon équipe ! C'est l'heure du rock !"_\bPeterson: Peterson ne fait pas de rappels, mais j'avoue que je suis tenté en ce moment."8\bRetrouvons-nous pour un combat un de ces quatre !"Q\bDhilan: Gahahaha ! N'es-tu pas courageux de venir me chercher des noises !"T\bJe ne peux pas dire que je déteste ton intrusion ici... Mon nom est Dhilan !"K\bPrépare-toi, je suis plutôt féroce en combat ! Ne t'en fais pas !"Y\bDhilan: Gahahaaa ! Regardez-moi ça, je me fais corriger par un jeunot comme toi !"W\bC'était un combat final ultra-méga-intense ! Chapeau bas. À plus d'un titre !"k\bRoy: Oh ! Si ce n'est pas le Dresseur recommandé par Hitsu ! Voyons... Quel était ton nom déjà ?"\bAh, c'est vrai ! \PN ! Et si Hitsu lui-même a reconnu ton potentiel... Alors j'imagine que tu dois être un sacré Dresseur."Z\bQue la tempête se lève ! Moi, le puissant Roy, je vais tous vous envoyer valser !"\bRoy: Au lendemain de ce combat furieux... je me sens aussi pur et rafraîchi que lorsque le ciel s'éclaircit après l'orage."l\bJ'ai peut-être perdu, mais j'ai toujours la classe. Je devrais peut-être prendre un petit selfie..."h\bMustar: Tiens, bonjour ! Je suis ravi comme tout que tu aies pu te joindre à moi pour un combat."M\bTu sembles être du genre travailleur toi aussi ! Mon nom est Mustar !"W\bNe fais pas attendre ce vieil homme trop longtemps ! Dis-moi quand tu es prêt !"~\bMustar: La force va et vient dans un cycle sans fin. Un instant tu la saisis, et le suivant, elle t'échappe des mains."z\bVous, les jeunes, vous grandissez si vite ! Ça ne cessera jamais de m'étonner. Félicitations, du fond du cœur !"c\bTarak: Ça va probablement sans dire, mais... bonjour ! Je suis le Maître de Galar, Tarak !"{\bJ'adore me donner à fond en tant que Dresseur et voir mon équipe tout donner pour arracher une nouvelle victoire !"u\bJe sens que mes partenaires trépignent d'impatience... On va passer un moment absolument digne d'un Maître !"h\bTarak: Tu as battu même le Maître imbattable ! Je t'adresse mes plus sincères félicitations !"�\bJ'espère que ce n'est pas la dernière fois que je t'affronte en combat ! Continue de me défier pour que je puisse atteindre des sommets toujours plus hauts !"l\bNabil: C'est moi, Nabil ! Il est temps pour ma nouvelle légende de commencer ici avec mes Pokémon !"�\bMon but est d'affronter mon frère. Mais pas seulement ça, je veux le battre ! Je veux être celui qui vaincra le Maître imbattable !"q\bAlors montrons à tout le monde le plus grand combat de l'histoire, pour faire un pas de plus vers Tarak !"L\bNabil: C'était un match vraiment serré ! Je suis content pour toi !"j\bJe suis un peu déçu de moi-même, mais tu ne m'auras pas si facilement la prochaine fois, l'ami !"�\bTravis: Quelle blague. C'est positivement criminel de ta part de me faire perdre mon temps ici. Alors pourquoi ne pas partir d'ici maintenant ?"�\bTu es au courant que j'ai été choisi par Hitsu et le Président de Galar en personne, ce qui me rend bien plus incroyable que toi !"\bJe suppose que je devrais prouver sans l'ombre d'un doute à quel point je suis fort et à quel point tu es pathétique."i\bTravis: Ce n'est pas ce que j'avais prévu. Si j'avais pu te vaincre, tout aurait été parfait..."j\bLa prochaine fois... je prouverai à tout le monde que je suis un cran au-dessus de la concurrence."m\rRosemary: Ravie de te revoir. Je suis Rosemary. On dirait que je vais devoir me méfier de toi, hein ?"j\rQu'est-ce que tu regardes comme ça ? C'est exactement ce que tu penses. C'est moi qui vais gagner."Z\rCe ne serait pas drôle si ça s'arrêtait déjà... Tu as du répondant ? Classe !"\rRosemary: Ok, j'ai pu voir beaucoup de tes bons côtés et de ceux de tes Pokémon ! J'imagine que ce n'est pas si mal !"d\rJuste pour que tu saches... je n'ai pas encore décidé si j'allais t'encourager... À plus !"x\bVictor: Ici Victor. Je viens de finir de cuisiner un truc savoureux là-bas... Tu voudrais en goûter plus tard ?"a\bNon ? Je suis plutôt confiant quand il s'agit de cuisine et de combats Pokémon, tu sais."S\bTu veux faire un test de dégustation ? Mes Pokémon sont parés et prêts !"s\bVictor: Une préparation minutieuse est importante aussi bien pour la cuisine que pour les combats Pokémon."r\bVotre travail d'équipe est comme un bol d'un excellent curry ! Je dois apprendre le secret de ta recette !"w\rGloria: Enchantée ! Moi c'est Gloria ! Et chaque endroit est une scène géniale pour l'aventure et le combat !"�\rEt tout ça m'a donné plus d'appétit que d'habitude. Je pense que je vais me préparer des sandwichs après ça ! Ça va tomber à pic !"N\rOk, n'attendons plus ! Je suis remontée à bloc et prête à y aller !"y\rGloria: La force est difficile à obtenir, et encore plus difficile à garder ! Ou du moins, c'est ce qu'on dit..."W\rAvec ta performance, il n'y a aucun doute que tu vas briser tous les obstacles !"�\rMagnolia: Oh mon Dieu, quelle tête en l'air je fais. Je suis désolée. Je n'avais même pas remarqué mon invité ! Mon nom est Magnolia. Bienvenue, jeune dresseur !"�\rComme tu le sais, nous faisons Dynamaxer nos Pokémon aujourd'hui en utilisant l'énergie des Étoiles Vœu qui sont tombées sur nous."c\rLe Dynamax puise la véritable force dans la confiance qui unit un Pokémon et son Dresseur."~\rAlors, \PN. Il est temps de me montrer ta véritable force à travers les liens de confiance qui t'unissent à tes Pokémon."}\rMagnolia: Tu as certainement gagné en force face à l'adversité, mon enfant. C'est à toi de décider ce que tu en feras."�\rIl y a des choses que seuls les jeunes comme toi peuvent accomplir, et d'autres que toi seul peux faire. Vois les choses en grand."�\rSonya: Je m'appelle Sonya. Je suis l'assistante de la professeure. J'ai voyagé pour résoudre les plus grands mystères de la région de Galar !"�\rAh, tiens ! C'est un livre que j'ai écrit ! Je l'ai même dédicacé, ce qui en fait un objet de collection. Tu n'en veux pas ? Bon, d'accord.",\rDonnons tout ce qu'on a, maintenant !"j\rSonya: Waouh, c'est quoi tout ce remue-ménage soudain ? Je n'ai jamais rien vu de tel auparavant !":\rTon exploit d'aujourd'hui figurera dans mon livre !"�\rLiv: Ainsi, vous avez réussi à franchir tous les obstacles placés sur votre route. Je n'en attendais pas moins des Dresseurs choisis par Hitsu lui-même."\rMais je crains qu'il ne soit temps pour vous de rentrer chez vous. Je vais vous offrir un spectacle véritablement grandiose."l\rUne fois que je vous aurai mis en pièces, le Président Shehroz sera un peu plus proche de son but !"�\rLiv: Arghhh ! C'est inexcusable... À quoi je pensais... Quiconque est arrivé jusqu'ici ne se laisserait pas faire si facilement..."U\rTout ce que j'ai fait, je l'ai fait pour servir les objectifs du président..."�\bShehroz: Mesdames et messieurs ! À vous tous qui nous regardez depuis le hall ou de chez vous, vous attendiez tous ce grand moment avec impatience !"}\bAvant que je ne m'emporte, permettez-moi de me présenter à nouveau. Mon nom est Shehroz, et c'est un plaisir d'être ici."�\bJ'ai vu du talent en toi. Tu me rappelles un peu moi-même, quand j'étais jeune. Montre-moi ton énergie, celle nécessaire pour maintenir en vie ce monde brillant et scintillant !"�\bShehroz: Hmm, ça ne se présente pas très bien pour moi... Impressionnant, \PN. Je n'en attendais pas moins d'un challenger recommandé par Hitsu."�\bC'est dommage, mais c'est ainsi... J'ai tendance à m'étaler, je sais. J'adore faire des discours. Mais je crois que je peux m'arrêter de parler maintenant."n\rMai: Essayer de tirer le meilleur de nos partenaires est une chose que nous avons peut-être en commun."\rTe sens-tu capable de mener tes Pokémon au combat avec assurance ? Enfin, j'imagine que cette discussion peut attendre."e\rAlors, ayons un combat amusant et intense que nos deux équipes pourront vraiment apprécier !"|\rMai: À travers le combat, je sens que je parviens à une meilleure compréhension de toi et de mes propres Pokémon."f\rJ'espère pouvoir comprendre les sentiments des Pokémon sauvages de cette manière également."p\bÉlian: Je suis Élian. J'ai déjà déduit que tu étais venu ici bien préparé. Un désir si sincère.":\bMais je dois t'éconduire, même si cela me coûte."�\bJe tiens à progresser davantage, alors retire-toi tant que tu le peux encore. Ou... fais face à la colère de mes Pokémon !"}\bÉlian: Je m'excuse d'avoir brièvement perdu mon sang-froid. J'ai peut-être été vaincu, mais ma passion reste intacte !"d\bEt il semble que nous ayons réglé nos comptes ici. Ne te dégonfle pas après mon passage !"^\rMarcia: Tu as une sacrée réputation, tu sais. Ton voyage est vraiment impressionnant."h\rCertaines personnes ont même un peu peur de toi parce que tu as accompli des choses incroyables."G\rJe suis Marcia, au fait ! Ravie de te rencontrer ! Commençons !"T\rMarcia: Ma chance a tourné, on dirait... comme tu peux probablement le voir."S\rMais tu es incroyable, tu le sais ? Ta maîtrise était magnifique à voir !"b\rLagéna: Je suis la Gardienne Lagéna. Oh ? Regardez-moi ça... j'ai entendu parler de toi."T\rL'élu ? Plutôt un avorton à mes yeux. Ne me fais pas perdre plus de temps."<\rMaintenant, ne nous laissons pas distraire davantage."v\rLagéna: Je te dois des excuses. Je t'ai traité avec manque de respect, pensant que tu n'étais qu'un avorton."�\rJe n'ai même pas eu la courtoisie de t'écouter. On pourrait croire que quelqu'un qui a vécu aussi longtemps que moi serait plus patient."G\bGraham: Laisse-moi un instant... Alors, euh... je suis Graham..."|\bEh bien, les visites soudaines me font toujours un choc... J'espère que tu me préviendras à l'avance la prochaine fois."2\bS-si tu insistes... Nous pouvons commencer."�\bGraham: Tes nerfs ne sont pas seulement d'acier... ils sont... en titane. C'est positivement effrayant de voir à quel point, euh, tu es sans peur."9\bJe vais, euh... je vais prendre congé ici, alors."|\rGarana: Tu es cet enfant dont tout le monde parle. Ta force doit être incroyable, et pourtant... tu as un visage si doux."e\rJe crois que tu as le potentiel pour accomplir de grandes choses. Mais ne t'imposons pas cela."2\rSans plus attendre, montre-moi ton équipe."X\rGarana: C'était un match splendide ! Je suis si fière de toi et de ton équipe."[\rMerci, sincèrement, d'avoir combattu à mes côtés. Cela compte beaucoup pour moi."f\bCamille: Hé, on dirait qu'une simple brise pourrait te renverser. Peux-tu vraiment me battre ?"T\bArrête d'essayer de t'humilier. Personne de ton espèce ne peut m'arrêter !"6\bAccepte ta défaite et ôte-toi de mon chemin !"~\bCamille: Écoute-moi bien ! Ni moi ni mes Pokémon n'admettons la défaite pour le moment. C'était un coup de chance !"�\bCependant ! Je vais me retirer pour leur permettre de récupérer. Il n'y a aucune honte à faire une retraite tactique. Reste sur tes gardes !"|\bChammal: Bonjour, dresseur. Ravi de faire ta connaissance en bonne et due forme. Ta présence... m'a rappelé... euh."�\bJe me souviens vaguement que j'avais un partenaire autrefois, qui me... ressemblait. Son nom m'échappe ; je ne me souvenais que de mon propre nom."v\bPeut-être qu'un combat Pokémon avec toi pourrait débloquer ce souvenir... Me ferais-tu l'honneur d'un duel ?"�\bChammal: Parfois, je me surprends à dire des choses sans savoir d'où les mots proviennent... et pourtant ces mots semblent m'emplir de puissance."�\bAh, mais je nous ai écartés du sujet avec ces bavardages. Transmets mes amitiés à ton prochain adversaire. En avant, hâte-toi !"}\rSabi: Ma clairvoyance m'a dit... que tu étais super talentueux, pas vrai ? Je parie qu'on va bien s'amuser ensemble !"o\rJe suis Sabi ! Je sais aussi pourquoi tu es là ! Pour aller jusqu'au bout et obtenir tes récompenses !"D\rEh bien, tu les auras... si tu arrives à me battre d'abord !"Y\rSabi: Waouh, tu nous as attrapés ET tu nous as battus. Tu as gagné mon respect !"�\rOh, et encore une chose : suis-je vraiment clairvoyante ? Est-ce que je m'amuse vraiment, ou est-ce que je m'ennuie ? Hmm. Personne à part moi ne pourrait vraiment le savoir, n'est-ce pas ?"j\bGarrett: Commençons par les présentations ! Je suis Garrett. Et tu dois être \PN, n'est-ce pas ?"_\bSur quelles bases viens-tu ici réclamer le titre de meilleur ? Que te dicte ton cœur ?"k\bSi c'est ce que tu espères accomplir, alors nous devons juger si tu es à la hauteur de la tâche !"S\bGarrett: Je suis dur comme un iceberg, mais tu m'as brisé de part en part !"O\bJe suppose que tu peux continuer maintenant. Celui-là, il est valable !"k\rGarance: Et qui pourrais-tu bien être ? Pas un simple voyageur égaré, à en juger par ton allure."m\rJ'apporte la chance à mes sœurs partout où je vais, et le malheur à quiconque croise notre chemin."9\rJe suis l'aînée, et je serai ton porte-malheur !"X\rGarance: Tu vas vraiment insister pour nous barrer la route, espèce de microbe ?"n\rMaintenant j'en sais plus sur ta façon de combattre, je ne retiendrai pas mes coups la prochaine fois."U\rConstance: Ta chance vient de tourner. Un piège vicieux, tendu par mes soins."p\rTu pensais avoir trouvé un trèfle à quatre feuilles ? Eh bien, je vais bientôt te faire voir double !"W\rJe suis la sœur cadette, et je suis un trèfle que tu ne pourras pas cueillir !"]\rConstance: Cet endroit... Tu te moques de moi ! Ce n'était pas un combat équitable !"l\rOn y allait pratiquement mollo avec toi ! Je te ferai regretter cette assurance la prochaine fois !!!"�\rHermance: Je devrais me présenter correctement... avant de montrer au pauvre fou que tu es à quel point il était stupide de croire que tu pourrais me battre."S\rPile, je gagne, face, tu perds. Tu n'as aucune chance dans ce jeu de hasard."[\rJe suis la plus jeune, Hermance, mais je ne suis certainement pas ton porte-bonheur."[\rHermance: Quelle gourde je fais. J'imagine que je perds le tirage au sort parfois..."X\rTu paieras pour cet embarras. Je jure que je te ferai payer avec les intérêts !"M\bBeni: Bien vivant et en pleine forme, hein ? Ça fait plaisir à voir."�\bJ'ai entendu dire que tu avais terrassé tes ennemis les uns après les autres, oh, cela a fait bouillir mon sang et battre mon cœur... Enfin... enfin..."y\bToi, voilà un adversaire digne de mes grandes techniques ninja qui ont moisi pendant toutes ces longues années !"�\bBeni: Peu m'importe qui gagne ou qui perd. Je suis ici pour te montrer comment combat un ninja, le style d'une lignée en voie de disparition !"t\bQuoi qu'il en soit, on dit que la faim est le meilleur des assaisonnements. Je m'en vais me remplir la panse."p\rBélila: Mon nom est Bélila. Capitaine du Corps de Sécurité. C'est donc toi dont tout le monde parle ?"g\rJe vois que tu as du répondant. Je me suis dit que je te donnerais les conseils que je pouvais."]\rMontre-moi ce que tu sais faire. J'observerai attentivement chacun de tes mouvements !"�\rBélila: Style puissant, style rapide... Tu sais ce qui convient à chaque situation et tu diriges tes Pokémon d'un simple geste."f\rTu es un véritable vétéran des combats Pokémon. Venant de moi, c'est un sacré compliment !"O\bCormier: Je t'attendais ! Je suis Cormier, dirigeant du Groupe Galaxie !"^\bHrrrm ! Tu as de la vigueur, je te l'accorde ! Tu es allé assez loin pour m'affronter."X\bLaissons le destin décider de la suite ! Le plus fort d'entre nous l'emportera !"8\bCormier: Tu es vraiment une force de la nature..."�\bJe te suis reconnaissant de m'avoir montré à quel point les Pokémon peuvent être une présence encourageante. Nous devrons croiser le fer à nouveau !"\bAdamantin: Tiens, quelqu'un de ponctuel ! Ravi de te rencontrer enfin, l'étranger ! Je suis Adamantin, chef du Clan Diamant."�\bLe temps est synonyme de changement, et nous ne pouvons pas vivre dans la peur de cela. Nous ne pouvons qu'essayer de changer l'époque où nous vivons pour le mieux."q\bOh, regarde l'heure. Je passe les salutations alors ! Nous n'avons plus de temps à perdre ! Commençons !"T\bAdamantin: Eh bien, tu l'as fait ! C'était incroyable ! J'en tremble encore."j\bLa prochaine fois, on t'attaquera encore plus fort pour t'offrir un combat que tu n'oublieras pas !"b\rNacchara: Cette scène n'appartient qu'à nous deux. Je suis Nacchara, chef du Clan Perle !"s\rLe monde devant nos yeux s'élargit lorsque nous atteignons une véritable compréhension avec les Pokémon."J\rComparons nos connaissances pour voir quel monde est le plus vaste."w\rNacchara: Ta puissance pure est aussi insondable et vaste que l'espace lui-même. J'en suis restée bouche bée."z\rJe sais que je ne comprendrai peut-être jamais tout ce qui existe, mais je garderai mon cœur ouvert pour essayer."f\rSelena: Je suis la capitaine du Corps de Recherche du Groupe Galaxie. Tu peux m'appeler Selena."[\rNous sommes ici pour prouver notre capacité à apprivoiser et diriger nos Pokémon."a\rTu sais ce qu'on attend de toi. Maintenant, c'est à toi d'aller jusqu'au bout des choses."�\rSelena: J'avais placé la barre haut pour juger si un étranger comme toi en serait digne, mais tu l'as franchie. Tu as réussi ton épreuve."g\rSois fier. Présente-toi avec dignité devant quiconque se trouvera sur ton chemin par la suite."M\bAurel: Je suis Aurel, membre du Corps de Recherche du Groupe Galaxie !"�\bJe veux mener des recherches pour atteindre un point où, si je croise un Pokémon, nous pourrons nous comprendre, même sans combattre."E\bEt toi, alors ? Il est temps pour nos partenaires de briller !"w\bAurel: Ta façon de combattre aux côtés de tes Pokémon... tu ne sembles pas avoir peur du combat pour un sou."\\bC'est de bonne guerre. On va devoir faire de notre mieux pour rattraper notre retard."b\rLucia: Salut ! Je suis Lucia, membre du Corps de Recherche du Groupe Galaxie ! Enchantée !"~\rNotre travail au sein du Corps de Recherche est d'étudier les Pokémon et de découvrir quel genre de créatures ils sont !"A\rJ'y vais ! Prépare-toi à affronter ma pleine puissance !"�\rLucia: J'imagine que mener des recherches et apprendre est une chose, et utiliser ce savoir à bon escient en est une autre..."o\rLe combat a certainement ses mérites... Je crois que je comprends un peu mieux mes Pokémon maintenant."P\bLavande: Ah ! Tu m'as fait un sacré choc en venant vers moi comme ça..."[\bOh oui, et... quel est ton nom ? Oho ! Tu t'appelles donc \PN ! Mon nom est Lavande."^\bJe suis une sorte de savant cherchant à approfondir notre compréhension des Pokémon."n\bVoyons ! Qu'en dis-tu ? Et si nous nous entraidions, pour que je puisse mieux comprendre tes Pokémon ?"p\bLavande: Des résultats splendides ! J'ose dire que vous avez bien mérité une petite tape dans le dos !"_\bVous savez, j'attends de grandes choses de votre part. Continuez le bon combat là-bas !"�\rPenséa: Tout d'abord, pas de "maîtresse", merci. Juste Penséa. Il semble que je vais enfin pouvoir accomplir mon devoir, grâce à toi."k\rEn effet, je dois te guider, âme égarée. Car la tâche d'empêcher un grand désastre te revient."q\rC'est la seule fois où je devrai me pardonner, afin de renforcer davantage ta détermination. Combattons."u\rPenséa: Il y a de la noblesse à savoir ce qui doit être fait et à s'en charger. Tu le vois, n'est-ce pas ?"�\rJe t'ai transmis tout ce qu'il y avait à transmettre. Ce qu'il adviendra de l'histoire à partir de maintenant... je te laisse le soin de le mener à bien."�\bVolo: Depuis que je suis jeune, chaque fois que je rencontrais quelque chose de douloureux ou de déchirant... je ne pouvais m'empêcher de me demander pourquoi la vie était si injuste et pourquoi j'étais maudit au point de vivre de telles choses."�\bFinalement, j'ai choisi de diriger toute mon énergie vers ma propre curiosité naturelle et mon ambition. Et ce qui titillait ma curiosité plus que tout, c'étaient les mystères des légendes, de l'histoire, des ruines..."�\bDepuis que je suis convaincu qu'Arceus existe réellement, j'ai aussi réalisé que j'avais besoin de pouvoir assujettir son pouvoir... POUR CRÉER UN TOUT NOUVEAU MONDE ! Tout le monde disparaîtra pour le forgeage d'un NOUVEAU MONDE MEILLEUR !"\bVolo: Je me suis dévoué à Arceus plus qu'à quiconque ! Je l'ai vénéré comme le créateur de notre monde entier ! J'ai dédié toute ma passion et mon intérêt à l'étudier ! Tout le temps que j'ai passé à éplucher les légendes... Tout ce que j'ai fait !"�\bEs-tu en train de me dire que ce monde n'a pas besoin d'être refait ? Alors, mon voyage est terminé. Mon histoire s'est achevée quand j'ai perdu contre toi."!La porte est verrouillée..."|\bPierre: Salut, je crois qu'une défense et une détermination de béton permettront de surmonter tous les obstacles !"m\bTu as intérêt à avoir une détermination d'acier, ou tu vas avoir du mal à égratigner mes potes !"/\bMontre-moi ce que tu as dans le ventre !"]\bPierre: Le monde est vaste. Il reste encore beaucoup de dresseurs puissants comme toi."?\bJ'ai la conviction que tu parviendras à les surpasser !"T\rOndine: Tu as devant toi la beauté mondialement connue, Ondine en personne !"`\rTu ferais mieux de ne pas te laisser déstabiliser par mon look et mon offensive totale !"\rEs-tu prêt, trésor ?";\rOndine: Aïeiiie ! Ça me met tellement en colère !"s\rJ'ai besoin de me vider la tête après cette défaite... Je ne perdrai certainement pas la prochaine fois !"7\bMajor Bob: Hé, minus ! Je dois te l'accorder..."`\bIl faut du cran pour m'affronter. Et tu as intérêt à garder tes nerfs bien accrochés."x\bParce que les combats Pokémon, c'est la guerre ! Je vais te montrer et te choquer jusqu'à ce que tu te rendes !"7\bMajor Bob: Okay ! Tu n'es pas un rigolo, gamin !"E\bJe retourne m'entraîner. Continue d'avancer comme l'éclair !"n\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm ? Oh, le bonjour vous soit donné. Être ici seule me rend toute somnolente."a\rSouhaiteriez-vous par hasard me défier ? Très bien... Moi, Erika, j'accepte avec grâce."B\rLaissez mes demoiselles vous démontrer l'art de l'Ikebana.",\rErika: Oh ! J'admire votre technique."Z\rJe serais vraiment ravie de voir votre démonstration à nouveau la prochaine fois."b\rMorgane: J'ai eu une vision de ton arrivée, et je sais que tu n'es pas un simple d'esprit."Z\rJ'ai vu ton défi, mais j'ai intentionnellement refusé de voir plus loin que cela."D\rTu te prépares, n'est-ce pas ? Voyons qui sera le vainqueur."H\rMorgane: Ton pouvoir... dépasse de loin ce que j'avais prévu..."N\rTu deviendras encore plus fort que tu ne l'es maintenant, je le sais..."B\rJeannine : Salut ! Je suis Jeannine ! Retiens bien ce nom !"|\rSache que même si je suis la fille d'un membre renommé du Conseil 4, ça ne veut pas dire que je suis inférieure !"_\rSinon, tu vas payer les conséquences de l'horreur que je m'apprête à te faire subir !"W\rJeannine: Fufufufu... Je suis désolée de te décevoir... Tu es vraiment doué."|\rJe vais me remettre au travail et améliorer mes compétences, pour devenir bien meilleure que mon père et que toi !"X\bAuguste: Bonjour ! Est-ce que tu sais tout sur les Pokémon ? Surtout les tiens ?"y\bEt quel est le meilleur type de Pokémon à entraîner et à cultiver ? Je parie que ça te laisse perplexe, hein."^\bTu veux connaître la réponse brûlante ? Laisse-moi te donner une leçon là-dessus !"l\bAuguste: Impressionnant ! Tu as montré l'esprit et les connaissances nécessaires pour me surpasser."_\bÇa me donne une pêche d'enfer ! Sois passionné ! Ressens cette curiosité brûlante !"�\bLéo: Salut ! Appelle-moi Léo ! Je suis un vrai de vrai Pokémaniac ! C'est moi qui ai développé le système de transfert de Pokémon !"y\bHé ! C'est quoi ce regard sceptique ? Je ne te fais pas marcher, l'ami. En parlant de ça, pourquoi je suis là ?"D\bTu es venu voir ma collection de Pokémon ? Regarde-moi ça !"H\bLéo: C'est la poisse. Je dois te remercier pour ce super moment."`\bMaintenant, je dois découvrir pourquoi je suis ici avec les autres champions de Kanto..."p\rOlga: Es-tu expert dans le maniement des créatures de glace ? Personne ne peut me battre sur ce terrain."V\rAvec ma stratégie bien rodée, tous les Pokémon finiront gelés à ma merci !"A\rJ'espère que tu as apporté ton manteau d'hiver, hé hé."T\rOlga: Tu es meilleur que je ne le pensais. Je commence à sentir la chaleur !"U\rJe ne manquerai pas de réfléchir à une contre-stratégie après ce combat !"E\bSolane: Mon nom est Solane. Je suis ce qu'on appelle une star."Y\bJe serai Champion de Kanto un jour ! Le monde entier connaîtra mon nom bientôt !"p\bTu vas devenir mon fan, pas vrai ? Laissons nos esprits ardents s'entrechoquer dans un éclat de gloire !"A\bSolane: Quel concert ! Tu es un talent caché, toi aussi !"G\bSi on joue fort et juste, notre célébrité sera inarrêtable !"G\rAgatha: Pourquoi viens-tu fourrer ton nez ici, enfant agaçant ?"_\rTu as un Pokédex sur toi ! Tu es l'enfant que Chen a pris sous son aile, n'est-ce pas ?"\rLes Pokémon sont faits pour combattre ! Pas pour être collectionnés ! Je vais te montrer comment un vrai Dresseur combat !"=\rAgatha: Tu as gagné. Je n'ai rien d'autre à ajouter."N\rEh bien, qu'est-ce que tu attends ? File maintenant, gamin ! Du balai !"y\bTrace: Salut. Tu as dû parcourir un long chemin pour arriver ici. Était-ce pour trouver un défi à ta hauteur ?"{\bQuant à moi, je veux attraper des tonnes de Pokémon différents et les entraîner pour qu'ils soient forts ! Hé !"c\bJe devrais peut-être vérifier si tes Pokémon se portent vraiment bien... avec un combat !"U\bTrace: Mec, tu es vraiment doué ! Mais ça ne veut pas dire que j'abandonne !"C\bJe continuerai à relever tes défis si nous nous revoyons !"}\bBlue: Qui es-tu ? Mon nom est Blue. J'ai été autrefois le Maître de Kanto, bien que ça ait été de courte durée."y\bMais je ne suis pas un rigolo pour autant ! Quand je vois un adversaire puissant, ça me donne envie de combattre."U\bTu veux essayer ? Je saurai si tu es bon ou pas en t'affrontant tout de suite."v\bBlue: Tu es coriace, je te l'accorde. Mais il y a toujours quelqu'un de meilleur. Tu dois être plus dévoué !"@\bJe dois retourner m'entraîner. On se reverra plus tard !"j\rLeaf: Oh, oups ! Tu n'es pas un Pokémon ! Désolée, j'ai cru que tu étais une sorte de Pokémon."~\rEh bien, euh… ravie de te rencontrer. Je suis Green ! Es-tu ici parce que tu cherches aussi… quelque chose de spécial ?"V\rJ'ai remarqué que tu avais de bons Pokémon là aussi, tu peux me les donner ?"e\rGreen: Waouh, tu es fort ! Oh, je sais ! Pourquoi ne deviendrais-tu pas l'un de mes Pokémon !"#\rRéfléchis-y, ok ? Hé hé."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bLes mots sont inutiles !"~\rRoxanne: Bonjour, ici Roxanne. J'aime établir une stratégie avant un combat, en appliquant ce que j'ai étudié jusqu'ici."m\rJe suis sûre que nous avons tous deux vécu de nombreux combats, acquérant d'immenses connaissances."�\rAuriez-vous l'amabilité de me montrer comment vous combattez pour que je puisse apprendre ? Je verrais aussi si je me suis améliorée."D\rRoxanne: C'était parfait. J'ai encore beaucoup à apprendre."`\rJe veux apprendre encore plus de vous. Serez-vous à nouveau mon adversaire dans ce cas ?"H\bBastien: Grosse vague en approche ! Attention ! En plein dedans !"j\bBattu par les vagues déchaînées de la mer, endurci par la grotte des environs. Je suis Bastien !"=\bTu veux un défi ? Voyons de quel bois tu te chauffes."P\bBastien: Waouh. Wow ! Tu as fait plus de remous que ce que je prévoyais."s\bTon talent provoque une vague d'étonnement qui me submerge. J'ai hâte de recommencer. Reste sur la vague !"B\bVoltère: Ah-ha ! Belle jeune âme. Débordante de vigueur."L\bJe sais ce que tu veux. Tu veux affronter mes Pokémon ! Wahahahaha !"[\bJe vais te faire faire des étincelles ! Ne dis pas que je ne t'avais pas prévenu !"�\bVoltère: Wahaha. Tu as fini par me donner des frissons ! Je suis tellement impressionné que je ne peux pas m'empêcher de rire !"U\bJe déborde d'optimisme en voyant un jeune Dresseur aussi prometteur que toi !"{\rAdriane: Bienvenue... Non, minuscule dresseur ! Je vois que tu es venu ici pour chercher des adversaires de taille !"�\rEuh... n'ose pas me sous-estimer, je vais, euh... te montrer les techniques brûlantes que j'ai peaufinées avec mon grand-père !",\rTiens-toi prêt ! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa !"�\rAdrine: Ta force me rappelle vraiment celle de mon grand-père. J'imagine que j'essayais trop d'être quelqu'un que je ne suis pas."z\rQuand je n'agis pas comme moi-même, pas étonnant que les Pokémon qui combattent à mes côtés soient perplexes."�\bNorman: Eh bien, le monde des Pokémon est profond. Je pense sincèrement qu'aucune quantité d'entraînement ne sera jamais suffisante."N\bMais il n'y a aucun défi pour moi à combattre un Dresseur débutant !"o\bAlors tu as intérêt à donner tout ce que tu as. Je ferai tout ce qui est en mon pouvoir pour gagner !"d\bNorman: Tu as fait du bon travail. Tu t'es donné à fond et tu as mérité cette victoire..."X\bJe veux que mon gamin apprenne de toi. J'espère que tu le rencontreras bientôt."L\rAlizée: Je ne fais qu'un avec les oiseaux et j'ai fendu les cieux..."Q\rMême dans la difficulté, nous avons triomphé avec élégance et grâce."d\rSois témoin de notre élégante chorégraphie. Ne cligne pas des yeux ou tu le regretteras !"c\rAlizée: Je vois que tu ne fais qu'un avec tes Pokémon également. Je reconnais ton talent."h\rJe sais que tu continueras à viser de plus en plus haut ! C'est ce qui t'a mené à la victoire."^\bLévy: Hé hé hé... Tu as été surpris ? \rTatia : Hi hi hi... Tu as été surpris ?"S\bNous n'avons pas besoin de parler... \r... parce que nous pouvons deviner..."D\b... ce que l'autre pense... \r... tout est dans nos esprits !"B\bCette combinaison qui est la nôtre ! \rPeux-tu la battre ?"z\bLévy: Le lien entre toi et tes Pokémon... \rTatia : ... est bien plus fort que le nôtre. Nous pouvons le sentir."G\bNous nous reverrons un jour... \r... nous en sommes très sûrs."w\bJuan: Il semble que tu aies une raison impérieuse de m'affronter. Savais-tu que je suis un dresseur retraité ?"^\bJ'avais abandonné mon poste de Champion une fois. J'avais tout confié à mon élève."�\bMais assez bavardé. J'imagine qu'un Coordinateur pourrait te montrer un tour ou deux aujourd'hui. Sois le témoin de la grande illusion d'eau sculptée par nos soins !"�\bJuan: Comme la plus belle des musiques, les combats que nous avons menés ensemble font vibrer les cordes de l'inspiration dans mon cœur."Q\bJe ferme les yeux, et je te vois t'envoler. Un signe certain de noblesse !"\bDamien: Ils disaient que j'étais un voyou, mais je leur ai montré de quel bois se chauffent les beautés du côté obscur !"{\bTu peux parler autant que tu veux, mais l'offensive prime sur la défense ! Tout ce qui compte, c'est ma puissance !"l\bMaintenant, j'aime ce regard que tu me lances. J'imagine que tu vas m'offrir un bon match. Allons-y !"a\bDamien: Écoute ce que ce perdant a à dire. Le chemin est long, mais tu as ce qu'il faut."^\bEt quand tu auras acquis une nouvelle force, reviens ici ! Sans retenue. Sans rancune !"}\rSpectra : Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha ! Tu as raison. Oh ? Donnez-moi une minute.... Salut ! Mon amie dit que tu me cherches."�\rTu ne peux pas la voir ? Ahahaha. Bien sûr. C'est un fantôme, et je suis l'une des rares personnes capables de communiquer avec elle."h\rN'aie pas peur. Quoi qu'il en soit, si tu cherches un défi, voyons si tu peux blesser mes amis !"s\rSpectra : Il y a définitivement un lien plus fort entre toi et ton équipe. Il est naturel que j'aie perdu."a\rJ'aimerais voir jusqu'où votre lien peut vous porter. Ne nous fais pas honte en perdant !"�\rGlacia: J'ai voyagé loin pour perfectionner mes techniques de glace. Mais tout ce que j'ai vu, ce sont des dresseurs faibles."]\rEt toi ? Cela me ferait un plaisir immense si tu pouvais te donner à fond contre moi."5\rJe me demande ce que tu vas me montrer. Vas-y."�\rGlacia: Quel soulagement, c'était si ardent ! Des esprits brûlant si haut que mes techniques de glace paraissent bien pâles en comparaison."d\rNe sois pas complaisant. Si tu ressens le besoin de refroidir tes émotions, reviens me voir."�\bAragon: Dans leur état naturel, les Pokémon sont des êtres vivants sauvages. Ils peuvent nous aider, nous entraver, et ils sont libres."}\bPour que nous combattions avec des Pokémon comme partenaires, sais-tu ce que cela exige ? Sais-tu ce qui est nécessaire ?"@\bSi tu ne le sais pas, tu ne l'emporteras jamais sur moi !"{\bAragon: Tu mérites tout le mérite du monde pour être arrivé jusqu'ici. Tu sembles savoir ce qui est nécessaire."�\bOui, un cœur véritablement vertueux. C'est grâce à cela que les Pokémon apprennent le bien du mal. Cette influence les aide à devenir forts !"�\bPierre: Toi... Qu'as-tu vu durant ton voyage avec tes Pokémon ? Qu'as-tu ressenti en rencontrant tant de Dresseurs comme toi ?"Z\bQu'est-ce qui s'est éveillé en toi ? Je veux que tu me lances tout ce que tu as !"$\bDonne-moi ton meilleur coup !"l\bPierre: Félicitations ! Tes sentiments... et les Pokémon qui ont répondu de toutes leurs forces..."|\bIls ne font plus qu'un, et ont créé une puissance encore plus grande. C'est ainsi que tu as pu saisir la victoire !"�\bMarc: Parfois tes Pokémon doivent danser comme une brise printanière, à d'autres ils doivent frapper comme l'éclair. Je veux me sentir ébloui par ta performance !"�\bQui saura danser avec le plus d'élégance avec ses Pokémon ? Qui saura exposer l'art le plus gracieux en combat, toi ou moi et ma grande illusion d'eau ?"(\bMontre-le-moi ici et maintenant !"o\bMarc: Bravo ! Je réalise maintenant ton authenticité et ta magnificence en tant que Dresseur Pokémon."Z\bJe trouve beaucoup de joie à vous avoir rencontrés, toi et tes Pokémon. Encore !"�\bTimmy : R-ravi de te rencontrer ! Je suis Timmy. Mes Pokémon et moi avançons toujours ensemble, petit à petit, jour après jour !"]\bJe suis sûr que tes Pokémon et toi avez dû surmonter beaucoup de choses également."w\bMes Pokémon m'ont donné le courage et la force de me battre. Je dois gagner pour eux ! Alors tiens-toi prêt !"�\bTimmy: Arghhhh !!! Hah... toi. Merci de ne pas avoir retenu tes coups. J'ai l'impression d'avoir pu faire un pas de plus en avant grâce à toi."p\bAttention ! Un jour... je jure que je te rattraperai ! C'est une promesse que j'ai l'intention de tenir !"`\rFlora: Héééééééé ! Comment ça va ? Moi c'est Flora ! Contente de te rencontrer !"|\rMon rêve est de devenir amie avec les Pokémon du monde entier ! Je veux tout comprendre de toi et de tes Pokémon !"d\rEst-ce que tu me montrerais tous tes Pokémon lors d'un combat ? Je suis tellement excitée !"^\rFlora: Ohoho, waouh, tu l'as fait ! Tu m'as battue, mais j'ai tellement appris de toi !"_\rTu me donnes envie de devenir plus forte, peut-être que la prochaine fois je gagnerai !"?\bBrice: Salut. Mon nom est Brice. Ravi de te rencontrer !"�\bMon rêve est de devenir un meilleur Dresseur Pokémon ! Je veux apprendre encore plus et devenir plus fort que je ne le suis maintenant !"~\bPuisque tu es là, tu as peut-être affronté et battu mon père. Mais m'affronter, c'est une autre histoire ! C'est parti !"a\bBrice: Hmmm... Je n'avais pas l'air très en forme cette fois-ci. Oh et puis après tout !"V\bJe devrai faire plus d'efforts la prochaine fois ! Tu peux compter là-dessus !"p\rViolette: Cette expression déterminée... Cette lueur dans ton regard dit que tu es prêt pour le défi."�\rC'est fantastique ! Que ce soient les larmes de frustration qui suivent une défaite ou l'éclosion de la joie qui accompagne la victoire."}\rLes deux sont de superbes sujets pour mon appareil photo ! Maintenant, approche ! Moi, Violette, je vais t'affronter !"�\rViolette: Le monde que l'on voit à travers un objectif et le monde que l'on voit avec un Pokémon à ses côtés peuvent paraître totalement différents."f\rTes Pokémon et toi m'avez montré une toute nouvelle profondeur de champ ! Juste fantastique !"w\bLino: J'attendais avec impatience un challenger digne de ce nom ! C'est un véritable exploit de participer ici."l\bTrès impressionnant, en vérité. J'ai le sentiment que notre combat aura valu la peine d'attendre !"\\bJ'espère que tu me montreras que tes talents de dresseur surpassent même les miens."g\bLino: Il y a des choses qui semblent hors de portée, peu importe les efforts que l'on déploie."k\bCependant, il est important de ne jamais abandonner, peu importe l'adversaire ou les probabilités !"o\rCornélia: Haha ! Place à la grande entrée de Lady Cornélia ! Je plaisante ! Ravie de te rencontrer !"�\rJe faisais un entraînement spécial avec mon Lucario quand, tout à coup, il a été attiré par ton aura et s'est précipité ici."S\rJe pense que Lucario veut se battre contre toi. Accepterais-tu notre défi ?"f\rCornélia: Oh ! J'ai été vaincue ! Hélas ! Lady Cornélia a fait une piètre démonstration."O\rQuelle démonstration explosive de force, dépassant de loin la mienne !"�\bAmaro: Ho ho ! Je n'en ai pas l'air, mais je suis le meilleur jardinier que tu puisses rencontrer. Si tu veux en savoir plus sur les plantes, je suis ton homme."w\bAlors, qu'est-ce que tu en penses, garnement ? As-tu apprécié la verdure sur ton chemin pour devenir Maître ?"`\bLeur survie est un signe de leur force. Es-tu sûr d'être prêt à affronter tout cela ?"|\bAmaro: Tu crois en tes Pokémon... Et ils croient en toi aussi... Une force semblable à celle des chênes puissants."e\bC'était un beau combat, jeune pousse. On ne peut sûrement pas forcer une véritable amitié."\\bLem: Salut ! J'aime mes combats Pokémon comme j'aime mes inventions. HAUTE TENSION !"�\bEt les Pokémon sont vraiment mystérieux... Même avec les progrès de la science, il y a encore tant de choses que nous ignorons à leur sujet."t\bNéanmoins, faisons tous les deux de notre mieux au combat. Le futur, c'est maintenant, merci à la science !"�\bLem: Il n'y a pas de honte à perdre. Je suis content de pouvoir apprendre quelque chose de nouveau grâce à des challengers puissants."�\bMais ce que j'essaie de faire, c'est juste de profiter de chaque jour au maximum avec mes Pokémon, tout en explorant la science que j'aime avec mes inventions."x\rValériane: Oh, si ce n'est pas un jeune dresseur. Tu es venu voltiger jusqu'à moi porté par un vent favorable."b\rAlors je suppose que tu as gagné le droit de m'affronter. J'espère que cela te divertira."{\rLes fées insaisissables peuvent paraître frêles comme une brise et délicates comme une fleur, mais prends garde."R\rValériane: Oui. Un beau combat. La victoire est captivante, n'est-ce pas ?"o\r... ... ... Ah... Pardonne-moi. J'étais si captivée que j'ai oublié un instant qu'elle était tienne."N\rAstera: Le moment est venu pour nous de nous tenir ici. Je suis Astera."W\rMaintenant nos chemins se sont entrelacés et croisés. Nos Pokémon également."\\rCeci est un rituel pour décider de ton destin et de ton avenir. Le combat commence !"|\rAstera: Un témoignage de ton talent. Une preuve de ta puissance. Un symbole de confiance. Tes Pokémon t'obéissent."J\rD'innombrables étoiles éclairent ton chemin. N'aie aucune limite."|\bUrup: Tu sais quoi ? La glace est à la fois extrêmement dure et terriblement fragile. Tu sais ce que ça signifie ?"�\bSelon les Pokémon que tu choisiras, je pourrais être ton adversaire le plus redoutable ou je pourrais être une proie facile."|\bMais c'est très bien ainsi. C'est comme ça que ça doit être ! Enfin, assez discuté ! Que le spectacle commence !"|\bUrup: Impressionnant ! Tes Pokémon ont combattu avec beaucoup de courage. Je vois que tu as bien entraîné tes Pokémon."z\bTes Pokémon ont vraiment jeté toutes leurs forces dans ce combat. Tu es vraiment quelqu'un de spécial, tu sais ?"{\rMalva: C'est toi l'illustre personnage, n'est-ce pas ? On me connaît comme Malva, la spécialiste des Pokémon Feu."t\rFais de ton mieux, car si tu n'arrives pas à m'impressionner avec ta vraie force, tu n'iras jamais loin ici."l\rMais ça devrait être une promenade de santé pour toi, non ? Je brûle de haine pour toi, microbe !"�\rMalva: Oooh, petit dresseur malfaisant ! Tu es vraiment incroyable, tu sais ? Tu es si amusant que j'ai juste envie de te consumer là où tu te trouves !"_\rMais je vais te laisser la vie sauve... Je me souviendrai définitivement de ce combat !"�\bNarcisse: Vous là ! Jeune homme ! J'ai une question à vous poser. Pensez-vous que le combat Pokémon puisse un jour mériter d'être appelé un art ?"|\bVoyez-vous, la cuisine est le type d'art qui disparaît dès qu'il est achevé. Les combats Pokémon sont identiques."~\bSe consacrer entièrement à une telle vie, faite d'expériences éphémères, c'est cela qui est véritablement artistique."�\bNarcisse: Consacre-toi entièrement, afin que même ce qui se fane et disparaît soit gravé à jamais dans ton cœur et ton esprit !"�\bC'est le devoir des dresseurs comme des chefs de trouver le bon dans les matériaux bruts avec lesquels ils travaillent. C'est là que réside la réponse pour atteindre des sommets toujours plus hauts."o\bThyméo: Enchanté, jeune challenger ! En vérité, je suis la célèbre lame d'acier trempé, Thyméo !"v\bAvec mes magnifiques Pokémon à mes côtés, je vais révéler l'étendue de l'accomplissement d'un Dresseur !"f\bDonnons-nous tous deux notre parole que notre joute sera juste et honorable. Prêt ? En garde !"�\bThyméo: Quelle douce et glorieuse douleur, quelle joie ébranle maintenant mon cœur vaillant ? Ma volonté, qui fait même trembler les lances, frémit devant un combat aussi noble !"x\bQuoi donc ? Je suis défait ! Bon chevalier, tu es en effet mon égal, et digne de franchir ces augustes salles !"�\rDracéna: Oh mon Dieu, bonjour à toi ! Bienvenue, bienvenue. Tu dois être un dresseur puissant. C'est une merveilleuse nouvelle !"x\rQuand je grandissais, mes grands-parents m'ont bercée avec des récits sur les Pokémon du temps et de l'espace."�\rC'est vraiment grâce à ces histoires que j'ai décidé de devenir une dresseuse de type Dragon. T'affronter fera pousser mes Pokémon comme de la mauvaise herbe !"c\rDracéna: Oh, toi ! Tu es incroyable ! Tes Pokémon et toi êtes tout simplement charmants !"`\rAvec tes Pokémon, je suis sûre que tu peux battre chacun d'entre nous jusqu'au dernier."y\rDianthéa: Bienvenue dresseur. Comme je suis actrice, les gens viennent parfois me parler parce qu'ils sont fans !"�\rSouvent, ils disent que me regarder jouer leur a donné du courage ou leur a remonté le moral ! Mais je reçois aussi beaucoup d'énergie de mes fans quand je les rencontre !"�\rTu sais, j'aimerais vraiment en apprendre plus sur la façon dont un dresseur fort comme toi élève ses Pokémon, débordant d'espoir pour l'avenir."�\rDianthéa: J-je suis si émue qu'il est difficile de savoir ce que je devrais dire, mais je... je... je suis juste si heureuse en ce moment."u\rAprès tout, cela m'a donné la chance de te rencontrer et de combattre avec toi et tes merveilleux Pokémon !"V\rSannah: Hé hé ! Ravie de te rencontrer ! Est-ce que tu t'es bien amusé ici ?"t\rHé, tu sais ce qui va se passer ? C'est ça ! On va se battre ! On EST des dresseurs Pokémon, après tout !"{\rJe suis sûre qu'on va devenir de super amis. Hé ! On peut voir les Pokémon maintenant ? Je veux les rencontrer aussi !"f\rSannah: Je suis tellement contente d'être partie en voyage. Je me suis fait des amis géniaux."�\rJ'ai pu visiter plein d'endroits, rencontrer beaucoup de gens gentils et me faire de merveilleux souvenirs ! Je parie que c'est pareil pour toi !"�\bTierno: Très bien ! Ravi de te rencontrer ! Tu sais, on aurait l'impression d'être plus proches si on s'appelait par des surnoms."J\bEst-ce que je peux t'appeler Jammy ? Hahaha ! Allez, détends-toi !"�\bBref, on peut faire un combat Pokémon ? Oh, euh... désolé de te balancer ça comme ça. Mais c'est pour ça qu'on est là, non ?"O\bTierno: C'est génial, ça me donne envie de danser là, tout de suite !"a\bCette démonstration de force me donne envie de groover et de tourbillonner d'excitation !"{\bTrovato: Hum, salut. Je suis Trovato. Mon rêve est de voir toutes les sortes de Pokémon que le monde a à offrir !"q\bC'est pourquoi je suis en voyage avec mon Pokédex pour parcourir les hautes montagnes et les vastes mers."S\bÇa ne veut pas dire que je ne sais pas me battre pour autant. C'est parti !"q\bTrovato: Il y a encore tellement de choses que j'ignore. Est-ce que je n'ai simplement pas ce qu'il faut ?"Q\bOh, on ne peut donc pas tout apprendre juste avec le Pokédex... Je vois !"f\rSerena: Salut ! Mon nom est Serena. Je transforme mon amitié avec mes Pokémon en force pure !"h\rTu es spécial. J'ai l'impression que l'amitié que nous avons avec nos Pokémon nous connectent."S\rYoupi ! J'ai hâte de voir ce qu'on peut faire ! Hi hi hi, on va commencer !"a\rSerena: Chacun a ses propres qualités. C'est vrai pour les gens comme pour les Pokémon !"�\rJ'ai définitivement remarqué quelles sont tes qualités ! Je parie n'importe quoi que tes Pokémon les ont remarquées aussi."y\bKalem: Salut, je suis Kalem. Je vais continuer à aller de l'avant jusqu'à ce que je sois le plus fort possible !"�\bJe pense que ce serait amusant de rivaliser pour voir qui est le plus fort. Mais on ne pourra pas appeler ça une compétition tant que je ne t'aurai pas battu au moins une fois !"6\bTrès bien, faisons ça. Allez, tout le monde !"�\bKalem: Tu es l'un de mes meilleurs adversaires ! Tu pourrais trouver de nouvelles stratégies qui aideront les combats à être beaucoup plus fluides."q\bAvant que tu ne demandes, non, je ne vais pas te dire quelles stratégies j'utiliserai la prochaine fois !"�\bAlthéo: Salutations ! Je n'ai pu m'empêcher d'observer tes combats. Tu avais l'air si charmant en plein combat que je n'ai eu d'autre choix que de te convoquer ici."\bJe dois l'admettre, je me posais des questions à ton sujet. J'ai hâte de voir l'éclat de tes capacités dans mon épreuve."X\bTrès bien alors ! Contemple les magnifiques Pokémon du seul et unique Althéo !"d\bAlthéo: Toi, ou devrais-je dire tes Pokémon et toi, formez une équipe bien intéressante !"K\bJe ressentirai les répliques de ce combat pendant encore longtemps."�\rNéphie: Bonjour. Je suis Néphie. J'avais l'habitude d'aller souvent à la pêche avec mes sœurs jumelles, donc on peut dire que c'est l'un de mes talents !"l\rTu as l'air d'un dresseur vigoureux. On pourrait aller pêcher des Pokémon sauvages ensemble alors !"b\rMais plus important que cela… je vais te montrer ce qu'une Néphie sérieuse peut faire !"e\rNéphie: Ouf... c'était fantastique ! Tes Pokémon et toi étiez parfaitement synchronisés !"c\rIl semble qu'il était trop tôt pour penser que toute ma puissance suffirait à te vaincre."�\bKiawe: Mon nom est Kiawe. Mon Ossatueur et moi sommes des étudiants des danses ancestrales qui se transmettent à Alola depuis des générations."|\bJe vais afficher pleinement la danse tant vantée de mes Pokémon ! Qu'on gagne ou qu'on perde, on ne danse jamais assez !"�\bKiawe: Prodigieux ! Être transporté par l'enthousiasme d'un adversaire... Rien d'autre ne me donne plus envie de combattre !"m\bOui... C'est exactement le genre d'entraînement intense qui a fait de moi ce que je suis aujourd'hui."~\rBarbara: Hé ! Merci d'être venu ! As-tu déjà déjeuné ? J'ai un "Spécial Super Barbara" pour toi, si tu as faim !"�\rTu n'as pas faim ? OK. Mais n'oublie pas de faire une pause de temps en temps. Un maître Pokémon n'est pas toujours en train de se démener."z\rJ'utilise mon intuition de chef pour choisir la crème de la crème ! Cuisinons tout cela dans le feu de l'action !"~\rBarbara: Aaaaah, j'ai perdu. J'imagine que je vais devoir demander à mes Pokémon de type Plante de me remonter le moral..."h\rEt si tu as faim la prochaine fois, ne sois pas timide ! Viens nous voir et prends une bouchée !"r\bChrys: Salut, je ne suis pas vraiment le plus à l'aise avec les autres. Quand les gens me regardent, je..."�\bTu ne l'as peut-être pas remarqué, mais je viens de m'évanouir, genre, trois fois... J'essaie vraiment de m'habituer à ce que les gens me regardent."n\bEuh ! Si tu as un peu de temps, pourrais-tu m'enseigner quelques astuces de confiance en t'affrontant ?"r\bChrys: Je suis timide... et je me suis certainement senti seul auparavant, mais je suis doué en robotique."h\bQuoi ? Tu t'intéresses à la construction des machines ? Pourquoi ne pas l'avoir dit plus tôt ?"�\rOléa: Oh ! S'il te plaît, prends la pose là-bas. Oui ! Fantastique ! Voilà une excellente composition ! Je pourrais faire ton portrait !"�\rJ'imagine que je ne me suis pas présentée. Je suis Oléa, une artiste peintre. Enfin, je le suis plus ou moins, en fait je me promène juste en faisant mon art."T\rPeut-être que tes talents de combattant seront un chef-d'œuvre ! Allons-y !"h\rOléa: Hrmmm ! Eh bien, c'est frustrant. J'ai échoué à vraiment utiliser toute ma puissance..."�\rJ'aimerais dessiner la façon dont tu es quand tu te bats ! Refaisons un combat Pokémon à pleine puissance un de ces quatre, d'accord ?"�\rLilie: Ravie de te rencontrer ! Mon nom est Lilie. Commencer la journée avec un sourire chaleureux et une salutation me met toujours de bonne humeur !"j\rIl y a des dresseurs ici qui viennent te défier en combat, alors tu ne peux pas baisser ta garde !"L\rJe ferai de mon mieux pour qu'aucun Pokémon n'ait à finir blessé !"q\rLilie: Beurk, tu nous as eus. J'aurais aimé qu'on ait un peu plus de temps pour se préparer. C'est tout."a\rBon, se morfondre ne changera rien, n'est-ce pas ? Allez, essayons de retrouver le moral !"|\bDanh: Toi, là, tu veux prendre cette place ? J'aimerais bien rentrer chez moi. Je veux juste me la couler douce, tu vois."�\bTu es là pour me défier ? Quel fardeau, mince. C'est une mauvaise nouvelle. Enfin, je ne peux pas ignorer quelque chose comme ça."W\bNe prends pas ça trop au sérieux. Tu vas t'épuiser si tu es toujours pressé."�\bDanh: Je suis un vieil homme. J'essaie de ne plus avoir de rêves. Tant que les jeunes comme toi s'amusent, c'est tout ce que je peux demander."`\bEssayer de devenir encore plus fort, c'est bien aussi... Mais c'est un très long chemin."_\rPaulie: Alola ! C'est ainsi que nous saluons les gens dans ma ville natale chaque matin."�\rC'est une bonne chose de se lever tôt ! Tu devrais profiter au maximum du temps dont tu disposes ! Devoir m'occuper des champs chaque matin a fait de moi une lève-tôt."f\rOn dirait que tu es en train de te forger une belle histoire. Il est temps de devenir sérieux."\rPaulie: Oui. C'est regrettable que nous ayons perdu, mais j'imagine que nous n'avons plus qu'à t'encourager maintenant."V\rTu es sans aucun doute un dresseur prodigieux. Tu as fait un travail admirable."�\rAlyxia: Eh bien bonjour. Ravie de vous rencontrer tous, je suis Alyxia. Mes partenaires sont d'adorables et robustes petits types Roche. Nous allons vous réduire en poussière."e\rNos talents sont si polis qu'ils étincellent. Je commence à me sentir comme un diamant poli."`\rTu peux compter sur moi, gamin. Prépare-toi pour ton combat Pokémon le plus difficile !"f\rAlyxia: Les diamants ne brillent qu'après que le charbon a été poussé à sa limite absolue."w\rJe pense que ton voyage te réservera bien des surprises. J'espère qu'il te réservera aussi beaucoup de joies."�\rKahili: Salut, je suis une golfeuse professionnelle et une dresseuse. J'aspire à perfectionner mes compétences dans les deux domaines."�\rJe cherche à rendre mes matchs divertissants pour les spectateurs. De plus, j'aime jouer aux jeux que le public aime regarder."k\rVoyons jusqu'où nous pouvons voler. Les vents de la victoire souffleront pour moi et mes Pokémon !"X\rKahili: Ouf ! Combattre avec toi était comme une brise rafraîchissante ! Merci."s\rOh, est-ce que tu t'intéresses aussi au golf ? Tu pourrais avoir du talent. Je serais ravie de t'enseigner."v\bMolène: Salut, j'observais les étoiles jusqu'à ce que tu arrives... bâille... je suis encore super endormi."�\bCela fait un moment que je n'ai pas marché dans un nouvel endroit et rencontré autant de nouvelles personnes. C'est une sensation agréable."^\bMaintenant, je dois faire ce que je peux pour rester au niveau des autres. Combattons !"�\bMolène: Dans chaque situation, tu choisis les meilleures capacités et les meilleurs objets. Je dois donc moi aussi me creuser les méninges au combat..."L\bMais tu t'es montré plus malin que moi à la fin. Tu es sans égal !"{\rMargie: Salut, moi c'est Margie ! Je sais que je n'en ai pas l'air, mais ma famille était quasiment de la royauté."�\rJ'adore lire ! Les livres peuvent nous emmener dans des voyages vers des mondes fantastiques et nous raconter les histoires de gens très loin de nous."a\rPeut-être que notre combat sera lui aussi raconté dans les livres pendant des siècles !"W\rMargie: Ouf ! Eh bien, voilà mon espoir de te réduire en miettes qui s'envole."�\rJ'espère que nous pourrons continuer à faire des choses amusantes ensemble ! Il y a tout un monde de choses passionnantes qui nous attendent là-bas !"k\bPectorius: Oh oh oh, juste un doyen en promenade. Oh, un visiteur rare ! Bonjour, je suis Pectorius."y\bTu rencontreras des gens et des Pokémon... et tu rencontreras peut-être parfois des choses qui ne se voient pas."i\bPlus tu penseras à ces choses, plus ton esprit et ton corps deviendront forts ! Affrontons-nous !"s\bPectorius: ...Humph ! Ce résultat ne me surprend pas. Quel beau Dresseur... et quels beaux Pokémon aussi !"�\bUn combat palpitant comme celui-là m'envoie toujours un frisson dans tout le corps ! Je suis sûr que mes Pokémon l'ont ressenti aussi !"|\bTili: Hé, je suis Tili. Ravi de te rencontrer ! Je ne connais rien à cet endroit, alors tout est super cool et nouveau !"}\bLes combats ne consistent pas à savoir si on gagne ou si on perd. Il s'agit de savoir si on a la volonté de gagner !";\bJe veux faire tous les trucs amusants ! Combattons !"�\bTili : On a réussi à accomplir quelque chose d'assez incroyable, quand mes partenaires et moi étions tous en phase et voulions la même chose."b\bMais on dirait qu'on est encore à un pas d'être l'équipe et le Dresseur les plus forts !"R\bGladio: De quoi un Dresseur Pokémon a-t-il vraiment besoin pour réussir ?"t\bJe me suis entraîné pendant longtemps en essayant de trouver la réponse. J'imagine que chacun a la sienne."H\bMais au moins pour moi... Je veux le rival le plus fort possible."O\bGladio: Je ne t'ai pas battu, mais ça en valait quand même la peine..."~\bÀ tout le moins, je peux apprécier ta force bien plus maintenant qu'avant. Merci. Tu nous as aidés à devenir plus forts."d\rSelene: Alola ! Je suis Selene, c'est l'excitation non-stop depuis que je suis arrivée ici !"h\rSoyons si énergiques aujourd'hui que nous brillerons encore plus fort que le soleil et la lune !"0\rJe suis gonflée à bloc ! Allez, viens !"`\rSelene: Oh, c'est dommage. Mais j'ai de la chance de pouvoir vivre une telle excitation !"A\rRien qu'y penser me donne envie de te défier à nouveau !"~\bElio: Alola ! Mon nom est Elio. N'est-ce pas incroyable que quelqu'un ait pu construire quelque chose d'aussi immense ?"d\bCe club est assez difficile, mais on se fait plein de souvenirs pour la vie en le traversant."<\bJe serais ravi de te montrer de quoi je suis capable."9\bElio: Waouh ! Tu es fort. Tu as la classe, l'ami !"�\bLa force de l'amitié, être gentil, s'amuser... Peut-être devrais-je dire... que nous sommes tous devenus plus forts ensemble, hein ?"7\rOndine: Aïe ! Ça me met tellement en colère !"J\bJe retourne m'entraîner. Toi, continue d'avancer comme l'éclair !"b\bAuguste: Impressionnant ! Tu as fait preuve d'esprit et de connaissances pour me surpasser."_\bÇa me donne envie de continuer ! Sois passionné ! Ressens cette brûlante curiosité !"�\bAlbert: Les gens disent que les ailes peuvent être coupées par une secousse électrique... Je ne permettrai pas de telles insultes envers mes oiseaux !"d\bIls n'ont pas affronté mes ailes magnifiques qui m'ont emmené vers les plus hauts sommets !"b\bJe vais te montrer le vrai pouvoir des glorieux Pokémon volants ! Vents, restez avec moi !"B\bAlbert: Une défaite est une défaite. Tu es vraiment fort."g\bTant que j'ai de hautes ambitions, je peux voler aussi loin que je le souhaite. Tout comme toi !"\\bHéctor: Tu sembles être un dresseur avec de grandes connaissances sur les Pokémon."�\bMais je ne perds jamais quand il s'agit de Pokémon de type Insecte. Mes recherches vont faire de moi une autorité en la matière !"B\bLaisse-moi te démontrer ce que j'ai appris de mes études."d\bHector: Les Pokémon de type Insecte sont profonds. Il y a beaucoup de mystères à explorer."}\bMais je devrais aussi commencer mes études sur d'autres Pokémon. Je te suis reconnaissant de m'avoir fait réaliser cela."^\rBlanche: Salut ! Je suis Blanche. Les Pokémon sont super mignons ! Tu ne trouves pas ?"R\rEt comme je suis super mignonne aussi, je suis forcément douée pour ça !"f\rTu veux un combat avec moi, la talentueuse et super mignonne Blanche ? C'est un avertissement !"8\rBlanche: Ouaaaaaaahhhhhhh ! Espèce de méchant !"S\rSnif... Ne crois pas que c'est fini. Je serai plus forte la prochaine fois !"\\bMortimer: C'est bien que tu sois venu ; je peux voir ce que les autres ne voient pas."j\bEt encore un petit effort... et je serais un dresseur vraiment puissant, digne de rencontrer Ho-Oh."V\bMontre-moi le pouvoir que tu possèdes. Tu vas m'aider à atteindre ce niveau !"|\bMortimer: Je ne pense pas que nos potentiels soient si différents. Mais tu sembles avoir quelque chose que je n'ai pas..."q\bSi je me bats contre toi la prochaine fois, je pourrai voir quelque chose de nouveau encore... j'ai hâte."y\bChuck: WAHAHAH ! Alors tu es venu t'entraîner sous mon aile ? Non ? Alors tu viens de gâcher mon entraînement !"q\bLaisse-moi te dire, je suis assez costaud pour briser des pierres et fracasser des os ! Urggh ! Oooarrgh !"Y\bQuoi ? Ça n'a rien à voir avec les Pokémon ? C'est vrai ! Allez, battons-nous !"O\bChuck: Perdre contre un enfant. La nouvelle génération s'en sort bien."x\bMais une défaite est une défaite ! À partir de maintenant, je vais m'entraîner 24 heures sur 24 chaque jour !"X\rJasmine: Oh... euh, bonjour. Aimes-tu tes Pokémon ? Peu importe leur apparence ?"�\rL-les Pokémon de type Acier sont durs, froids, tranchants et vraiment forts... mais ils aspirent aussi à l'amour et aux soins..."8\rEuh... je ne mens pas. Puis-je te le prouver... ?"P\rJasmine: T-tu es bien poli, tant par ton talent que par ta gentillesse..."O\rEuh... je ne sais pas comment dire ça, mais merci d'aimer tes Pokémon."�\bFrédo: Je m'entraîne depuis bien avant ta naissance. Les Pokémon, tout comme les humains, ont vécu de nombreuses expériences et souffrances dans leur vie."V\bPuisque je suis ton aîné, laisse-moi t'enseigner ce que je veux dire par là."d\bFrédo: Des prouesses impressionnantes. Il est rare de trouver un dresseur aussi bon que toi."[\bQuand la neige fond, le printemps arrive. Chéris le temps passé avec tes Pokémon."m\rSandra: Quel culot de me regarder dans les yeux. Tu as devant toi le meilleur Maître Dragon du monde."`\rJe peux tenir tête même aux membres du Conseil 4. Dire que tu as le cran de me défier."D\rJe vais utiliser toute ma puissance contre toi. C'est parti !"r\rSandra: Quoi ?! Tu es là pour te vanter de ta victoire ? Très bien. Félicitations ! Heureux maintenant ?"[\rOhlala. Tu es un dresseur mystérieux, mais tu m'as fait réaliser ce qui me manque."k\bClément: Bienvenue, toi et le Destin m'avez choisi. Permets-moi de me présenter. Je suis Clément."s\bJe me suis entraîné partout dans le monde pour atteindre ce stade où les gens reconnaissent ma puissance."s\bJe me suis entraîné partout dans le monde pour atteindre ce stade où les gens reconnaissent ma puissance."i\bClément: J'ai observé tes techniques - tu es le meilleur sans aucun doute. Je n'ai aucun regret."9\bCe combat entrera dans l'histoire. J'en suis sûr."j\bKoga: Fwahahaha ! Alors tu m'as trouvé, moi qui vis dans l'ombre. Cela me fait frissonner de joie."|\bMon style complexe va te confondre et te détruire. Les vraies terreurs ne sont pas seulement une question de force brute."R\bPrépare-toi à être la victime de mes techniques... Tu verras bientôt..."\bKoga: Je t'ai soumis à tout ce que j'ai pu rassembler. Mais mes efforts ont échoué. Je dois affiner mes compétences."L\bJ'ai hâte de te voir mettre tes capacités à l'épreuve à nouveau."S\bAldo: Un entraînement extrême permet de libérer un potentiel inexploité."q\bJe ne vois aucune peur en toi. Tu es déterminé. Alors, es-tu l'un des dresseurs les plus forts du coin ?"[\bPeu importe, je te défie ! Incline-toi devant notre puissance écrasante. Hoo hah !"<\bAldo: Tu tiens toujours bon. Mon défi est satisfait."K\bJe n'ai pas d'autres mots. Ne te donne pas de mal pour moi. Avance !"E\rMarion: Alors quoi ? Tu veux me défier ? Comme c'est amusant."w\rSi tu n'en as pas entendu parler, je suis connue pour mes tactiques de domination. Tu penses pouvoir me gérer ?"&\rEssaie. Divertis-moi. Allons-y."w\rMarion: Il n'y a pas de Pokémon faibles. Les dresseurs vraiment talentueux gagnent avec leurs Pokémon favoris."d\rJ'aime ton style. Tu sais ce qui est important. Contacte-moi quand tu seras libre à nouveau."�\bPierrick: Je ne suis qu'un dresseur qui a décidé de marcher fièrement avec des Pokémon de type Roche. Chaque jour, nous nous endurcissons en déterrant des fossiles."�\bPourrais-je te montrer à quel point nous sommes robustes ? J'ai besoin de voir la robustesse des Pokémon qui combattent à tes côtés aussi !"\bÇa va déménager !"i\bPierrick: On a perdu le contrôle là. Avec un talent comme le tien, il est naturel que tu gagnes."y\bLa prochaine fois, j'aimerais te défier à une course aux fossiles dans les souterrains de la région de Sinnoh !"�\rFlo: Je ne peux pas nier que les types Plante ont beaucoup de points faibles, mais ce n'est pas le seul facteur pour décider du vainqueur !"|\rMes Pokémon poussent bien et sont forts. Tu ne peux pas te tromper avec moi ! Allez, passons aux choses sérieuses !"2\rBattons-nous ! Un combat rapide, d'accord ?"P\rFlo: Comment te sens-tu ? Je voulais gagner et me vanter de mes Pokémon."i\rJ'essaie d'être aussi coriace que possible, mais c'est toi le vainqueur aujourd'hui. Incroyable !"�\rMélina: Ravie de te voir. Je ne sais pas vraiment ce que cela signifie d'être forte, mais je ferai de mon mieux en tant que dresseuse."D\rGrâce à mon entraînement, je gagne lentement en confiance."E\rJe prends aussi les combats très au sérieux. Quand tu veux !"^\rMélina: Apprends de ton ennemi en gagnant, et apprends de ton ennemi en perdant aussi."L\rOui, tout est une expérience. J'ai encore une marge de progression !"u\bLovis: Le ring est ma mer agitée~ Les vagues imposantes m'ont façonné~ Crash ! Crash ! Lovis le Teigneux~ !"�\bMes Pokémon ont été endurcis par les eaux blanches et tempétueuses ! Ils encaisseront tout ce que tu leur lanceras et t'entraîneront ensuite vers le fond !"5\bLa victoire sera nôtre ! Allez, c'est parti !"P\bLovis: Houah ! C'est déjà fini ! Comment dire ça... J'en veux encore !"�\bJe m'amuse en combattant, que je gagne ou que je perde ! J'espère que tes victoires mettront plus de sourires sur les visages des gens !"u\rKiméra : Ah, oui, es-tu ici pour un défi ? J'espère beaucoup que tu les apprécies, tu as l'air très fort."N\rMais je gagnerai, non ? Parce que moi est bien sûr très fantastique !"Z\rEnfin, qu'il en soit ainsi. Je souhaite te montrer le combat à la danse classique."f\rKiméra : Excusez-moi ! Je suis stupéfaite ! Très très fort ! Ton pouvoir est si admirable !"q\rMerci beaucoup d'avoir dansé avec moi ! Si jamais tu as le temps, reviens me voir, d'accord ? Au revoir !"n\bCharles: Dresseur ! Tu es jeune, tout comme mon fils Pierrick, en quête de défis à travers le monde."�\bAvec plus de dresseurs comme toi qui prennent la relève, l'avenir du monde Pokémon est radieux ! Mais en tant que mur pour vous les jeunes, je ne compte pas m'effacer tout de suite !"a\bJ'accepte ton défi. J'ai la confiance nécessaire pour résister à toutes tes attaques !"s\bCharles: Gwahahaha ! Tu étais assez fort pour faire tomber mon équipe favorite. Je reconnais ta puissance."^\bJ'ai vu quelque chose de grand en toi. Montre ta puissance aux autres dresseurs aussi !"X\rGladys: C'est toi mon adversaire ? Bien sûr ! J'attendais quelqu'un de coriace !"X\rMais je devrais te dire, je suis coriace parce que je sais comment me concentrer."R\rJe vais te montrer exactement ce que je veux dire. Prépare-toi à perdre !"�\rGladys: Waouh ! Tu es génial ! Tu as gagné mon respect ! Je pense que ta concentration et ta volonté nous ont totalement renversés !"T\rMais la prochaine fois, je me concentrerai encore plus et je ne perdrai pas !"u\bTanguy: Soupir... Très bien. Ce n'est pas souvent que j'ai des challengers. Mais ils ont tous été ennuyeux."l\bJe n'ai même pas transpiré pour les battre tous. Mais bon, j'imagine qu'on ferait mieux d'en finir."]\bJ'espère que tu es celui qui me rappellera à quel point il est amusant de se battre."}\bTanguy: ...Héhéhé. Hahahah ! ...C'était le moment le plus amusant que j'ai vécu depuis... je ne sais plus quand !"l\bÇa m'excite de savoir que toi et ton équipe continuerez à vous battre vers de plus hauts sommets !"w\bAaron: Bonjour ! C'est un plaisir de te rencontrer ! Je devrais expliquer que je suis un immense fan d'insectes."j\bIls sont peut-être méchants et cruels, mais ils sont beaux aussi. Aimerais-tu relever mon défi ?"Y\bJe veux devenir parfait, tout comme mes Pokémon Insecte. Laisse-moi t'affronter !"�\bAaron: Être parfait est décidément une affaire profonde et complexe. Je concède la défaite, mais je pense que tu es venu voir à quel point les Pokémon de type Insecte peuvent être géniaux !"g\rTerry: Eh bien, eh bien. Tu es tout à fait adorable, mais tu as du cran. Ahaha ! Je suis Terry."[\rJ'ai une préférence pour les Pokémon de type Sol. Vastes, larges et accueillants."K\rAlors, montreras-tu à cette vieille dame tout ce que tu as appris ?"�\rTerry: Tu n'es pas n'importe qui, petit. J'aime la façon dont tes Pokémon et toi avez gagné en travaillant comme un seul être."i\rC'est ce qui te rend si fort. Ahahaha ! Je pense que tu peux aller aussi loin que tu le souhaites."�\bAdrien: Yo ! Mon nom est Adrien ! Les combats sont des chocs entre les esprits brûlants des Pokémon, ils ne concernent pas les apparences ou ce qui est faible ou fort."�\bIl s'agit de savoir si les combattants peuvent brûler intensément ou non ! J'ai pu sentir vos esprits ardents ! Laisse-moi te dire, mon cœur est toujours en feu !":\bTrès bien, l'ami ! On va mettre un peu de piment !"�\bAdrien: Oh, j'aurais dû...! Je n'y crois pas ! J'ai perdu ! Je ne t'ai pas sous-estimé... mais je ne m'attendais pas à ce que tu gagnes !"B\bJe suis bluffé ! Tes Pokémon et toi, vous assurez grave !"S\bLucio: Ah, tu arrives au bon moment. Je viens tout juste de finir mon livre."|\bPermets-moi de me présenter. Je suis Lucio, spécialiste du type Psy. Tu as prouvé ta valeur en arrivant jusqu'ici."h\bJe crains donc de devoir me donner à fond contre toi pour être à la hauteur de ma réputation."`\bLucio : Des hauts et des bas. Tu es aussi remarquable que l'ouvrage que je viens de lire."x\bS'il te plaît, emprunte la sortie sur ta droite, pendant que je vais lire quelques livres pour calmer mes nerfs."j\bRachid: Hum. Mon nom est Rachid. J'aime les Pokémon de type Plante, ils sont toujours si profonds."Y\bAimerais-tu participer à un match contre moi ? J'ai encore beaucoup à apprendre."Y\bRien de personnel... Sans rancune... Nous allons nous battre, quoi qu'il advienne."�\bRachid: Quelle surprise... Tu es très fort, n'est-ce pas ? J'imagine que mes frères ne seraient pas capables de te battre non plus."d\bJe suis content d'avoir pu au moins faire ressortir le charme délicieux des Pokémon Plante."{\bArmando: Écoute un peu ! Mon nom est Armando ! J'enflamme tout avec mes Pokémon Feu, comme des tacos au habanero !"b\bC'est comme ça ! Je vais te montrer ce que mes Pokémon flamboyants et moi pouvons faire !"G\bTu es bouillant toi aussi, non ? Prépare-toi pour la canicule !"X\bArmando: Waouh ! Tu as le feu sacré ! Tu as tout brûlé sur ton passage, hein ?"B\bMais tu dois m'accorder que je me suis bien défendu, non ?"~\bNoa: Ravi de faire ta connaissance, je suis Noa, spécialiste des Pokémon Eau. Ils sont rafraîchissants comme je les aime."v\bC'est à mes estimés Pokémon et à moi-même que tu dois faire face. Aurais-tu l'amabilité de nous obliger ?"k\bTout comme l'eau s'écoule naturellement des hauteurs vers les bas-fonds, ma victoire est naturelle."�\bNoa: Incroyable ! Même s'il y avait de nombreuses raisons, tu as réussi à affronter quelqu'un d'aussi impressionnant que moi !"k\bJe compte m'entraîner à nouveau dans le but de te vaincre quand tu seras devenu encore plus fort !"x\rAloé: Bienvenue ! Te voilà enfin arrivée jusqu'ici ! Ne sois pas timide ! Tu es trop jeune pour être gêné !"�\rQuand j'étais petite, mon père rapportait toujours des os qu'il déterrait. J'étais captivée par ce qu'ils étaient autrefois !"�\rMaintenant, je vais aussi étudier comment tu te bats avec les Pokémon que tu as élevés avec tant d'amour. La curiosité est le sel de la vie !"j\rAloé: Ton style de combat est si envoûtant. C'est charmant. Je suis ravie de t'avoir rencontré !"g\rLe combat est une seconde nature pour toi, n'est-ce pas ? Ta victoire en est le résultat, non ?"m\bArtie: Ah ha ! Pleins feux ! Mes Pokémon Insecte frétillent d'excitation à l'idée de t'affronter !"\bSi le combat fait ressortir la beauté de mes compagnons, ce sera une scène qui fera vibrer mon cœur, victoire ou défaite."�\bMhm... J'ai l'impression que je peux peindre un tableau comme jamais auparavant. OK ! J'entends ma muse de combat haut et fort. Allons-y sans plus attendre !"r\bArtie: Oh... j'ai perdu. Peu importe ! Perdre contre toi ne me dérange pas, car tu es INCROYABLEMENT fort."T\bVictoire ou défaite, les Pokémon Insecte sont toujours cool et magnifiques."�\rInézia: Oui mon grand. Je suis Inézia, le mannequin de renommée mondiale. Bienvenue sur ma scène ! Mes Pokémon adorés et les tiens vont s'affronter."e\rC'est fini ! Quand j'en suis certaine, je sens une décharge électrique traverser mon corps !"p\rJe veux ressentir cette sensation, alors maintenant mes Pokémon adorés vont te faire tourner la tête !"d\rInézia: Oh là là... Tu as un style de combat très doux. Tu m'as choquée de part en part."{\rJe veux que mes Pokémon baignent aussi sous les projecteurs glamour. En ce sens, tes Pokémon brillaient de mille feux !"|\bBardane: Humph ! Tu m'as fait attendre, pas vrai, gamin ? Alors c'est toi le Dresseur dont tout le monde parle, hein."n\bTa progression dépend de ton envie de gagner ! Si tu veux gagner, ne cherche pas d'excuses ! Compris ?"x\bSi tu as mal au ventre, oublie le combat ! Enfin, je me fais peut-être du souci pour rien en ce qui te concerne."�\bBardane: Pour un p'tit jeune, tu as un style de combat imposant. Je me demande quel genre de voyage tu as fait pour devenir aussi fort."Y\bMais bon, je n'aime toujours pas perdre ! Reviens ici un de ces quatre, d'accord ?"w\rCarolina: Hé hé ! Je t'attendais. Tu es un dresseur solide qui peut affronter le vent sans se faire emporter !"i\rCe sera donc un duel pour décider qui est au sommet, n'est-ce pas ? J'adore être sur les cimes !"c\rOn voit à des kilomètres depuis les hauteurs ! Alors, si on s'amusait un peu, toi et moi ?"C\rCarolina: Tu es un dresseur assez incroyable, n'est-ce pas ?"�\rMes Pokémon et moi sommes heureux, car pour la première fois depuis longtemps, nous nous sommes battus de toutes nos forces."a\bZhu: Ravi de vous rencontrer. Je suis Zhu. Par le passé, j'ai été blessé et déprimé."}\bPuis quelqu'un a partagé ceci avec moi... Il y a une force dans le fait d'être avec les autres et avec les Pokémon."�\bRecevoir leur soutien rend plus fort. Je vais te montrer ce pouvoir que j'ai découvert, et qui est désormais gravé dans mon cœur."N\bZhu: Tu es fort ! Non, vous l'êtes tous les deux, tes Pokémon et toi."Y\bLes stars de ce spectacle, de cette histoire, c'étaient vous. Vous avez bien agi."j\rStrykna: Tu ne fais rien ! Qu'est-ce que t'en sais~ ?! Tu ne fais rien ! Comment tu vas changer~ ?!"W\rJe m'occupe de toi~! Je vais te coller un choc toxique et t'ouvrir l'esprit~!!!!"n\rJe suis Strykna~! Écoutez bien~! Je vais faire vibrer le public jusqu'à ce qu'il tombe de sa chaise~!"�\rStrykna: Tu n'as pas gagné ! C'est juste moi qui ai perdu ! J'ai été faible et j'ai fait ressentir à mes Pokémon à quel point la défaite pue !"f\rFais attention~! La prochaine fois qu'on se voit, je te donnerai un choc toxique comme promis~!"q\bTcheren: Veux-tu montrer ta force en gagnant, ou veux-tu apprendre ce que signifie réellement combattre ?"�\bMême blessés, mes Pokémon se battront pour moi sur un seul ordre. Je pense que tu estimeras et feras plus confiance à tes Pokémon si tu gardes ce fait près de ton cœur."x\bC'est vrai ! Je me bats de toutes mes forces pour trouver la relation idéale entre les Pokémon et les humains !"�\bTcheren: Je vais continuer à affronter de nombreux dresseurs et Pokémon ainsi, et si je peux apprendre quel genre de personne je suis, cela m'ouvrira la voie."�\bJe suis sûr que ce chemin me mènera à devenir la personne que je dois être. Les Pokémon seront toujours avec nous sur notre route."�\bWatson: En tant que dresseur, j'ai simplement cherché à accroître ma force. Mais maintenant je vieillis, et je pense au temps qu'il me reste..."g\bCe que je recherche maintenant, c'est un jeune dresseur capable de me montrer un avenir radieux."�\bBattons-nous avec tout ce que nous avons : ton talent, mon expérience, et l'amour avec lequel nous avons élevé nos Pokémon."v\bWatson: Merveilleux. Je suis reconnaissant que nous ayons eu la chance de nous rencontrer et de nous affronter."X\bCrée un avenir radieux, pas seulement pour toi, mais pour les autres également."[\bAmana: Uihaa~ Salut ! C'est donc toi mon adversaire ! C'est une belle prise, direct."p\bJe suis fort comme l'immensité de l'océan. Tu vas te faire emporter, c'est sûr. Enfin, assez discuté."A\bEt si on faisait quelques vagues pour emporter le public ?"V\bAmana: Tu n'as pas seulement l'air fort, tu es une vraie menace en profondeur !"t\bTout comme une mer déchaînée qui balaye tout ! Uihaa~ J'ai été emporté par ta puissance et ta passion !"�\bPieris: Eh bien, eh bien... Les challengers arrivent les uns après les autres. Enfin, peu importe, la vie est un combat sérieux de toute façon."�\bIl est plus important de maîtriser les cartes qu'on a en main que de se plaindre de celles qui ont été distribuées à l'adversaire."�\bCe qui sera déterminé ici, c'est lequel de nous deux peut absorber la lumière et l'éclat de ce match. Que nos destins s'accomplissent."�\bPieris: Que tu puisses te battre au maximum de tes forces, ou que la chance te sourit. Là où il y a un vainqueur, il y a aussi un perdant."^\bUne défaite est une défaite. En ce moment, tes Pokémon et toi brillez de mille feux."�\rAnis: Les pensées du dresseur avec l'esprit du Pokémon... C'est un extrait d'un roman que j'ai écrit. J'adore écrire sur les Pokémon !"�\rLes débuts sont importants, que ce soit dans un bon roman ou un bon combat. Oh, excusez-moi. Vous êtes un challenger, c'est bien ça ?":\rAimeriez-vous être le sujet de mon nouveau roman ?"j\rAnis: As-tu déjà eu l'impression de perdre tes mots quand quelque chose te touche profondément ?"�\rJe suis écrivain, mais en ce moment j'ai du mal à mettre mes sentiments en mots. Tu as été tout simplement impressionnant !"H\bKunz: Mon nom est Kunz, le premier disciple de mon mentor, Goyah."�\bAfin de maîtriser l'art du combat, j'ai continué à m'entraîner. Tu parcours toi aussi un chemin similaire avec tes Pokémon."T\bMon intention est de te tester pour t'emmener aux limites de ta force. Kiai !"\bKunz: Il n'existe pas de Pokémon unique qui soit le plus fort, ni de meilleure combinaison. C'est pour cela qu'il est difficile de continuer à gagner. There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."\bCependant, je pense qu'un cœur qui désire la force est un idéal précieux. Je te respecte, car tu le possèdes. Ouf !"Y\rPercila: Qui êtes-vous ? Quelle impolitesse de venir troubler mon sommeil. Hmf..."�\rVous semblez posséder un mélange de force et de gentillesse. Ce que je recherche chez un adversaire, c'est une force superbe..."x\rTrès bien. Faites de votre mieux pour ne pas m'ennuyer avec un combat qui donne envie de bâiller. C'est clair ?"p\rPercila: Gagner est important, mais ce qui compte plus, c'est de savoir si j'ai fait mieux cette fois-ci."�\rJe veux m'améliorer et gagner avec plus d'élégance, je t'invite donc à être mon adversaire à nouveau dans le futur, si tu le souhaites."l\bGuajava: Toi ! Ouais ! Je le savais, tu sens la puissance ! Mais sais-tu à quel point je suis fort ?"a\bHé, hé ! Regarde-moi ! Je veux me battre avec toi ! Mes Pokémon n'en ont pas eu assez !"P\bOn va voir qui est le plus fort ! Faisons tout pour être les meilleurs !"�\bGuajava: Trop excitant ! La combinaison entre tes Pokémon et toi ! Quel travail d'équipe incroyable ! Tu peux aller n'importe où avec ça !"�\bHé ! Hé !! Tu as intérêt à continuer de viser plus haut et à promettre de revenir me défier ! Sinon, je serai au sommet en un rien de temps !"e\rNéphie: Ouf... c'était fantastique ! Tes Pokémon et toi étiez parfaitement synchronisés !"}\bKiawe: Prodigieux ! Être transporté par l'enthousiasme d'un adversaire... Rien ne me donne plus envie de combattre !"z\rJ'utilise mon intuition de chef pour choisir la crème de la crème ! Cuisinons tout cela dans le feu de l'action !"h\rEt si tu as faim la prochaine fois, ne sois pas timide ! Viens nous voir et prends une bouchée !"�\rAlyxia: Eh bien bonjour. Ravie de vous rencontrer tous, je suis Alyxia. Mes partenaires sont d'adorables et robustes petits types Roche. Nous allons vous réduire en poussière."M\rBianca: Ahhh, je suis encore arrivée un peu en retard ? D-é-solée !"�\rTu sais quoi ? Quand j'ai voyagé dans diverses régions, il m'est arrivé tellement de choses, mais je suis si contente d'être partie en voyage !"u\rC'est dur à expliquer avec des mots, mais je veux exprimer ce sentiment à travers mes Pokémon. Combattons !"\rBianca: Merci d'avoir été mon adversaire ! Ouaip ! J'ai appris beaucoup sur la façon de tirer le meilleur de chacun !"?\rOh, j'allais oublier ! Félicitations pour ta victoire !"^Dommage ! Tu reçois tout de même quelques Crédits du Grandeur Club pour avoir essayé.""Tu as obtenu \v[61] crédits."Ding dong !"x\bLuc-ker: J'ai fait une grave erreur de jugement et je ne demande pas de pardon. Je suis juste là pour m'excuser."�\bJe reconnais à quel point le Défi Titan est difficile, alors je vais t'aider un peu. Fais attention à ce qu'il y a sur ma gauche la prochaine fois dans le Défi Titan."�\bAlbert: Les gens disent que les ailes peuvent être coupées par une secousse électrique... Je ne permettrai pas de telles insultes envers mes oiseaux !"~\bMais je devrais aussi commencer à étudier d'autres Pokémon. Je te suis reconnaissant de m'avoir fait réaliser cela."[\bMortimer: C'est bien que tu sois venu, je peux voir ce que les autres ne voient pas."Y\bQuoi ? Ça n'a rien à voir avec les Pokémon ? C'est vrai ! Allez, battons-nous !"O\rEuh... je ne sais pas comment dire ça, mais merci d'aimer tes Pokémon."�\bFrédo: Je m'entraîne depuis bien avant ta naissance. Les Pokémon, tout comme les humains, ont vécu de nombreuses expériences et souffrances."[\bQuand la neige fond, le printemps arrive. Chéris le temps passé avec tes Pokémon."[\rOhlala. Tu es un dresseur mystérieux, mais tu m'as fait réaliser ce qui me manque."k\bClément: Bienvenue, toi et le destin m'avez choisi. Permets-moi de me présenter. Je suis Clément."�\bKoga: Je t'ai soumis à tout ce que j'ai pu rassembler. Mais mes efforts ont échoué. Je dois affiner mes compétences encore davantage."q\bJe ne vois aucune peur en toi. Tu es déterminé. Alors, tu es l'un des dresseurs les plus forts du coin ?"<\bAldo: Tu tiens toujours bon. Mon défi est satisfait."�\rMarion: Pokémon puissants. Pokémon faibles. Ce n'est que la perception égoïste des gens. Les dresseurs vraiment talentueux devraient gagner avec leurs Pokémon favoris."\\bPeter: Je suis le chef du Conseil 4. Tu peux m'appeler Peter, le dresseur de Dragons."�\bLes dragons sont des créatures mythiques et sacrées. Ils sont difficiles à capturer et à élever, mais leurs pouvoirs sont supérieurs !"Q\bPeter: Plus de mots. Il est temps que je te teste au combat. Es-tu prêt ?"^\bPeter: Je n'arrive pas à y croire. Je suis témoin de l'ascension d'un grand Dresseur."v\bTes Pokémon ont répondu à ta nature forte et intègre. Tu vas continuer à devenir plus fort, n'est-ce pas ?"U\bSilver: Casse-pieds. Tu n'as pas l'air fort. Arrête de m'ennuyer et tire-toi."M\bJ'ai dit d'arrêter de fourrer ton nez partout. Quel est ton but ici ?"V\bC'est ça. Je vais utiliser toute ma puissance contre toi. Et après, dégage !"f\bSilver: Je ne gagne toujours pas après tout cet entraînement. Je dois croire en mes Pokémon."q\bQuoi qu'il en soit, je n'abandonne pas. Je te battrai la prochaine fois que tu reviendras. Trace ta route."R\rCélesta: Wooo, tu as l'œil vif. Tu as l'air plus affûté que les autres."B\rTu es ici pour chercher un défi, j'ai raison ? Moi aussi !"-\rEt c'est tant mieux. Ayons un combat !"U\rCélesta: Awww. On dirait que j'ai pris la défaite cette fois. Pas de chance."C\rEt tu es vraiment fort. Tu as dû voyager longtemps et loin."[\bLuth: Oh, hé ? Je suis Luth. Qu'est-ce que tu fais là ? Tu es en pleine aventure ?"{\bJe suis aussi dans une aventure amusante. Je peux surmonter n'importe quel obstacle, tant que j'ai mes Pokémon avec moi."M\bJe me sens bien aujourd'hui, ça te dit un match ? Ici et maintenant !"H\bLuth: Ça marche. Tu m'as eu. C'était un combat impressionnant !"c\bJ'espère qu'on pourra se recroiser une fois qu'on aura terminé nos aventures respectives !"�\bPierrick: Je ne suis qu'un dresseur qui a décidé de marcher fièrement avec des Pokémon de type Roche. Chaque jour, nous nous endurcissons en déterrant des fossiles."p\bIls sont peut-être méchants et cruels, mais ils sont aussi magnifiques. Aimerais-tu relever mon défi ?"\rCynthia : Quand on affronte un Dresseur en combat, on peut tout apprendre sur lui. Un seul regard sur toi m'en dit long."s\rQuels Pokémon ils ont, quelles capacités ils ont apprises. Quels objets ils font porter à leurs Pokémon."D\rPas besoin de mots alors. Moi, Cynthia, j'accepte ton défi !"�\rCynthia: C'était excellent. Vraiment, un combat exceptionnel. Tu as apporté le soutien dont tes Pokémon avaient besoin pour maximiser leur puissance."l\rJ'applaudis sincèrement ta victoire dans ce défi. Mais la route devant toi est encore très longue."�\bBarry: Hé, toi là-bas ! Ouais, tu ferais mieux de me regarder ! Parce que je vais devenir le meilleur Dresseur de tous les temps !"M\bEt c'est moi que tu vas défier ! Tu vas être impressionné par moi !"R\bEnvoie tes Pokémon maintenant ! Ou je te donne une amende de 10 millions !"b\bBarry: ... ! C'est pas grave, ceci dit. Continue de devenir plus fort. C'est ce que je dis."U\bPlus tu progresses, plus mes Pokémon et moi devenons coriaces aussi, tu sais."�\rAurore: Salut. Tes Pokémon et toi semblez liés par un lien étroit. J'ai toujours pensé que les gens et les Pokémon n'étaient pas faits pour avancer seuls."i\rC'est pour ça que je me fais un point d'honneur d'aider les autres quand ils ont des problèmes !"Y\rLaisse-moi te donner un coup de main pour voir si tu peux me battre et continuer !"v\rAurore : On dirait que mes Pokémon ont été un peu blessés. Mais pas d'inquiétude, on va vite se remettre !"a\rSi jamais tu as besoin d'un coup de main pour l'entraînement, je suis là ! Cherche-moi !"m\bLouka: Salut ! Comment se passe ton séjour ici ? Au début, c'était un peu décourageant pour moi..."^\bMais avoir autant de dresseurs forts à affronter, c'est aussi excitant, n'est-ce pas ?"=\bCeci étant dit... Prêt ou pas, essayons nous aussi !"J\bLouka : Il s'avère que c'est toi le plus fort ! C'est surprenant !"i\bAvoir ce combat a poussé mes sens à leurs limites. J'ai besoin de faire une sieste après ça..."v\bC'est vrai ! Je me bats avec tout ce que j'ai pour trouver la relation idéale entre les Pokémon et les gens !"b\bGoyah: Bonjour, mon nom est Goyah. Je suis un dresseur avec un vif intérêt pour le monde."�\bL'un de mes objectifs est de dire aux gens à quel point il est merveilleux de marcher vers l'avenir ensemble avec les Pokémon."�\bJe me sens exalté quand je vois un autre dresseur, et je me demande lequel de nous deux est le plus fort. L'excitation monte à son comble !"h\bGoyah: Bien joué ! Ceux qui changent le monde sont toujours ceux qui ont poursuivi leurs rêves."�\bQuand les choses ne se passent pas comme tu le pensais, continue silencieusement de t'entraîner ! Un jour, tu seras capable de te battre de la manière que tu imaginais !"]\rIris: Salut ! Je suis Iris ! On m'appelle la fille qui connaît le cœur des dragons !"�\rTu sais quoi ? J'ai vraiment hâte d'avoir des combats sérieux avec des dresseurs forts ! Ils désirent la victoire de chaque fibre de leur être !".\rOK ! Prépare-toi ! Je vais te battre !"m\rIris: Je suis déçue de ne pas avoir pu gagner ! Mais tu sais quoi ? Plus que ça, je suis heureuse !"�\rJe veux dire, allez. Après ce combat sérieux, toi et moi avons appris à nous connaître mieux qu'avant ! Ouaip ! C'est certain !"�\bMatis: Matis est là pour évaluer tes capacités en tant que dresseur Pokémon. Je ne suis pas un rigolo, pour ton information."a\bDonne le meilleur de toi-même maintenant, sinon c'est retour à la case départ pour toi."=\bMaintenant, viens m'affronter avec tout ce que tu as !"n\bMatis: Grâce à toi, j'ai accompli ce que je m'étais fixé. J'aurais aimé pouvoir t'en montrer plus."r\bTu es incroyable. Obtiens la preuve que tu es un dresseur dont tes Pokémon peuvent être fiers ! À plus !"c\rLudvina: Moi, c'est Ludvina ! Quand il s'agit de combats Pokémon, tu peux compter sur moi !"d\rFais-moi confiance, je suis vraiment douée pour ça. Si tu ne me crois pas, alors allons-y !"=\rCe combat est à moi ! Je ne tomberai pas facilement !"F\rLudvina : Awwww, j'ai tout donné, et j'ai quand même perdu..."^\rMais c'était vraiment amusant ! Il est déjà si tard ? Le temps passe vraiment vite !"|\bLudwig: Hé. Je suis Ludwig. J'imagine que je suis un peu plus près d'être l'un des dresseurs les plus forts maintenant."i\bJe suis sûr qu'on a parcouru un long chemin pour devenir ce que nous sommes aujourd'hui. Mmm-hmm."M\bJ'ai hâte de me battre contre toi, mais restons amis après ça, ok ?"G\bLudwig: On dirait que tu as la victoire entre les mains, l'ami !"X\bMais la prochaine fois, je te donnerai un match à t'en décrocher la mâchoire !"�\rEcho: Je suis Echo ! Mon but est de m'entraîner dur, de devenir plus forte, et de me battre de tout mon cœur contre toutes sortes de dresseurs !"P\rTu dois faire de ton mieux, pour que je ne t'écrase pas d'un seul coup !"K\rMaintenant, pourrais-tu te battre avec moi, s'il te plaît ? Youpi !"n\rEcho: Héhé. C'était très satisfaisant. Tu t'es donné à fond et tu m'as donné du fil à retordre."y\rMais c'est important de rester positif, tu vois ? Faire ce premier petit pas te propulsera vraiment vers l'avant !"Y\bMélis: Salut ! Je suis Mélis. C'est génial d'être ici, face à toi maintenant."i\bMes adversaires sont de plus en plus stimulants. Il y a des tonnes de gens incroyables à admirer."-\bSi ça te va, commençons maintenant !"i\bMélis: Ça veut dire pas de pause pour moi ! Je m'entraînerai tous les jours pour m'améliorer !"j\bC'était génial de se battre contre toi. Tu ferais bien d'être sur tes gardes la prochaine fois !"\bAlistair: J'y... vais..."V\rSally: Montre-moi ce dont tu es capable quand tu te donnes à fond, mon enfant."M\rLona: Tu ne pourras pas t'échapper quand je t'aurai gelé sur place !"@\bDhilan: Prépare-toi, je suis plutôt féroce en combat !"e\bTarak: Je sens mes partenaires frémir d'impatience... On va passer un pur moment de Maître !"P\bNabil: Montrons à tout le monde le plus grand combat de tous les temps !"[\bVictor: Mes Pokémon sont parés et prêts ! Tu veux faire un test de dégustation ?"B\rGloria: Ok, je suis gonflée à bloc et prête à y aller !"p\rLiv: Une fois que je vous aurai mis en pièces, le Président Shehroz sera un peu plus près de son but !"m\bShehroz: Montre-moi ton énergie, nécessaire pour maintenir ce monde brillant et scintillant en vie !"]\rMai: Ayons un combat amusant et intense que nos deux équipes apprécieront vraiment !":\rGarana: Sans plus attendre, montre-moi ton équipe."x\bChammal: Peut-être qu'un combat Pokémon avec toi raviverait ce souvenir... Me ferais-tu l'honneur d'un combat ?"_\rSabi: Eh bien, tu auras tes récompenses... si tu arrives à gagner contre moi d'abord !"m\bGarrett: Si tu espères remporter la victoire, nous devons juger si tu es à la hauteur de la tâche !"|\bBeni: Tu es l'adversaire digne de mes grandes techniques de ninja qui ont couvé pendant toutes ces longues années !"f\rBélila: Montre-moi ce que tu sais faire. J'observerai attentivement chacun de tes mouvements !"7\bCormier: Le plus fort d'entre nous l'emportera !"_\bAdamantin: Oh, je passe les salutations ! On n'a plus de temps à perdre ! Commençons !"_\rNacchara: Comparons ce que nous savons pour voir lequel de nos mondes est le plus vaste."q\rPenséa: C'est la seule fois où je devrai m'excuser, pour renforcer encore ta détermination. Combattons."�\bVolo: IL EST TEMPS DE CRÉER UN TOUT NOUVEAU MONDE ! Tout le monde disparaîtra, pour le forgeage d'un NOUVEAU MONDE MEILLEUR !"^\bMais avoir autant de dresseurs forts à affronter, c'est aussi excitant, n'est-ce pas ?"W\rInfirmière Joëlle: Bonjour, \PN. Tes Pokémon ont l'air vraiment mal en point."+\rVeux-tu que je soigne tes Pokémon ?"\rLaisse-moi t'aider."5\rTout va bien maintenant ! Prends soin de toi !"\rPas d'inquiétude alors."_\rInfirmière Joëlle: Désolée \PN, c'est tout ce que j'avais comme objets sous la main."u\bChen: Bonjour ! Mon nom est Chen ! On m'appelle le Professeur Pokémon ! J'étudie les Pokémon de profession."�\bPour certains, les Pokémon sont des animaux de compagnie. D'autres les utilisent pour les combats. Tu as besoin de ton propre Pokémon pour ta protection, surtout ici."q\bMais plutôt que d'en parler, tu apprendras davantage par l'expérience. Tiens, viens te battre avec moi !"�\bChen: Alors, tu as gagné ! Tu comprends que ta victoire n'est pas seulement ton propre fait. Le lien que tu partages avec tes Pokémon est merveilleux."�\bJ'espère que tu ne négliges pas ton Pokédex non plus ! Quand il sera terminé, ta vision des Pokémon aura probablement changé !"b\bGiovanni: Tiens... impressionnant de te voir ici... avec un personnage dangereux comme moi."o\bJe dois t'avertir que ce n'est pas un endroit pour les enfants comme toi. Mais puisque tu m'as vu ici..."E\bPour ton insolence, tu vas connaître un monde de souffrance !"I\bGiovanni: Tu as un certain regard... Ça me rappelle... quelqu'un."^\bJe vais te dire ceci maintenant... Peu importe ta force, tu finiras par perdre un jour."�\bOrme: Je t'attendais ! Sais-tu quelque chose sur mes recherches ? Comme tu le sais, les Pokémon sont transportés dans des Poké Balls de nos jours."�\bMais avant l'invention de la Poké Ball, les gens marchaient avec les Pokémon. Cela pourrait avoir un lien avec la façon dont les Pokémon grandissent ou évoluent..."T\bDis-moi, comment élèves-tu tes Pokémon ? Je m'attends à un grand combat !"�\bOrme: Je savais que tu étais un peu différent - tu ne cesses de m'étonner ! Grâce à toi, mes recherches avancent à merveille !"�\bTu cherches des adversaires plus coriaces ? Alors continue tout droit. Et n'oublie pas de remercier tous ceux qui se sont battus contre toi !"�\bSeko: Mon nom est Seko. Nous, les humains, vivons aux côtés des Pokémon. Camarades de jeu parfois, compagnons de travail coopératifs à d'autres moments."�\bEt parfois, nous nous unissons pour combattre d'autres comme nous. Mais malgré notre proximité, nous ne savons pas tout sur les Pokémon."�\bEn fait, il reste encore de très nombreux mystères entourant les Pokémon. Quel est donc ton secret pour élever tes Pokémon ?"a\bSeko: Ouaip ! C'est l'esprit ! ...Arghhh ! Ça me démange de sortir et de voir le monde !"�\bJ'aimerais que ton monde te semble plus vaste que jamais ! Bien que j'aimerais encore plus que tu reviennes de temps en temps pour me montrer tes progrès."r\bMax: Je me demandais... bien que tu ne sois qu'un enfant, tes yeux me parlent d'une détermination féroce."�\bJe m'appelle Max. Je suis le chef de la Team Magma, et tu fais partie de ces jeunes qui pourraient façonner l'avenir de notre société."�\bLa terre existe pour que nous, les humains, puissions continuer d'avancer et de nous élever, explorer, développer, exploiter, marcher vers l'avenir..."�\bC'est pourquoi nous, la Team Magma, devons augmenter la surface terrestre du monde ! Crois bien que cela mènera à un avenir de bonheur éternel pour l'humanité !"�\bMax: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... Tu as réussi ton coup, mon enfant. Tu as fait preuve d'un pouvoir qui dépasse celui du grand Max !"�\bSplendide. Tout simplement splendide, jeune Dresseur. Rejeter mes idéaux sans une seconde hésitation... Et pourtant. Je ne céderai pas ! Je ne plierai pas ! Mes idéaux ne seront pas ébranlés !"k\bArthur: Qu'est-ce qu'on a là ? Voilà une expression bien féroce pour un si petit garnement. Hé !"�\bCette tête me dit que tu n'es pas juste un gamin écervelé de plus. Mon nom est Archie, je dirige la Team Aqua d'une main de fer !"�\bSais-tu que toute vie dans ce monde dépend de la mer pour exister ? Mais jour après jour, nous détruisons tous notre ressource la plus précieuse !"�\bLes Pokémon souffrent de nos actions. C'est pourquoi j'ai pris une décision. Nous, la Team Aqua, allons tout ramener à ses origines pures et préservées !"�\bArthur: Bwahahahahahaha ! Bwaha ! Eh bien, si ce n'est pas mon petit adversaire ! Je ne trouve même pas les mots pour te louer comme tu le mérites."�\bParfois, il vaut mieux rester simple. Tout ce que je dirai, c'est que tu as répondu à mes attentes, gamin ! Mais ça ne change rien ! Je ne peux pas abandonner maintenant ! Je ne peux pas !"�\bSorbier: C'est un grand plaisir de te rencontrer ! Permets-moi d'abord de me présenter convenablement. Mon nom, comme tu le sais, est Sorbier. J'étudie les Pokémon."�\bParfois nous jouons ensemble, et à d'autres moments nous travaillons ensemble. Certains utilisent leurs Pokémon pour combattre et développer des liens plus étroits avec eux."�\bMême maintenant, je ressens un frisson quand je suis avec des Pokémon, alors commençons notre test sur les liens avec nos Pokémon."u\bSorbier: Ton dernier combat était splendide ! Il est tout naturel que je vienne assister à ton couronnement."�\bMais le monde est immense. Il existe beaucoup d'autres Pokémon. Cela signifie qu'il y a encore bien d'autres frissons à aller chercher et à savourer !"�\bHélio: ...Je vois. Tu dois être le Dresseur dont j'ai entendu parler. Bien que je m'attendais peu à ce que cet être téméraire soit un simple enfant."�\bMais, je dois dire... Tu es un spécimen remarquable. Des émotions si piteusement inutiles... Écoute-moi ! Ce monde qui est le nôtre est grossier, il est incomplet !"�\bLe monde doit changer. Alors, qui le changera ? Moi, Hélio. Et la Team Galaxie. Je vais te faire regretter d'avoir écouté ton cœur !"t\bHélio: Je vois... Tu es effectivement fort. Et la base de ton pouvoir est ta compassion envers les Pokémon."�\b...Quel gâchis... De telles émotions ne sont que de simples illusions. ...Mais peu importe. Je doute que tu comprennes jamais ma position."�\rKeteleeria: Salut ! Mon nom est Professeur Keteleeria, et je fais des recherches sur le moment et la manière dont les créatures appelées Pokémon sont apparues."�\rIls ont de nombreuses formes et vivent dans de nombreux endroits différents. En vivant et en travaillant ensemble, nous nous complétons les uns les autres."\rLe fait d'avoir des combats Pokémon entre nous approfondit les liens entre les humains et les Pokémon. Alors, es-tu prêt ?"�\rKeteleeria: Je suis stupéfaite. Beau travail ! Je parie que j'entendrai parler de tes exploits flamboyants à travers le monde !"�\rJ'espère vraiment que tu apprendras ce qui est important pour toi grâce à cela, car les Pokémon créent des occasions de rencontrer d'autres personnes et Pokémon merveilleux !"�\bGhetis: Mon nom est Ghetis. Je suis ici pour représenter la Team Plasma. J'aimerais te parler de la libération des Pokémon."�\bLes Pokémon sont soumis aux ordres égoïstes des Dresseurs. Ils sont différents des humains, car ils recèlent un potentiel inconnu."�\bC'est vrai ! Nous devons libérer les Pokémon ! Alors, et alors seulement, les humains et les Pokémon seront vraiment égaux !!!"�\bGhetis: Mes calculs... Non ! Mes plans si soigneux ! Cela ne change pas mon but. Mes projets secrets n'ont pas été perturbés !"o\bJe suis absolument parfait ! JE SUIS LA PERFECTION ! Je suis le souverain absolu qui changera le monde !"v\bN: Ton Pokémon... À l'instant, il disait... Oh, tu ne peux pas l'entendre. Comme c'est triste. Mon nom est N."�\bAlors, tu as enfermé la plupart de tes Pokémon dans des Poké Balls. Je suis aussi un Dresseur, mais je ne peux m'empêcher de me demander : les Pokémon sont-ils vraiment heureux ainsi ?"l\bEh bien, laisse-moi entendre à nouveau la voix de ton Pokémon ! Je veux te comprendre. Montre-moi !"�\bN: Je ne m'attendais pas à entendre des Pokémon dire de telles choses... Tant que les Pokémon seront confinés dans des Poké Balls... ils ne deviendront jamais des êtres parfaits."�\bJe dois changer le monde pour les Pokémon, car ils sont mes amis. J'ai donc besoin de pouvoir... Un pouvoir suffisant pour que tout le monde se range à mon avis."�\bPlatane: Je suis Augustine Platane. Bonjour ! Ce monde qui est le nôtre est largement habité par des créatures connues sous le nom de Pokémon !"�\bCertains courent à travers les plaines, d'autres volent dans les cieux, et d'autres encore nagent dans les profondeurs des océans..."�\bMaintenant, ayons tous un combat Pokémon ! Ton adversaire sera moi et mes Pokémon, nous prêtant force mutuellement pour la victoire !"f\bPlatane: Eh bien, tu AS un certain "je ne sais quoi" ! J'ai un bon pressentiment à ton sujet !"�\bLa force que tu as trouvée est simplement merveilleuse ! Tu aimes et tu fais vraiment confiance à tes Pokémon ! Chéris ces moments avec tes Pokémon partenaires."�\bLysandre: Tu possèdes un Pokédex ; tu fais partie des élus. Je suis Lysandre. J'ai essayé d'apprendre autant que possible sur les Pokémon pour aider à bâtir un avenir plus radieux."q\bEt pour conclure, des imbéciles improductifs consument notre avenir. La Team Flare doit faire table rase."�\bLa connaissance est le pouvoir, après tout. Utilise-la à bon escient. Il est vital que ce monde devienne un endroit meilleur. Mon désir... C'est un monde plus beau !"x\bLysandre: Excellent ! Mais que protèges-tu réellement ? Un lendemain qui finira par être pire qu'aujourd'hui ?"W\bC'est fini... Des fous sans vision continueront de souiller ce monde magnifique."g\bEuphorbe: Hé, ravi de te rencontrer ! Mon nom est Euphorbe. J'espère qu'on pourra être amis !"�\bJ'adore comprendre le potentiel et les capacités des Pokémon, alors je me laisse frapper par toutes sortes de capacités pour tester leur puissance !"k\bMaintenant, tu veux passer mon épreuve pour devenir plus fort ? C'est ça, mets-toi à l'épreuve !"q\bEuphorbe: Je n'ai pas pu gagner même en me donnant à fond... Mais quel sentiment rafraîchissant ! Woo !"�\bEh bien, j'ai toujours su que ce serait une défaite cuisante. Je suis quand même content d'avoir pu te combattre. Et je suis plus que reconnaissant d'avoir fait ta connaissance, toi et tes Pokémon !"�\bGuzma: Salutations, gamin froussard ! Voilà le chef détesté qui t'écrase, qui t'écrase, et qui ne lâche jamais le morceau... Ouais. Le grand et méchant Guzma est là !"�\bOn a toutes ces vieilles traditions moisies d'arènes et d'épreuves, il est grand temps de supprimer toutes ces ordures ridicules et de créer quelque chose de nouveau par nous-mêmes."�\bAprès tout, tout le monde sait déjà qui est le Dresseur le plus fort ici. Tu veux voir à quoi ressemble la destruction ? La voilà sous forme humaine — c'est ton pote Guzma !"B\bGuzma: Je vois. Beau boulot... j'imagine. Tu as eu du cran."~\bC'était \PN, c'est ça ? Je me souviendrai de toi... comme de quelqu'un que je serai ravi d'écraser n'importe quand !"�\rElsa-Mina: Je suis la présidente de la Fondation Aether. Mais je t'en prie, appelle-moi simplement Elsa-Mina. Je suis si contente que nous ayons pu nous rencontrer."�\rIl y a des gens comme toi, qui parcourent les îles pour en apprendre plus sur les Pokémon. Il y a aussi des gens malheureux qui font du mal aux Pokémon pour certaines raisons."�\rJe serai comme une mère pour tous ces pauvres Pokémon et je les inonderai d'amour. Ils seront tous préservés pour l'éternité dans ma collection."�\rOh, ne t'inquiète pas. Laisse-moi tout gérer. Crois-moi, les enfants seraient tous bien plus heureux s'ils écoutaient seulement les adultes autour d'eux."U\rElsa-Mina: Quelle déception... Dire que vous avez tous l'esprit si étroit..."�\rTout ce que je veux, ce sont mes précieuses créatures ! Je me fiche de tout le reste d'entre vous ! Partez. Je n'ai pas besoin de vous ici... je n'ai plus besoin de vous !"T\rSara: Bonjour, mon nom est Sara. Je suis sincèrement ravie de te rencontrer."P\rTu es mon adversaire du jour ? Mes Pokémon meurent d'envie de combattre."1\rTu ne pourras pas les épuiser un par un !"N\rSara: Merci ! Mes adorables Pokémon sont devenus un peu plus coriaces."~\rÊtre Dresseur n'est pas facile. Plus on combat, plus on en découvre. Mais, tu sais ? J'aime les Pokémon pour ça, aussi !"k\rMaïté: Je suis Maïté... Je veux devenir plus forte pour ne plus être une telle poule mouillée."S\rAlors prépare-toi, Maïté va te montrer tout ce qu'elle a dans le ventre !"X\rMaïté: Maïté se demande si elle peut aller très loin dans la Tour de Combat."�\rMais il semble que tu sois toujours avec tes Pokémon. C'est comme ça que tu es devenu si fort. Mira commence à comprendre !"i\bArmand: Je suis Armand. Je suis un Dresseur, et oui, c'est un peu étrange que je m'entraîne ici."�\bLes gens qui s'entraînent ici sont ceux qui ont trop de temps devant eux. Espérons donc que nous pourrons nous donner mutuellement du fil à retordre !"U\bMaintenant, nous allons sortir le grand jeu pour mettre tes Pokémon à terre."u\bArmand: Connais ton ennemi. Si tu connais les Pokémon de ton adversaire et les capacités qu'ils utilisent..."[\bSi tu as une telle intelligence, tes chances de gagner sont grandement améliorées."�\bCornil: Héhéhé ! Désolé ! Si tu veux être le plus grand Dresseur de tous les temps, ça va être vraiment dur. Parce que tu parles de moi !"i\bTu as l'air perplexe. Tu ne sais vraiment rien, n'est-ce pas ? En tout cas, salut, je suis Cornil."i\bJe sens mes Pokémon frissonner dans leurs Poké Balls ! C'est de l'anticipation, pas de la peur !"p\bCornil: Fweh ! Trop fort ! Je suppose que je vais rester humble et améliorer mon équipe sur le terrain."`\bJe ferais mieux de me remettre en forme sur le terrain pour une revanche contre toi ici !"�\rViviane: Je... suis Viviane. Je... je n'aime pas parler... Je choisis mes mots avec soin, mais ils peuvent quand même blesser quelqu'un accidentellement..."S\rQuand j'y pense, je me mure dans le silence... Je suis désolée pour ça..."T\r...Alors ? ...Est-ce qu'on va se battre ? ...D'accord. Je ferai de mon mieux."r\rViviane: ...Tu es si fort. Ça me rend heureuse. ...Je ne sais pas pourquoi. C'est un sentiment étrange..."a\r...J'aimerais peut-être me battre avec toi. ...Juste un peu. Seulement un tout petit peu."l\bEusine: Mon nom est Eusine. Je suis sur la piste d'un Pokémon nommé Suicune. Ravi de te rencontrer."}\bIl semble y avoir plus en toi qu'il n'y paraît... Mon instinct me dit que tu as déjà rencontré Suicune auparavant."�\bMon désir de chercher Suicune est bien plus grand que le tien... Je n'arrêterai pas de te suivre tant que je n'aurai pas trouvé ce que je cherche !"^\bEusine: Pff, pff... Je ne fais... pas le poids face à toi. ...Comme je l'avais prévu."�\bJe n'ai jamais vu un combat aussi intense ! Je n'ai aucun regret... Adieu pour l'instant. Mais je reviendrai chercher ce que je veux auprès de toi !"d\bChamsin: Je suis Chamsin. Je suis un Chef de Métro. Et j'aime gagner plus que tout au monde."l\bJe suis vraiment sérieux. Très sérieux. Car si un combat n'est pas sérieux, il n'est pas amusant."B\bTout est prêt ! Vise la victoire ! Tout le monde à bord !"�\bChamsin: J'ai perdu contre toi. Parce que tu es le plus fort Dresseur que j'aie combattu récemment. Tu es un trrrès fort Dresseur ! Ouaip ! C'était amusant !"�\bTu veux gagner, et je ne veux pas perdre. C'est la réalité. Quand nous nous affrontons en combat, je me sens très excité !"}\bChammal: Je suis le Chef de Métro Chammal. Comprends-tu bien les Pokémon ? Peux-tu rester fidèle à tes principes ?"�\bQue puis-je voir après avoir gagné, gagné, et encore gagné ? Tu ne peux pas savoir ce qui arrive après la victoire sans vaincre."w\bPar conséquent, je vais déployer tous les efforts possibles pour me battre contre toi. Tout le monde à bord !"x\bChammal: Bravo ! Excellent !! Je suis ravi de m'être battu si durement contre un Dresseur merveilleux comme toi."n\bTon talent t'a mené à la destination appelée Victoire ! Cependant, ton voyage ne fait que commencer."#\rPenses-y, d'accord ? Héhé."P\rCélesta: Awww. On dirait que j'ai pris le "P" cette fois. Pas de chance."U\bLuth: Oh, hé ? Je suis Luth. Qu'est-ce que tu fais là ? En pleine aventure ?"M\bJ'ai hâte de me battre contre toi, mais restons amis après ça, ok ?"�\bMon désir de chercher Suicune va bien au-delà du tien... Je n'arrêterai pas de te suivre tant que je n'aurai pas découvert ce que je cherche !"�\bSam: Hé, j'ai jeté un œil à tes données de l'Usine de Combat. Tu sembles avoir compris le principe, mais tu es encore trop rigide dans ta tête !"�\bÉcoute bien, d'accord ? La connaissance ne consiste pas seulement à lire des livres ou à faire du travail de bureau. Ça pourrait tout aussi bien être inutile !"�\bTu dois vivre les choses avec ton cœur et ton corps, tu comprends ? Secoue chaque parcelle de tes connaissances et donne tout ce que tu as !"s\bSam: Pfft, mince ! C'est absolument la dernière fois que je perds contre toi ! On doit remettre ça, hein !"C\bJe vais te traquer sans relâche. Pas de quartier, compris ?"�\rCarole: Hé ! Salut ! ...Attends, c'est toi le challenger ? Je ne sais pas comment le dire, mais... pour être franche, tu as l'air assez faible."u\rTu es sûr d'être de taille face à moi ? Hmm... Eh bien, d'accord ! On va y aller doucement pour commencer !"H\rOkay ! Fais voir si tu peux enflammer ma passion pour le combat !"U\rCarole: Oh, attends une seconde ! Tu es coriace après tout ! Je t'aime bien !"^\rSi jamais nous nous battons à nouveau, je ne perdrai pas ! Ne l'oublie pas ! Bye-bye !"g\bTakim: Ahahah ! Tu entends cette foule ! Ils meurent tous d'envie de voir notre match ! Ahahah !"p\bJe parie que tu trembles de partout à cause de la tension de m'affronter ! Mais ne t'inquiète de rien !"l\bTakim, la star du spectacle, va t'envelopper d'un éclat brillant ! Ici et maintenant ! C'est parti !"H\bTakim: Tu es fort, mais par-dessus tout, tu as un charme unique !"|\bEn toi, je vois le potentiel certain d'une superstar comme moi. J'attends avec impatience notre prochaine rencontre !"c\bEsteban: Jeune Dresseur ! Crois-tu en tes Pokémon ? Peux-tu croire en eux de bout en bout ?"j\bMon être physique est toujours avec les Pokémon ! Mon cœur bat à l'unisson avec eux, toujours !"f\bSi vos liens de confiance sont fragiles, tu ne battras jamais mes frères ! Prouve-le-moi ici !"\bEsteban: Eh bien, c'était une sacrée démonstration ! Même totalement déchaînés, mes frères n'ont pas pu te submerger."t\bVotre esprit d'équipe est vraiment admirable ! Les yeux de tes Pokémon sont vraiment clairs et sans nuages."c\rCharline: Je suis Charline... Je suis la loi ici... Car je suis la Reine de la Serpentine..."B\rTu le sais déjà, mais pour avancer, tu dois me vaincre..."�\rJe ne suis pas du genre à bavarder inutilement. Dépêche-toi. Viens... Ta chance... J'espère que tu ne l'as pas déjà toute épuisée ici..."B\rCharline: ...C'est tout ce qu'il y a... Disparais déjà..."9\r...Mais toi, je ne t'oublierai pas... ...Jamais..."^\rCathy: Salutations... Mon nom est Cathy. J'ai entendu plusieurs rumeurs à ton sujet..."�\rEn toute honnêteté, ce que j'ai entendu ne semble pas du tout attrayant... La raison pour laquelle je suis venue te voir... Eh bien, il n'y en a qu'une..."7\rLaisse-moi voir l'intégralité de ton talent..."f\rCathy: Fufufu, bien joué... Tu as confiance en ton talent de dresseur Pokémon, n'est-ce pas ?"~\rJe t'exhorte à continuer de te battre et à continuer de gagner. Je t'attendrai. Jusqu'à notre prochaine rencontre..."�\bBayar: Ne serais-tu pas d'accord pour dire que les explorations sont les plus grandes aventures ? Ton propre esprit ! Ta propre force ! Tes propres Pokémon !"]\bEt, par-dessus tout, seul ton courage pour te guider à travers des mondes inconnus..."�\bAh oui, jeune aventurier, cette vie est vraiment grandiose ! Grandiose, elle l'est ! Maintenant, alors ! Apporte ton courage dans notre combat !"T\bBayar: Hahahah ! C'était grandiose ! Grandiose, oui, en effet ! Bien joué !"�\bJeune explorateur ! Tu m'as surpassé de bout en bout ! Cela montre simplement que j'ai encore beaucoup à apprendre ! Que nos chemins se croisent à nouveau !"u\bKoner: Alors, tu es arrivé jusqu'ici ! En tant que dresseur d'expérience, je vais devoir faire de mon mieux."�\bC'est ainsi que les meilleurs Dresseurs se montrent du respect mutuel. En se battant à fond comme des étudiants dévoués des Pokémon !"�\bMontre-moi le lien que tu as construit avec tes Pokémon. Montre-moi ce que tu as appris à travers les combats avec d'autres Dresseurs !"�\bKoner: Bravo ! J'imagine que beaucoup de grands Dresseurs viendront me défier comme tu viens de le faire. C'est quelque chose que j'attends avec beaucoup d'intérêt."{\bTu vas devenir encore plus doué. Continue de combattre des Dresseurs du monde entier et continue de grandir en stature !"�\rDahlia: Pas besoin de s'inquiéter. Laisse faire le hasard. Comme les surprises sur un plateau de jeu, la vie passe par des hauts et des bas."�\rLes choses iront comme elles doivent aller. Mais assez parlé de ça. Je sais une chose avec certitude. Tu n'es pas arrivé ici simplement par chance."O\rNe perdons pas de temps. Je souhaite tester tes compétences moi-même !"t\rDahlia: Comme c'est fabuleux ! Ton amour des Pokémon a transparu et, en retour, tes Pokémon ont cru en toi."}\rC'est pourquoi tu as géré magnifiquement tout ce qui t'a été envoyé. Ce fut une victoire des plus merveilleuses !"�\bCadus: Bzweep ! Désolé, ne fais pas attention à moi. Ce que j'utilise est une de mes inventions. C'est ma machine d'analyse de données qui me dit ce que tu as apporté."~\bJe vois... Je dois dire que c'est une bonne configuration. Disons, 47 % ? Oh, ne laisse pas ce chiffre te préoccuper !" \bTrès bien, c'est parti !"a\bCadus: Hmm... On m'a collé la défaite ici. Ça ne me rend pas joyeux du tout, de perdre."y\bMais c'est pas grave. Il y a des choses qu'on apprend en gagnant. Mais il y a des choses qu'on apprend en perdant."�\bParsley: Bienvenue. Comme vous le savez, Lady Percila, mon employeur, n'est pas du genre à accepter la défaite de bon cœur."l\bCependant, pour une raison que je ne suis pas autorisé à divulguer, elle ne peut pas combattre ici."�\bPar conséquent, moi, Parsley, je combattrai à la place de sa seigneurie. Laissez-moi vous assurer que vous ne serez pas lésé en m'affrontant."�\bParsley: J'ai puisé dans chaque réserve d'expérience et d'étiquette transmises par notre héritage de glorieuse servitude."l\bMais même alors, j'ai échoué à repousser votre défi stupéfiant et inspirant. Je suis honoré..."f\rArgenta: Cet endroit permet aux Dresseurs de lancer des défis avec leurs Pokémon préférés."�\rJ'imagine qu'il y a eu des moments de tension pour arriver ici avec l'élu de votre cœur. Mais comprenez que l'on brille le plus lorsqu'un défi est surmonté."c\rJe suis Argenta, et je serai votre défi le plus redoutable. Je vous défie de me surpasser."�\rArgenta: Vous ne devez jamais oublier qu'il existe un endroit où tout le monde peut briller. Cela vaut aussi pour n'importe quel type de Pokémon."�\rRépandez ce message avec vos propres mots. C'est un message que tout le monde devrait entendre. Et maintenant, ayant perdu, cette dame n'a plus rien à dire du tout, si ce n'est... Bye-bye !"{\bHitsu: Hé, tu t'es échappé du Pénitencier Chaos ! Tu dois être un dresseur impressionnant pour avoir fait ça !"(\bAu-delà de cette pièce, c'est la fin de ton chaos. Tu y recevras peut-être la récompense que tu mérites. MAIS ! Juste une dernière chose. Round bonus. S'il te plaaaaaît ! Bats-moi, et tu auras des récompenses supplémentaires ! Je sais que ton équipe doit être fatiguée maintenant..."W\bVoilà, maintenant je ne peux pas accepter de refus. Ne tardons plus, d'accord ?"|\bHitsu: Tu as réussi ! Je suis impressionné ! Tu es le symbole d'un véritable maître Pokémon. Tiens, tu mérites ceci.".25 Crédits GC vous ont été attribués."J\bVas-y. Je n'ai plus grand-chose à dire maintenant, à part bravo !"u\bHitsu: Hé, c'était un bon combat ! Ne sois pas abattu, de toute façon je ne respecte pas les règles. HAHA."D\bReviens ici. Tu seras prêt. Nous t'attendrons. Allez, file !"J\bHitsu: Tu as acheté un Pass Coulisses pour nous rencontrer ? *rit*"e\bTu sais ce que ça signifie, n'est-ce pas ? ROUND BONUS ! Et je ne peux pas accepter de refus.">\bNe tardons plus, d'accord ? S'il te plaît ! Bats-moi !"�\bHitsu: Tu as réussi ! Je suis impressionné ! Tu es le symbole d'un véritable maître Pokémon ! À part ça, je n'ai plus grand-chose à dire, à part bravo ! La rencontre est terminée. Ciao~"�\bHitsu: Hé, c'était un bon combat ! Ne sois pas abattu, de toute façon je ne respecte pas les règles. HAHA. Reviens ici. Tu seras prêt. Nous t'attendrons. Bye~"d\bLuc: Ara ara, bravo pour être arrivé jusqu'ici. Tu veux une bouteille d'eau ? Je plaisante."o\bDéfi difficile, n'est-ce pas ? Tu y es presque l'ami, tes récompenses se trouvent juste derrière moi."D\bJe vais soigner ton équipe pour que tu puisses te préparer.">\bHé. C'est ça, ton dernier adversaire ici, c'est moi !"W\bLuc: Mince, bien joué l'ami ! Je ne peux même pas être fâché d'avoir perdu."@\bJe n'ai plus rien à dire maintenant, si ce n'est bravo !"�\bHaha, sans rancune. De toute façon, ce n'est pas comme si Hitsu ou Foul seraient plus faciles à battre, puisqu'on enfreint tous les règles-qui-devraient-être-enfreintes ici."G\bEh bien, quand tu seras de nouveau prêt, je serai toujours là."}\bLuc: Ara ara, tu as acheté un pass juste pour nous revoir ? Tu veux une bouteille d'eau pour la peine ? Je plaisante."(\bN'en dis pas plus. Battons-nous !"�\bLuc: Mince, bien joué l'ami ! Je ne peux même pas être fâché d'avoir perdu. Bravo, et merci d'être venu me voir ! Hasta la vista !"b\bHaha, sans rancune, puisqu'on enfreint tous les règles-qui-devraient-être-enfreintes ici."x\bFoul: Oh ! Tu t'approches de moi ? Même après tous ces combats, tu as quand même choisi de t'approcher de moi."f\bMais je ne veux pas me battre contre un adversaire aussi faible. Laisse-moi te soigner d'abord."U\bMaintenant, voyons quel genre de puissance tu peux rassembler pour me vaincre."9\bFoul: Tsk... Peu importe si tu peux me battre ici."�\bJe peux toujours revenir pour te vaincre. Et même si je ne le peux pas, il y en a qui possèdent un pouvoir bien plus grand que le mien."g\bFoul: Bien sûr que tu n'es pas capable de me vaincre. Je suis le maître des coups fourrés !!!"=\bTu es en colère ? Reviens pour une autre correction !"=\bFoul: Oh ! Tu t'approches de moi, de ton propre chef ?"\bFascinant, en effet."R\bMaintenant, amuse-moi en engageant un combat avec moi ! Surprise surprise !"{\bFoul: Tsk... Peu importe, il y en a qui possèdent un pouvoir bien plus grand que le mien. Tu peux t'en aller après moi."G\rVermint: Oh ? Tu es arrivé jusqu'ici et tu continues d'avancer.">\rTrès bien, voyons si tu peux garder cet enthousiasme !"L\rVermint: Je vois... J'ai perdu. J'ai hâte de voir tes progrès, \PN.".\rMais n'oublie pas, je regarde toujours."L\rVermint: Tu manques de force et de résolution pour aller de l'avant."V\rTu ne passeras pas cet horizon où ta passion et ta résolution se rencontrent."n\rVermint: Mon Dieu, c'est assez surprenant. Tu as décidé de me combattre sans véritable résolution ?"-\rVoyons si tu peux rester enthousiaste."P\rVermint: C'est surprenant... Ma soustraction était fausse pour une fois."Y\r\PN, j'attends tes progrès avec impatience. Et n'oublie pas, je regarde toujours."j\rVermint: Un combat sans véritable résolution montre simplement que tu n'es pas sur le bon chemin."F\rTrouve ta propre résolution et je la jugerai avec ma méthode."6\bLuc-ker: \PN, hein ? J'aurais dû m'y attendre."N\bEh bien, puisque tu es là, laisse-moi te raconter une petite histoire."�\bIl était une fois, un adolescent qui tomba par hasard sur ce monde. Il parcourut le monde entier, cherchant à vivre le voyage de Sacha par lui-même."�\bJusqu'au jour où il termina son voyage. Mais n'ayant rien d'autre à faire dans le monde à ce moment-là, il décida de recommencer, encore et encore."<\bMais bien sûr, toutes les bonnes choses ont une fin."�\bUn jour, en essayant d'exploiter le système auquel il pensait s'être habitué, celui-ci l'ejecta de force vers son monde d'origine."<\bEt puis, après un certain temps, il oublia ce monde."A\bC'était jusqu'à ce que ce monde connaisse une pandémie."�\bL'adolescent, maintenant plus âgé de quelques années avec un peu plus de connaissances et de bon sens, a voulu aider à améliorer ce monde."Z\bIl a donc contacté le créateur de ce monde et a reçu l'opportunité de le faire."P\bEt c'est là que je suis né. Luc-ker. (le tiret est important au fait !)"g\bPetite anecdote : ce n'était pas mon nom d'origine ! Mais ça n'a plus d'importance maintenant."�\bTout ce que tu as besoin de savoir, c'est que j'aide à améliorer les systèmes de ce monde depuis de nombreuses années maintenant, en prenant des pauses de temps en temps."G\bBien sûr, j'allais finir par rencontrer Hitsu pendant ce temps."�\bQuand il a eu l'idée du Grandeur Club pour la première fois, je n'aurais jamais pensé que c'est moi qui l'animerais, mais nous y voilà."h\bAvec des dresseurs venant de tout l'univers Pokémon, c'est notre lettre d'amour à la franchise."�\bSi tu ne l'avais pas deviné, nous avons aussi adoré Pokémon Masters. Nous voulions donc des dresseurs de là-bas que tu puisses aussi combattre ici !"�\bJe suis très heureux de ce que nous avons accompli. Bien sûr, il y a eu beaucoup, beaucoup de luttes, mais nous les avons surmontées pour en arriver là où nous en sommes aujourd'hui."C\bEt maintenant, nous sommes à la fin de notre voyage commun."+\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu !"^\bQuoi, tu pensais que c'était un indice sur l'ajout de la 9ème génération ? Hahaha !"�\bNon, j'aimais juste le son de cette phrase. La Gen 9 ne sera malheureusement pas ajoutée au jeu (ou heureusement pour moi, en fait)."t\bCeci étant dit, je dois te dire arigato à toi aussi, \PN. Sans toi, nous n'aurions jamais été aussi loin."�\bEn guise de remerciement pour nous avoir laissé vivre la fin de notre voyage ensemble, laisse-moi te récompenser par un combat."U\bOh, tu veux m'affronter à pleine puissance ? Tu ne cesseras de me surprendre."\bTrès bien. Mais ne dis pas que tu n'as pas été prévenu : ce combat utilisera les mécaniques des Défis Synchro et Titan.",<i>inspire et s'éclaircit la gorge</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH !!!""\bÇa n'a pas marché, hein ?"�\bLuc: Ouf ! Même en brisant plusieurs limites du système, je n'arrive toujours pas à te battre. Tu es vraiment un dresseur incroyable, \PN."v\bBien sûr, j'aurais pu briser plus de limites, mais je n'ai pas vraiment envie de détruire ce monde, tu sais ?"�\bC'est ici que je te donnerais une récompense, mais j'ai été programmé pour ne pas t'en donner si tu décides de seulement me malmener :<("l\bQuoi qu'il en soit, voici ta récompense pour m'avoir battu. Trois bouteilles d'eau très spéciales."T\bLuc: Merci de m'avoir laissé me donner à fond ! C'était plutôt agréable."�\bNe t'en fais pas trop pour le fait que tu n'aies pas pu me battre ! J'enfreignais de multiples limites du système, après tout."{\bMais d'un autre côté... je t'avais prévenu. Tu devrais le savoir grâce aux dresseurs du Défi Synchro, n'est-ce pas ?"|\bMais d'un autre côté... je t'avais prévenu. Tous les coups sont permis quand il s'agit du Grandeur Club, tu sais ?"\bTu t'es quand même bien défendu, et tu m'as poussé dans mes retranchements comme aucun dresseur ne l'avait fait avant toi."8\bQuoi qu'il en soit, c'est tout pour cet endroit !"9\bViens, laisse-moi te ramener là où est ta place."[\bQuand la neige fond, le printemps arrive. Chéris le temps passé avec tes Pokémon."-La porte se verrouille derrière vous..."7\bPierre: Montre-moi ce que tu as dans le ventre !"&\rOndine: Es-tu prêt, mon chou ?"h\bMajor Bob: Les combats Pokémon, c'est la guerre ! Je vais t'écraser et te forcer à te rendre !"I\rErika: Laissez mes demoiselles vous démontrer l'art de l'Ikebana."A\rMorgane: Voyons un peu qui de nous deux sera le vainqueur."B\rJeannine : Salut ! Je suis Jeannine ! Retiens bien ce nom !"M\bLéo: Tu es venu voir ma collection de Pokémon ? Regarde un peu ça !"N\bSolane: Laissons nos esprits s'entrechoquer dans un brasier de gloire !"L\rAgatha: Pourquoi viens-tu fourrer ton nez ici, sale petit garnement ?"V\bTrace: Je devrais vérifier si tes Pokémon se portent bien... avec un combat !"9\bBlue: Montre-la nous — ta véritable puissance !"X\rLeaf: J'ai remarqué que tu avais de bons Pokémon toi aussi, je peux les avoir ?"h\bChen: Bonjour ! Mon nom est Chen ! On m'appelle le Professeur Pokémon ! Viens donc m'affronter !"O\bGiovanni: Pour ton insolence, tu vas goûter à une souffrance infinie !"h\bAlbert: Je vais te montrer le vrai pouvoir des glorieux Pokémon Vol ! Ô vents, soyez avec moi !"I\bHéctor: Laisse-moi te démontrer ce que mes études m'ont appris."r\rBlanche: Tu veux défier la talentueuse et hyper mignonne Blanche ? Considère ça comme un avertissement !"�\bMortimer: Avec encore un peu d'effort, je pourrais entrevoir l'avenir où je rencontre le Pokémon aux couleurs de l'arc-en-ciel. Tu vas m'aider à atteindre ce niveau !"v\bChuck: Laisse-moi te dire que je suis assez costaud pour broyer la pierre et briser les os ! Urggh ! Oooarrgh !"V\rJasmine: Oh... euh, bonjour. Aimes-tu tes Pokémon ? Peux-tu me le prouver... ?"^\bFrédo: Moi, Frédo — le dresseur de l'hiver — je vais te démontrer ma puissance !"L\rSandra: Je vais utiliser toute ma puissance contre toi. C'est parti !"8\bClément: Perdre n'est pas une option pour nous !"_\bKoga: Prépare-toi à être la victime de mes techniques... Tu verras bien assez tôt..."E\bAldo: Incline-toi devant notre puissance écrasante. Hoo hah !"2\rMarion: Essaie un peu. Amuse-moi. Allons-y."C\bPeter: Il est temps que je te teste au combat. Es-tu prêt ?"?\bSilver: Espèce de gêneur. Tu n'as pas l'air bien fort."K\rCélesta: Tu es ici en quête d'un défi, n'est-ce pas ? Moi aussi !"W\bLuth: Je me sens en forme aujourd'hui, ça te dit un match ? Ici et maintenant !"Z\bOrme: Dis-moi, comment élèves-tu tes Pokémon ? Je m'attends à un grand combat !"�\rRoxanne: Auriez-vous l'obligeance de me montrer comment vous combattez pour que je puisse apprendre ? J'aimerais aussi voir à quel point j'ai progressé."H\bBastien: Tu veux me défier ? Voyons de quel bois tu te chauffes."n\bVoltère: Je vais faire jaillir des étincelles de ton corps ! Ne dis pas que je ne t'ai pas prévenu !"2\rAdriane: Prépare-toi ! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa !"d\bNorman: Tu ferais mieux de tout donner. Je ferai tout ce qui est en mon pouvoir pour gagner !"d\rAlizée: Admire notre élégante chorégraphie. Ne cligne pas des yeux ou tu le regretteras !"P\bLévy: Cette combinaison est la nôtre ! \rTatia : Pourras-tu la battre ?"�\bJuan: J'imagine qu'un Coordinateur pourrait te montrer un tour ou deux aujourd'hui. Admire notre grande illusion d'eau sculptée !"w\bDamien: J'aime le regard que tu me lances. Je parie que tu vas m'offrir un beau match. Mettons-nous au travail !"i\rSpectra: N'aie pas peur. Quoi qu'il en soit, si tu cherches un défi, essaie de blesser mes amis !"Q\rGlacia: Je me demande ce que tu vas nous montrer. Donne tout ce que tu as."�\bAragon: Pour que nous puissions combattre avec des Pokémon comme partenaires, sais-tu ce que cela exige ? Sais-tu ce qui est nécessaire ?"4\bPierre: Donne-nous le meilleur de toi-même !"�\bMarc: Qui peut danser le plus élégamment avec ses Pokémon ? Qui de nous deux doit exposer l'art le plus gracieux au combat, toi ou moi et ma grande illusion d'eau ?"|\bTimmy: Mes Pokémon m'ont donné le courage et la force de me battre. Je dois gagner pour eux ! Alors, prépare-toi !"x\rFlora: Pourrais-tu m'apporter et me montrer tous tes Pokémon lors d'un combat contre moi ? Je suis si excitée !"�\bBrice: Ta présence ici signifie que tu as peut-être affronté et vaincu mon père. Mais m'affronter moi est une tout autre histoire ! C'est parti !"�\bSeko: Il y a encore de très, très nombreux mystères entourant les Pokémon. Quel est donc ton secret pour élever tes Pokémon ?"�\bMax: C'est pourquoi nous, la Team Magma, devons agrandir la surface terrestre du monde ! Croyez bien que cela mènera à un futur de bonheur éternel pour l'humanité !"�\bArthur: Les Pokémon souffrent à cause de nos actions. C'est pourquoi j'ai pris une décision : nous, la Team Aqua, allons tout ramener à ses débuts originels et préservés !"%\bPierrick: Ça va déménager !";\rFlo: Passons au combat ! Un match rapide, d'accord ?"U\rMélina: Je prends aussi les combats très au sérieux. Quand tu seras prêt !"=\bLovis: La victoire sera nôtre ! Allez, finissons-en !"]\rKiméra: Je vais gagner, non ? Je souhaite te montrer un combat à la danse classique."\\bCharles: J'accepte ton défi. J'ai la confiance nécessaire pour briser ta défense !"q\rGladys: Je préfère te le dire, je suis coriace parce que je sais me concentrer. Prépare-toi à perdre !"e\bTanguy: J'espère que tu es celui qui me rappellera à quel point il est amusant de se battre."`\bAaron: Je veux devenir parfait, tout comme mes Pokémon Insecte. Laisse-moi t'affronter !"U\rTerry: Eh bien, montrerais-tu à cette vieille dame tout ce que tu as appris ?"J\bFlint: Très bien, champion ! Mettons un peu de piment là-dedans !"K\rCynthia: Les mots sont inutiles. Moi, Cynthia, j'accepte ton défi !"X\bBarry: Envoie tes Pokémon maintenant ! Ou je te mets une amende de 10 millions !"m\rAurore: Laisse-moi te donner un coup de main, pour voir si tu peux me battre et continuer ton chemin !"8\bLouka: Prêt ou pas, essayons un peu nous aussi !"�\bSorbier: Même maintenant, je ressens un frisson quand je suis avec des Pokémon, alors commençons notre test sur les liens avec nos Pokémon."�\bHélio: Le monde doit changer. Alors, qui le changera ? Moi, Hélio. Et la Team Galaxie. Je vais te faire regretter d'avoir écouté ton cœur !"b\bRachid : Aimerais-tu participer à ce match contre moi ? J'ai encore beaucoup à apprendre."[\bNoa: Je vais te montrer ce que mes Pokémon flamboyants et moi-même pouvons faire !"\bArmando: Ce sera contre moi et mes estimés Pokémon que tu devras te battre. Serais-tu assez aimable pour t'exécuter ?"�\rAloé: Je vais étudier comment tu te bats avec les Pokémon que tu as élevés avec tant d'amour. La curiosité est le sel de la vie !"k\bArtie: Ah ah ! Lumières ! Mes Pokémon Insecte frétillent d'excitation à l'idée de t'affronter !"�\rInézia: Oui, mon chou. Je suis Inézia, le mannequin mondialement connu. Bienvenue sur ma scène principale ! Mes Pokémon bien-aimés et les tiens vont s'affronter."z\bBardane: Hum ! Tu m'as fait attendre, pas vrai gamin ? Alors c'est toi le Dresseur dont tout le monde parle, hein ?"?\rCarolina: Alors, et si on s'amusait un peu, toi et moi ?"�\bZhu: Recevoir le soutien de ses Pokémon rend plus fort. Je vais te montrer ce pouvoir que j'ai découvert, et qui est désormais gravé dans mon cœur."k\rStrykna: Je suis Strykna~ ! Écoute bien~ ! Je vais faire vibrer le public jusque sur ses sièges~ !"�\bWatson: Combattons avec tout ce que nous avons : ton talent, mon expérience, et l'amour avec lequel nous avons élevé nos Pokémon."T\bAmana: Et si on faisait quelques vagues pour emporter le public, toi et moi ?"�\bPieris: Ce qui sera déterminé ici, c'est lequel de nous deux peut absorber la lumière et l'éclat de ce match. Que nos destins s'accomplissent.">\rAnis: Aimerais-tu être le sujet de mon nouveau roman ?"_\bKunz: Mon intention est de te tester. De t'emmener jusqu'aux limites de ta force. Kiai !"q\rPercila: Fais de ton mieux pour ne pas m'ennuyer avec un combat qui donne envie de bâiller. C'est clair ?"�\bGoyah: Je me sens tout feu tout flamme quand je vois un autre dresseur, et je me demande lequel de nous deux est le plus fort. L'excitation monte à son paroxysme !"j\bGuajira: Hé, hé ! Regarde-moi ! Je veux me battre avec toi ! Mes Pokémon n'en ont pas eu assez !"|\rIris: Salut ! Je suis Iris ! On m'appelle la fille qui connaît le cœur des dragons ! Prépare-toi ! Je vais te vaincre !"5\bMatis: Viens vers moi avec tout ce que tu as !"R\rLudvina: Ce combat est pour moi ! Je ne me laisserai pas faire facilement !"[\bLudwig: J'ai hâte de me battre contre toi, mais restons amis après ça, d'accord ?"F\rÉcho: Pourrais-tu te battre avec moi, s'il te plaît ? Youpi !"�\rRoxanne: Salut, ici Roxanne. J'aime établir des stratégies avant un combat, en appliquant ce que j'ai étudié jusqu'à présent."t\rJe suis sûre que nous avons tous deux vécu de nombreux combats, gagnant une immense connaissance du combat."y\bTon talent a apporté une vague d'étonnement, me submergeant. Je l'attends à nouveau avec impatience. En avant !"E\bVoltère: Aha ! Quelle belle jeune âme débordant de vigueur."Z\rPas étonnant que les Pokémon qui combattent à mes côtés soient devenus confus."d\rAdmirez l'élégance de notre chorégraphie. Ne clignez pas des yeux ou vous le regretterez !"c\rAlizée: Je vois que tu ne fais qu'un avec tes Pokémon, toi aussi. Je reconnais ton talent."H\bLes mots sont inutiles... \r...car nous pouvons chacun deviner..."J\b...ce que l'autre pense... \r...grâce à la force de nos esprits !"|\bLévy: Le lien entre toi et tes Pokémon... \rTatia : ...était bien plus fort que le nôtre. Nous pouvons le sentir."�\bDamien: On disait que j'étais un loubard, mais j'ai montré à tout le monde de quoi la beauté des ténèbres était capable !"v\bDamien: Écoute ce que ce perdant a à te dire. La route est encore longue, mais tu as l'étoffe d'un champion."|\rSpectra: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Ah ah ah ! Tu as raison. Oh ? Un instant... Bonjour ! Mon ami me dit que tu me cherches."^\rN'aie pas peur. Si c'est un défi que tu veux, voyons si tu peux égratigner mes amis !"]\rJ'aimerais voir jusqu'où ton lien peut te porter. Ne nous fais pas honte en perdant !"<\rJe me demande ce que tu vas me montrer. Allez, viens."�\rGlacia: Quel soulagement, c'était brûlant ! Vos esprits brûlaient si fort que mes capacités de Glace en paraissaient bien pâles."�\bPierre: Toi... Qu'as-tu vu durant ton voyage avec tes Pokémon ? Qu'as-tu ressenti en rencontrant tant de Dresseurs comme toi ?"�\bHé ! Hé !! Tu as intérêt à viser toujours plus haut et à me promettre de revenir me défier ! Sinon, c'est moi qui serai au sommet avant toi !"j\bTu es incroyable. Tu es la preuve vivante qu'un Dresseur peut rendre ses Pokémon fiers ! À plus !"\\rTu vas devoir te donner à fond si tu ne veux pas que je t'expédie en un seul coup !"}\rKeteleeria: Les combats Pokémon permettent d'approfondir les liens entre les humains et les Pokémon. Alors, tu es prêt ?"]\bN: Laisse-moi entendre la voix de tes Pokémon ! Je veux vous comprendre. Montre-moi !"\bGhetis: Nous devons libérer les Pokémon ! Alors, et seulement alors, les humains et les Pokémon seront vraiment égaux !!!"L\rViolette: Maintenant, approche ! Moi, Violette, je vais t'affronter !"]\bLino: J'espère que tu me montreras que ton talent de dresseur surpasse même le mien."L\rCornélia: Ah ah ! Voici l'entrée en scène de la grande Cornélia !"i\bAmaro: La survie des plantes est la preuve de leur force. Es-tu sûr d'être prêt pour la suite ?"_\bLem: Bonjour ! J'aime les combats Pokémon comme j'aime mes inventions : HAUTE TENSION !"q\rValériane: Les insaisissables Fées peuvent paraître frêles comme une brise, mais reste sur tes gardes."e\rAstera: C'est un rituel pour décider de ton destin et de ton avenir. Que le combat commence !"|\bUrup: Selon le Pokémon que tu choisiras, je serai soit ton adversaire le plus redoutable, soit une vraie déception."/\rMalva: Je brûle d'impatience, microbe !"k\bNarcisse: Se consacrer entièrement à de telles expériences éphémères, c'est de l'art, le vrai."Z\bThyméo: Faisons le serment que ce duel sera juste et honorable. Prêt ? En garde !"M\rDracéna: T'affronter fera grandir mes Pokémon à une vitesse folle !"\rDianthéa: Tu sais, j'aimerais beaucoup en apprendre plus sur la façon dont un Dresseur aussi puissant élève ses Pokémon."w\rSannah: Je suis sûre qu'on va devenir de super amis. Hé ! On peut voir tes Pokémon ? Je veux les rencontrer !":\bTierno: Bon, ça te dit un pe'tit combat Pokémon ?"\bTrovato: Je parcours les montagnes et les mers pour compléter mon Pokédex, mais je sais aussi me battre. C'est parti !"X\rSerena: Youpi ! J'ai hâte de voir de quoi on est capables ! Hi hi, on commence !"=\bKalem: Très bien, c'est parti. Allez, tout le monde !"5\bPlatane: Et si on faisait un combat Pokémon ?":\bLysandre: Mon souhait... c'est un monde plus beau !"L\bAlthéo: Admirez les magnifiques Pokémon du seul et unique Althéo !"K\rNéphie: Je vais te montrer ce que je vaux quand je suis sérieuse !"S\bKiawe: J'espère que tu as le feu sacré et que tu vas embraser mon défi !!"A\rBarbara: On va cuisiner tout ça dans le feu de l'action !"h\bChrys: Oh ! Tu pourrais m'apprendre quelques astuces pour avoir plus confiance en moi en combat ?"]\rOléa: Peut-être que ton style de combat sera un véritable chef-d'œuvre ! On y va !"g\rMargie: Notre combat fera peut-être partie des légendes qu'on racontera pendant des siècles !"Z\rPaulie: On dirait que tu es en train d'écrire ta propre légende. Soyons sérieux."`\bDanh: Ne prends pas ça trop à cœur. Tu vas t'épuiser si tu es toujours aussi pressé."[\rAlyxia: Tu peux compter sur moi, p'tit gars. Prépare-toi pour le combat de ta vie !"c\rKahili: Voyons jusqu'où nous pouvons voler. Les vents de la victoire souffleront pour moi !"h\bMolène: À présent, je dois faire mon possible pour rester au niveau des autres. Battons-nous !"M\bPectorius: Le vieux Pectorius va aussi se donner à fond ! Au combat !"8\bTili: Moi, je veux juste m'amuser ! C'est parti !"L\rLilie: Je ferai de mon mieux pour qu'aucun Pokémon ne soit blessé !"A\bGladio: Bats-toi contre moi. Je n'accepterai pas de "non"."7\rSelene: Je suis bouillante ! Viens m'affronter !"B\bElio: Je serais ravi de te montrer ce dont je suis capable."a\bEuphorbe: Alors, prêt à passer mon épreuve pour devenir plus fort ? Allez, donne tout !"V\rElsa-Mina: Voyons voir... Oui, toi. \PN. C'est contre moi que tu vas te battre."b\bGuzma: Tu veux voir à quoi ressemble la destruction pure ? C'est Guzma qui va te montrer !"h\bEusine: Mon désir de trouver Suicune est bien plus grand que le tien... Je ne m'arrêterai pas !"M\rSara: Tu es mon adversaire ? Mes Pokémon trépignaient d'impatience !"O\rMaïté: Prépare-toi, Mira va te montrer de quel bois elle se chauffe !"Q\bArmand: Maintenant, on va sortir le grand jeu pour mettre tes Pokémon KO."d\bCornil: Je sens mes Pokémon s'agiter dans leurs Poké Balls ! C'est l'excitation du combat !"J\rViviane: ...On doit se battre ? ...D'accord. Je ferai de mon mieux."A\bChamsin: Tout est prêt ! Visez la victoire ! En voiture !"S\bChammal: Je déploierai toute mon énergie pour vous affronter. En voiture !"F\bSam: Sortez tout ce que vous avez appris et venez m'affronter !"F\rCarole: Voyons si tu peux enflammer ma passion pour le combat !"R\bTakim: La star du spectacle, c'est moi ! Je vais t'éblouir ! C'est parti !"y\rCharline: Je n'aime pas les bavardages inutiles. Dépêche-toi. Viens... On va voir si ta chance tient toujours..."f\bEsteban: Si tes liens sont fragiles, tu ne battras jamais mes Pokémon ! Prouve-moi ta valeur !"9\rCathy: Laisse-moi voir l'étendue de ton talent..."5\bBayar: Montre-moi ton courage dans ce combat !"m\bKoner: Montre-moi le lien que tu as tissé avec tes Pokémon et tout ce que tes combats t'ont appris !"Q\rDahlia: Ne perdons pas de temps. Je veux tester tes capacités moi-même !"(\bCardus: Très bien, c'est parti !"K\bParsley: Je t'assure que tu ne regretteras pas de m'avoir affronté."N\rArgenta: Je serai ton défi le plus difficile. Essaie de me surpasser !"&La porte de fer est verrouillée."_\rViviane: Je... suis Viviane. Je... n'aime pas parler... Je choisis mes mots avec soin..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"}\bJe reconnais que le Défi Synchro est dur, alors je vais t'aider. Regarde bien ce qu'il y a à ma gauche la prochaine fois."?Choisis le Pokémon qui recevra la Bénédiction d'Arceus."3<<Imprégnation de la Bénédiction d'Arceus>>"$Les dresseurs se transforment !"SL'alarme de sécurité s'est déclenchée après le combat. Que vas-tu faire ?"0\b???: Ehhh, il y avait bien quelqu'un ici."(Vite ! Reprends le chemin inverse !"Fuis ! Sauve ta peau !"T\bTrace: Je devrais vérifier si tes Pokémon sont en forme... avec un combat !"h\bMax: C'est pour ça que la Team Magma doit agrandir les terres ! Pour le bonheur de l'humanité !"Gauche"Bas"Droite"Oui"Non"Rester et se battre"Retourner au lobby"S'échapper;[�"Choose your path."U\bMilo: Well then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"h\rNessa: No matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."i\bKabu: In the end, the match will be decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."G\rBea: I think I'll test that unshakable spirit of yours, shall I?"#\bAllister: H...here...I go..."Y\rOpal: I'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."4\bGordie: Size means strength! Savor this pain!"p\rMelony: All righty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."Q\bAvery: Prepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"-\rKlara: You'll never know what hit you!"O\bPiers: Get ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"M\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"P\bRaihan: Bring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"^\bMustard: Don't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"n\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolutely champion time!"<\bHop: So let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"a\bBede: I suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how pathetic you are and how strong I am."U\rMarnie: It'd be no fun if things ended quick... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"M\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna give it a taste test?"B\rGloria: Ok, wait no further! All pumped up and ready to go!"\\rMagnolia: So, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."(\rSonia: Let's give it our all now!"a\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, then Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"�\bRose: I saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: So let's have a fun and intense battle that both our teams can really enjoy!"k\bLian: I'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or face the wrath of my Pokemon!"1\rArezu: Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"3\rCalaba: Now let's not be distracted further."0\bIscan: N-now, you insist... We can begin."6\rPalina: Without any further, show me your team."1\bMelli: Accept your loss and out of my way!"p\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory loose... Would you honor me with a battle?"F\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win me first!"d\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"E\rCharm: I'm the eldest Fortune, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"I\rClover: I'm the middle Fortune, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"Y\rCoin: I'm the youngest Fortune, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."v\bBeni: You, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to molder all these long years!"P\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every moves!"c\bKamado: We will let fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh. I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"N\rIrida: Let's compare what we know, whose's world is vast in comparison."\\rCyllene: You know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."4\bRei: Now it's time for our partners to shine."=\rAkari: Here I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"x\bLaventon: Come now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"f\rCogita: I will have to pardon this only time, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."f\bVolo: TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"S\bMilo: Hmmm? Oh, you must be one of those challengers, right? My name's Milo."b\bWe're gonna be as tough as weeds! But... that's not gonna keep you down! What a proper job!"O\bWell then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"�\bMilo: Battling with you seems to perk my Grass- type Pokémon right up! I hope that has been a fulfilling Pokémon battle for you too!"3\bWe'll be cheering you on from the bleachers!"o\rNessa: You're one of the ones endorsed by Hitsu, right? You've become something of a hot topic among us."{\rI think you've already realized, but I'm Nessa. I don't doubt that your mind as a Pokémon Trainer must be quite refined."e\rBut no matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."T\rNessa: Your teamwork was just flawless! It's enough to make me a bit jealous."O\rRide that current all the way to the end! Give the crowd what they want!"\bKabu: Every Trainer and Pokémon trains hard in pursuit of victory. But that means your opponent is also working hard to win."q\bI was training right up until the last moment so that I can guarantee you the best match when we face off!"b\bBut in the end, the match is decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."r\bKabu: Clearly, your talent surpassed my many years of experience. I'm glad I could also feel my own growth."`\bAnd I plan to keep growing and battling, until I become an old coot that nobody can beat!"\\rBea: One has to be careful not to let a single victory lull oneself into complacency."Z\rDo you also have an unshakable spirit that won't be moved, no matter what you face?"0\rI think I'll just test that out, shall I?"<\rBea: Facing you gave me all the explanation I needed."k\rBea: It's good to be unshakable in the face of battle. But it's good to be moved by battle, as well."\bAllister: ......Oh. You.")\b...I'm Allister. ...You look well."\bH-here... I go..."<\bAllister: ...That was ace. I will rem... ember you..."%\bG-give it your best out there."�\rOpal: There you are, child. Though you are really lacking in the color pink, you seem like a fine candidate to be my successor."p\rMy morning tea is finally kicking in, and I suppose it's a bit late to introduce myself, but... I'm Opal."S\rI'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."}\rOpal: Still not what I'm looking for... Oh, don't worry yourself about it, child. It's just a matter of my preference."d\rIt's time for me to step out of the spotlight soon. For young, fresh talents to really shine."[\bGordie: The name's Gordie. I admit I feel a little bad for doing this to you, but..."U\bI'm going to use this match to show the crowd that my Pokémon are unbeatable!",\bSize means strength! Savor this pain!"K\bGordie: That was... impressive. Rules are rules. You get to move on."T\bI pride myself on my solid Pokémon. I just need to train harder, that's all."N\rMelony: I am Melony. Well, you'll find my battle style is quite severe."O\rIf You're not careful, I could sweep your feet right out from under you."f\rAlrighty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."w\rMelony: Of course seeing my Pokémon lose is sad, but to meet someone so young with such ability is quite grand."6\rGive the next one a right thrashing, would you?"B\bAvery: Quite the commendable punctuality. My name is Avery."z\bI don't think you're quite up to snuff... And it's up to me, as an elegant adult, to make sure you get the message."J\bPrepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"+\bAvery: Improbable... No, impossible!"P\bPerhaps I am just an average man who gave everything he possibly could..."d\rKlara: Aha, there you are, right on time too! I'm the colorful, caring and charismatic Klara!"h\r......What's with the silence? Am I being mocked... by a kid?! Gosh, you're a pain in the neck..."&\rYou'll never know what hit you!"K\rKlara: Huh?! No no no! NO no no! There must be some kind of mistake!"M\rAaagh! Why can't I win?! All that effort, and nothing to show for it?!"]\bPiers: *sigh*... So you're finally here, huh? Reckoned nobody was comin' to challenge."~\bThe only thing a humble singer can do is sing a humble song. I still hope you enjoy the battle, though you know you'll lose!"H\bGet ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"J\bPiers: Piers doesn't do encores, but I admit I'm tempted right now."2\bLet's meet up again for a battle some time!"J\bPeony: Gahahaha! Aren't you the brave one, pickin' a fight with me!"@\bCan't say I hate you buttin' in here... The name's Peony!"F\bBrace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"Q\bPeony: Gahahaaa! Look at me, takin' a thrashin' from a youngster like you!"[\bThat was one ultra-mega-heated final battle! Hats off to you. In more ways than one!"h\bRaihan: Oh! If it isn't the Trainer endorsed by the Hitsu! Let's see... What was your name again?"r\bAh, right! \PN! And if Hitsu himself recognized your potential... Then I guess you'll be quite the Trainer."H\bBring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"|\bRaihan: In the aftermath of that furious battle... I feel as pure and refreshed as when the sky clears after a storm."V\bI might have lost, but I still look good. Maybe I should snap a quick selfie..."\\bMustard: Why, hello there! I'm pleased as cheese that you could join me for a battle."B\bYou seem to be the hardworking type too! My name's Mustard!"U\bDon't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"|\bMustard: Strength ebbs and flows in an endless cycle. One moment you grasp it, and the next, it slips from your hand."o\bYou young folks grow so fast! It never ceases to amaze me. Congratulations, from the bottom of my heart!"W\bLeon: It probably goes without saying, but... hello! I'm Galar's Champion, Leon!"|\bI love giving it everything I've got as a Trainer and seeing my team give everything they've got to seize another victory!"f\bI can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"`\bLeon: You've beat even the unbeatable Champion! I offer you my heartfelt congratulations!"�\bI hope this isn't the last time I get to meet you in battle! Keep challenging me so that I can keep reaching ever greater heights!"U\bHop: It's me, Hop! It's time for my new legend to begin here with my Pokémon!"}\bMy goal's to take on my bro. But not just that, I want to beat him! I want to be the one who beats the unbeatable Champion!"V\bSo let's show everyone the greatest battle ever, to be one step closer to Leon!"E\bHop: That was a real nail-biter of a match! I'm happy for you!"X\bI'm a bit disappointed in myself, but you won't get me so easily next time, mate!"w\bBede: What a joke. It's positively criminal of you, wasting my time here. So why don't you walk out of here now?"t\bYou're aware that I was chosen by Hitsu and Galar's Chairman himself, so that makes me more amazing than you!"[\bI suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how strong I am and how pathetic you are."j\bBede: This isn't what I planned. If I was able to defeat you, then everything would've been fine..."W\bNext time... I'll prove I'm a notch above the competition to everyone before me."g\rMarnie: Fancy seein' you again. I'm Marnie. Seems like I'm gonna have to watch out for you, huh?"[\rWhat're you gawkin' at? It's exactly what you think. I'm goin' to be the one to win."P\rIt'd be no fun if things ended just yet... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"k\rMarnie: Ok, I got to see a lot of the good points of you and your Pokémon! Guess that's not so bad!"V\rJust so y'know... I still haven't decided if I'm gonna cheer for you... See ya!"w\bVictor: Victor here. I've just finished cooking something tasty back there... Would you like to have some later?"V\bNo? I'm pretty confident when it comes to cooking and Pokémon battles, y'know."B\bWanna have a taste test? My Pokémon are prepped and ready!"W\bVictor: Thorough preparation is important for both cooking and Pokémon battles."a\bYour teamwork is just like a bowl of great curry! I gotta learn the secret to your recipe!"h\rGloria: Pleased to meetcha! I'm Gloria! And everywhere is a great stage for adventure and battle!"|\rAnd all that got me more peckish than usual. I think I'll make some sandwiches after this! It'll really hit the spot!">\rOk, wait no further! I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"U\rGloria: Strength is hard to obtain, and even harder to keep! Or so they say..."P\rWith your performance, there's no doubt you'll be smashing all obstacles!"}\rMagnolia: Oh goodness, dear me. I'm sorry. I didn't even notice my guest! My name is Magnolia. Welcome, young trainer!"m\rAs you know, we Dynamax our Pokémon today using the energy from Wishing Stars that have fallen to us."b\rDynamaxing draws out the true strength from the trust between a Pokémon and their Trainer."R\rSo, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."~\rMagnolia: You have certainly grown strong in the face of adversity, dearie. It's up to you to figure out what to do with it."{\rThere are things that only young people like you can do, and there are other things that only you can do. Dream big."{\rSonia: Name's Sonia. I'm the professor's assistant. I've been on a journey to solve the Galar region's biggest mysteries!"o\rAh, here! It's a book I wrote! I even signed it - that makes it a collector's item. Don't want it? Okay."!\rLet's give it our all now!"e\rSonia: Whoa, what's all this about all of a sudden? I've never seen anything like this before!"7\rYour feat today is gonna be featured in my book!"�\rOleana: So, you got through all they have to stop you. I would expect nothing less of the Trainers handpicked by Hitsu himself."h\rBut I am afraid it is now time for you to go home. I'll treat you to something truly spectacular."T\rOnce I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"z\rOleana: Arghhh! This is inexcusable... What was I thinking... Anyone who's made it this far would be no pushover..."E\rEverything I did, I did to further the chairman's own goals..."\bRose: Ladies and gentlemen! To everyone watching from the lobby and from home, you have all been waiting for this big moment!"~\bBefore I get carried away, please allow me to introduce myself once again. My name is Rose, and it is a pleasure to be here."�\bI saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"�\bRose: Hmm, this isn't looking too good for me... Most impressive, \PN. I wouldn't expect any less from a challenger endorsed by Hitsu."�\bIt's too bad, but it can't be helped... I do tend to ramble on, I know. I love to make speeches. But I think I can stop talking now."^\rMai: Trying to bring out the best in our partners is one thing we might have in common."i\rDo you feel confident that you can lead your Pokémon in battle? Well, I guess such talk can wait."V\rSo let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"s\rMai: Through battling, I feel that I'm coming to a greater understanding both of you and of my own Pokémon."U\rI hope I can come to understand the feelings of wild Pokémon in this way too."h\bLian: I'm Lian. I've already deduced that you've come here well-prepared. Such an earnest desire."5\bBut I must turn you away, even if it pains me."h\bI'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or... face the wrath of my Pokemon!"n\bLian: I apologize for becoming briefly incomposed. I may've been defeated, but my passion still stands!"L\bAnd it seems we've settled things here. Don't get cold feet after me!"_\rArezu: You've got quite the reputation, you know. I mean, your journey is one to reckon."S\rSome people are actually kinda scared of you for doing something so amazing."A\rI'm Arezu, by the way! Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"G\rArezu: My luck's run out, though... as you can most likely tell."P\rBut you're amazing, you know that? Your display of control was beautiful!"c\rCalaba: That's Warden Calaba to you. Ho? Now would you look at that... I've heard about you."N\rThe chosen one? More like a whelp in my view. Waste no more of my time."+\rNow let's not be distracted further."f\rCalaba: I owe you an apology. I treated you with disrespect, thinking you were just some whelp."|\rI didn't even have the courtesy to listen to you. You'd think someone who's lived as long as I have would be more patient."8\bIscan: Give me a moment... So, um... I'm Iscan..."j\bWell, sudden visits give me quite a shock... I do hope you'll give me advance notice in the future.",\bN-now, if you insist... We can begin."z\bIscan: Your nerves aren't just steel... They're... titanium. It's positively frightening how, um, fearless you are."5\bI'll, um... I'll just take my leave here then."z\rPalina: You're that child who they speak of. Your strength must be amazing, and yet... you have such a gentle face."^\rI believe you have the potential to do great things. But let's not force that onto you.".\rWithout further ado, show me your team."Q\rPalina: That was a splendid match! I'm so proud of both you and your team."I\rThank you, truly, for battling together with me. It means so much."a\bMelli: Heh, it looks like even a slight breeze could topple you. Can you really defeat me?"Q\bStop trying to humiliate yourself. I can't be stopped by the likes of you!".\bAccept your loss and get out of my way!"\\bMelli: Listen here! Neither I nor my Pokemon admit defeat just yet. That was a fluke!"u\bHowever! I will withdraw to allow them to recover. There's no shame in a tactical retreat. Keep your guard up!"j\bIngo: Good day, good trainer. Pleased to properly meet you. Your presence... reminded me of... uhh."�\bI recall faintly, that I had a partner once, who looked... like me. His name escapes me; all I could remember was my own name."d\bPerhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"�\bIngo: Sometimes I find myself saying things without knowing where the words come from... yet those words seem to fill me with power."z\bAh, but now I've sidetracked us with this talk. Please convey my well wishes to your next challenger. Hurry onward!"m\rSabi: My clairvoyance told me... You're super talented, right? I bet you're gonna be fun to play with!"T\rI'm Sabi! I know why you're here too! To get to the end and get your rewards!">\rWell, you'll get it... if you can win against me first!"G\rSabi: Wow, you caught us AND you beat us. You've won my respect!"�\rOooh, and one more thing: Am I even really clairvoyant? Am I really having fun, or am I bored? Hmm. No one but me could really know, right?"c\bGaeric: Let's begin with some proper introductions! I am Gaeric. And you must be \PN, right?"o\bOn what grounds do you come here seeking for the title of the best? What does your heart tell you to do?"a\bIf that is what you hope to accomplish, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"O\bGaeric: I'm tough as an iceberg, but you smashed me through and through!"@\bI suppose you can get on with it now. This one's alright!"S\rCharm: Now who might you be? Not some stray traveler, from the looks of you."c\rI bring good luck to my sisters wherever I go, and ill luck to anyone who crosses our paths."6\rI'm the eldest, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"S\rCharm: You're really going to insist on getting in the way, you little runt?"L\rNow I know more about how you fight, and I won't hold back next time."Q\rClover: Your luck's just run out. A vicious trap, laid out by yours truly."V\rThought you spotted a four-leaf clover? Well, I'll soon have you seeing double!"@\rI'm the middle sister, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"N\rClover: This place... You gotta be kidding me! It wasn't a fair battle!"]\rWe were basically goin' easy on you! I'll make you regret that confidence next time!!!"�\rCoin: I should introduce myself properly... before I show you poor fool how wrong it was to assume that you could ever beat me."X\rHeads, I win, and tails, you lose. You've got no chance in this game of fortunes."K\rI'm the youngest, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."W\rCoin: What a blithering mooncalf I am. I guess I lose the coin toss sometimes..."V\rYou will pay for this embarrassment. I swear I will make you pay with interest!";\bBeni: Lively and kicking, are you? Good to see that."�\bI heard you managed to quell your foes one after another, oh, did it ever make my blood run hot and my heart pound... At last... at last..."u\bYou, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder for all these long years!"|\bBeni: It doesn't matter to me who wins and who loses. I'm here to show you how a ninja fights, the style of a dying breed!"S\bAnyway, they say hunger is the best seasoning. I'm going off to eat my fill."m\rZisu: The name's Zisu. Captain of the Security Corps. So you're the one that everyone's talking about?"P\rI see you've got some fight in you. Figured I'd give what advice I could."G\rShow me what you can do. I'll carefully observe your every move!"\rZisu: Strong style, agile style... You know what is right for a given situation, and direct your Pokemon with a little nudge."N\rYou are a true veteran in Pokemon battles. That's a lot coming from me!"a\bKamado: I have been waiting for you! I am Kamado, commander of the Galaxy Expedition Team!"V\bHrrrm! You've got vigor, I'll give you that! You've come far enough to face me."S\bLet fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!";\bKamado: You truly are a force to be reckoned with..."r\bI'm grateful to you for showing me what a heartening presence Pokémon can be. We must spar again sometime!"u\bAdaman: Look who's being punctual! Good to finally meet you, stranger! I'm Adaman, leader of the Diamond Clan."|\bTime is all about change, and we can't live in fear of that. We can only try to change the time we live in for the better."l\bOh, look at the time. I'll cut the greetings then! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"S\bAdaman: Well, you've done it! That was amazing! I'm still shaking, even now."V\bNext time we'll come at you even harder and give you a battle you won't forget!"Y\rIrida: This stage is just for the both of us. I'm Irida, leader of the Pearl Clan!"`\rThe world before our eyes grows broader when we achieve true understanding with Pokémon."?\rLet's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."`\rIrida: Your sheer power, it's as unfathomably vast as space itself. I'm in awe before it."i\rI know I may never come to understand everything out there, but I'll keep my heart open to trying."\\rCyllene: I am the captain of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps. You may call me Cyllene."O\rWe are here to prove our capability in taming and handling our Pokémon."S\rYou know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."�\rCyllene: I set a high hurdle to judge whether a stranger like yourself could be worthy, but you cleared it. You've passed your trial."O\rBe proud. Present yourself orderly for whoever may come before you next."@\bRei: I'm Rei, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps!"�\bI want to conduct survey work so I can reach a point where if I meet a Pokémon, we can understand each other, even without battling."?\bHow about you then? It's time for our partners to shine!"b\bRei: The way you fight alongside your Pokémon - you don't seem scared of battling one bit."@\bFair enough. We'll just have to catch up the best we can."Z\rAkari: Hi! I'm Akari, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps! Nice to meet you!"h\rOur job as the Survey Corps is to research Pokémon and find out what kind of creatures they are!"6\rHere I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"q\rAkari: I guess doing research tasks and learning is one thing, and using that knowledge well is another..."^\rBattling certainly has its merits... I think I understand my Pokémon a bit better now."K\bLaventon: Ah! You gave me quite the shock, coming to me like that..."]\bOh yes, and...what might your name be? Oho! So you're called \PN! My name is Laventon."S\bI am something of a scholar seeking to deepen our understanding of Pokémon."n\bCome now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"[\bLaventon: Splendiferous results! I daresay you've earned yourself a pat on the back!"Q\bYou know, I expect great things of you. Carry on the good fight out there!"�\rCogita: First off, no "mistress," thank you. Just Cogita. It seems I'll be able to fulfil my duty at long last, thanks to you."c\rIndeed, I am to guide you, lost one. For the task of preventing great disaster falls to you."l\rThis is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."c\rCogita: There is nobility in knowing what must be done and seeing to it. You see, don't you?"y\rI have passed on to you all there is to pass. Where history goes from here... I leave it to you to see it through."�\bVolo: Ever since I was young, whenever I encounterd something painful or heartbreaking... I couldn't help but wonder why life was so unfair and why I was cursed to live through such things."�\bEventually, I chose to direct all my energy into my own natural curiosity and ambition. And what tickled my curiosity stronger than anything else were the mysteries to be found in legends, in history, in ruins..."�\bEver since I becoming convinced that Arceus really does exist, I also realised I need to be able to subjugate its power... TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"�\bVolo: I've devoted myself to Arceus beyond any other! I worshiped it as the creator of our entire world! I dedicated all of my passion and interest to studying it! All the time I've spent poring over the legends... Everything that I've done!"�\bDo you mean to tell me that this world doesn't need to be remade? Then, my journey is over. My story ended when I lost to you."The door is locked..."c\bBrock: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"\\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you. It makes me sleepy to be here alone."V\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well... I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you... You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"J\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon? Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."T\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"y\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac! I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."]\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day! The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"f\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected! I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"f\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill! I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"r\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"c\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Y\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here! No holds barred. No hard feelings!"}\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."Z\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring shame to us by losing!"k\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills. But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."Y\rDon't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"p\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon? Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."b\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you! That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"X\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! You defeated me, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine!"�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."H\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed. Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with. There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."u\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I'm an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they're fans of mine!"�\rOften, they'll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."V\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"\\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That's true of people and Pokémon alike!"p\rI've definitely noticed what your good points are! I'll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."h\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon! Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"x\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic! Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"~\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"V\rMina: Hrmmm! Well, this is frustrating. I failed to really use my full power..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"f\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can't let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."W\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it? Come on, let's try to cheer up!"o\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."Z\bDon't take it too serious now. You'll tire yourself out if you're always in a rush."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."`\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."q\bIt's been a while since I've walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It's a nice feeling."N\bNow I've got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."u\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together! There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."e\bYou'll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can't be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"d\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose. They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."\\rSelene: Alola! I'm Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"Y\rLet's be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"g\bElio: Alola! My name's Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."4\bI'd be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"u\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."Q\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an expert authority of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."g\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."M\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute! Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"f\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different. But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."e\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members. To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"V\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine. Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."?\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well. Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."k\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terrors are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."n\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughened ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"O\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon. Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."S\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"|\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon. They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"_\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style. You shocked me through and through."}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"v\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."j\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?! You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"m\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."H\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again? So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don't expect to be forgiven. I'm simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Titan Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Titan Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"b\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"T\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong. Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."G\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here? On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughen ourselves by digging up Fossils."k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."n\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me! Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"@\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or I'm fining you 10 million!"W\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger. That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal relationship between Pokémon and people!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"T\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what? More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."O\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."X\bI'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!""\bAllister: H-here... I go..."@\rOpal: Show me what you can do when you go all out, child."C\rMelony: You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid!"=\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle!"l\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"9\bHop: Let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"J\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna have a taste test?"5\rGloria: Ok, I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"\\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"Z\bRose: Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: Let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"6\rPalina: Without further ado, show me your team."j\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"N\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win against me first!"_\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, we must judge whether are you up to the task!"z\bBeni: You are the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder all these long years!"O\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every move!"4\bKamado: Which of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh, I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"F\rIrida: Let's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."t\rCogita: This is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."p\bVolo: IT'S TIME TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever! Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen. Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat. I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."m\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy. ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."~\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe.";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here? On an adventure?"V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded."I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here...";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"y\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!">\bHitsu: You bought a Backstage Pass to meet us? *laughs*"W\bYou know what that means, right? BONUS ROUND! And I can't take no for an answer."@\bLet's not delay any further, shall we? Please! Defeat me!"�\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master! Other than that, I have nothing much to say now, besides well done! The meet and greet is over. Ciaoz~"�\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA. Come back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Bye~"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."k\bLuc: Ara ara, you bought a pass just to meet us again? Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er for that? Just kidding."\bSay less. Let's battle!"w\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost. Well done, and cheers for meeting me! Hasta la vista!"i\bHaha, no hard feelings mate, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."g\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me? Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!";\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me, on your own accord?"\bFascinating indeed."G\bNow amuse me by engaging in a battle with me! Surprise surprise!"u\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter, there are those who possess much greater power than I do. You may leave after me."L\rVermint: Oh? You've made it this far and you're still moving forward."<\rVery well, let's see if you can keep that enthusiasm!"P\rVermint: I see... I've lost. I look forward to seeing your progress, \PN."*\rBut remember, I am always watching."B\rVermint: You lack strength and the resolve to move forward."S\rYou shall not pass this horizon where both of your passion and resolve meet."Y\rVermint: My, my quite surprising You've decided to battle me without true resolve?".\rLet's see if you can stay enthusiastic."C\rVermint: That's surprising... My Minuend was wrong for once."Z\r\PN, I'm looking forward towards your progress. And remember, I am always watching."[\rVermint: A battle without true resolve just shows that you're not on the right path."B\rFind your own resolve and I shall judge it with my Minuend."2\bLuc-ker: \PN, huh? Should've expected that."<\bWell, since you're here, lemme tell you a lil' story."�\bOnce upon a time, a teenager stumbled upon this world. He roamed the world far and wide, seeking to experience Ash's journey for himself."�\bUntil one day, he'd finished the journey. But with nothing else to do in the world at that time, he decided to start over again, and again, and again.":\bBut of course, all good things must come to an end."�\bOne day, when trying to exploit the system that he thought he'd grown so used to, it forcefully ejected him out, back into his original world.":\bAnd then after a while, he forgot about this world."9\bThat was, until that world experienced a pandemic."|\bThe teenager, now a few years older with some more knowledge and common sense, wanted to help out in improving this world."Y\bSo he reached out to this world's creator, and was given the opportunity to do so."Q\bAnd that's when I was born. Luc-ker. (the hyphen is important by the way!)"b\bA bit of trivia: That actually wasn't my original name! But that really doesn't matter now."�\bAll you need to know is that I've been helping improve this world's systems for many years now, taking breaks every now and again."A\bOf course, I would eventually meet Hitsu during this time."}\bWhen he first came up with the idea of the Grandeur Club, I never thought I'd be the one to facilitate it, but here we are."j\bWith trainers coming from all over the Pokémon universe, this is our love letter to the franchise."}\bIf you couldn't tell, we also loved Pokémon Masters. So we wanted some trainers from there that you could battle here too!"�\bI'm very happy with what we've accomplished. Of course, there were many, many struggles, but we've overcome them to get where we are today."@\bAnd now, we're at the end of our shared journey together."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"G\bWhat, you thought that was a hint to us adding in Gen 9? Hahaha!"�\bNah, I just liked the sound of saying that. Gen 9 isn't going to be added into the game unfortunately (or fortunately for myself, actually)."v\bThat being said, I do have to say ariagato to you as well, \PN. Without you, we would've never gotten this far."q\bAs a thank you for letting us experience the end of our journey together, let me reward you with a battle."\\bOh, you want to face off against me at my full power? You never cease to surprise me."y\bVery well. But don't say you weren't warned - this battle will use the mechanics of the Sync and Titan Challenges."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!" \bThat didn't work, did it?"~\bLuc: Phew! Even while breaking multiple system limits, I still can't beat you. You're truly an incredible trainer, \PN."g\bOf course, I could've broken more limits, but I really don't want to destroy this world, y'know?"~\bHere's where I'd give you a reward, but I've been programmed to not give you any if you've decided to only bully me :<("N\bAnyway, your reward for beating me. Three very special bo'ohw'o'wo'ers."D\bLuc: Thanks for letting me go all-out! That felt pretty good."v\bDon't worry too much about the fact that you couldn't beat me! I was breaking multiple system limits after all."j\bBut then again... I did warn you. You should know from the trainers from the Sync challenge, right?"_\bBut then again... I did warn you. All's fair when it comes to the Grandeur Club, y'know?"i\bYou also did put up a pretty good fight, and pushed me to limits that no other trainer has before.")\bAnyway, that's all for this place!"6\bCome, let me take you back to where you belong."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"-\bBlue: Show it to us - your true power!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"j\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! Here, come battle with me!"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"b\bFalkner: I'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"�\bMorty: With a little more, I could see a future in which I meet the Pokémon of rainbow colors. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"U\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? May you prove it to me...?"I\bPryce: I, Pryce - the winter trainer - shall demonstrate my power!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!",\bWill: Losing is not an option for us!"O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon...":\bBruno: Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go.">\bLance: It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"7\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"Z\bNorman: You'd better give it your best shot. I'll do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"k\rPhoebe: Don't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show us. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give us your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"!\bRoark: This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"]\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because I know how to focus. Get ready to lose!"V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."U\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"�\bBrycen: Receiving the support of your Pokémon makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"a\bHilbert: I'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"w\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"W\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"}\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"o\bGhetsis: We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"9\rViola: Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"U\bGrant: I hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."?\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance!"e\bRamos: The survival of plants is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"h\rValerie: The elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."S\rOlympia: This is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"�\bWulfric: Depending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."#\rMalva: I'm burning up, runt!"r\bSiebold: To devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."i\bWikstrom: Let us alll give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"@\rDrasna: Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"�\rDiantha: You know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."p\rShauna: I'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"5\bTierno: Anyway, can we have a Pokémon battle?"�\bTrevor: I am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas, but that doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"^\rSerena: Woohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!":\bCalem: All right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"2\bSycamore: Let's all have a Pokémon battle!"?\bLysandre: My desire... it is for a more beautiful world!"H\bIlima: Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!">\rLana: I'm going to show you what a serious Lana can do!"L\bKiawe: I hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"<\rMallow: Let's get us cooking into the heat of battle!"P\bSophecles: Um! Could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling?"O\rMina: Maybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"S\rAcerola: Maybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"\\rHapu: Looks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."`\bNanu: Don't take it too serious now. You'll tire yourself out if you're always in a rush."X\rOlivia: You can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"c\rKahili: Let's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"W\bMolayne: Now I've got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"D\bHala: Old Hala here will also be going all out! Let us clash!"7\bHau: I wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"O\rLillie: I'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"9\bGladion: Battle me. I won't take no for an answer."4\rSelene: I'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!";\bElio: I'd be happy to show you what I am capable of."s\bKukui: Now, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"@\rLusamine: Let's see... Yes, you. \PN. You will battle me."I\bGuzma: Wanna see what destruction looks like? It's your boy Guzma!"�\bEusine: My desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"Y\rCheryl: You're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."?\rMira: Get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"R\bRiley: Now, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."k\bBuck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"A\rMarley: ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best.">\bEmmet: Everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"O\bIngo: I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"J\bNoland: Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"9\rGreta: Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"r\bTucker: Tucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"q\rLucy: I'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."g\bSpencer: If your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"8\rAnabel: Let me see your talent in its entirety..."1\bBrandon: Bring your courage to our battle!"|\bPalmer: Show me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"L\rDahlia: Let us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!",\bThorton: All righty, let's get going!"M\bDarach: Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."R\rArgenta: I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me.""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�\bI recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."5Choose the Pokémon to give Arceus' Blessing to."!<<Imbuing Arceus' Blessing>>"#The trainers are transforming!"RThe security alarm must have been tripped after the battle. What will you do?"0\b???: Ehhh, there really was someone here.",Quick! Scurry back where you came from!"Run! Run for your life!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"�\bMaxie: We, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"	Left"	Down"
