y to go all out against you again. I won't lose!"r\bSteven: I couldn't have asked for a better battle. Good luck in the semi-finals, even if you won't need it."9\bSteven: I couldn't have asked for a better battle."�\rIris: Hi \PN! Glad we get to battle each other, unlike our first time here. Just know that I'll be going all out, so you'd better do the same!"@\rIris: You're still so strong... I'll be cheering for you!"1\rIris: Yay! You'd better be rooting for me!"%\rCynthia: Good to see you, \PN."-\rCynthia: Good to see you, Monarch \PN."{\rI know how much you've improved from when we first met and that it's enough to defeat me even if I'm fully prepared."3\rThat's why I won't be holding back anything!"S\rNot even my full power was enough... you're a truly impressive trainer, \PN."o\rThat really could've gone either way. I'm amazed how you could grow even more from our last battle, \PN."u\bAlain: Even if you're not the Monarch anymore, I know that you're an opponent that's not to be underestimated."G\bAlain: I didn't think I'd fight you as the current Monarch, \PN."^\bNot much else to say. Give me an even more intense battle than the Kalos League finals!"E\bAlain: As I'd expect from you. Stand proud \PN, you're strong."o\bAlain: Hah... that was a very narrow victory. Great battle, \PN. I'll be looking forward to our rematch."d\rDiantha: Hey \PN. I've been looking forward to the day we would have an official full battle."S\rI know how strong you are, so don't hold anything back so I can do the same!"_\rDiantha: You're even stronger than when we last battled. Let's have another battle soon."^\rDiantha: I couldn't have won without going all out. You're a truly strong trainer, \PN."@\bLeon: At long last, we're here again. It's Champion time!"%\bLet's do this again some time."=\bLeon: Excellent battle. Let's do this again some time."j\rMarnie: There you are. I'm glad you were able to make it. I'm sorry if my fans caused any problems."<Rotom Phone: Based on performance, y