tful. You have pink in your heart after all."3\rI'm afraid not. You lack pink in your heart."~\rOpal: This Pokémon is one of many you can find in Glimwood Tangle. Treat the forest kind, and it will reward you in return."}\bGoh: Finally, an end to the questions. I was starting to think they'd never end. I'll send data over to the Professor."�Rotom Phone: Announcment. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Harry, located in Stow-on-Side, is ready for battle."[\bGoh: That's close by. Go ahead and take care of that. I'll meet you back at the lab."3\rOpal: You have pink in your heart after all."	Pink"Purple"16 years old"88 years old"Ponyta"RapidashIu;␀�[[*"\\bI've always wanted to go visit the lake, but I hear a dangerous Pokémon lives there."SValor Lakefront Pokémon Contest Hall\nThis year's choice for the Wallace Cup!"S\bThanks for finding Wallace! Why not enter the Wallace Cup while you're here?"b\bExcuse me. Do you think you could find Wallace for me? The contest can't start without him."P\bSunnyshore is nearby. The Gym Leader isn't very welcoming of challengers."M\bI wonder when Wallace will show up? He is one of the judges after all."�\rBertha: ...A Trainer aiming to be a Pokémon Master, am I right? How do I know this? Observation is everything, my dear. Let me show you."|\rBertha: Overall you did very well. Don't forget to pay attention to everything though, you never know what you could miss."9\bI hear he is training at Lake Valor. I wonder why?"\bAbra"Z\bAre you \PN? A boy named Barry told me to send you to Twinleaf Town if you came by."`\bThere is a power surge coming from that way. I'm sorry but you can't go through this way."$Come heal your Pokémon inside!"7\bHello there. Want my Abra to take you somewhere?" \bIf you ever feel like it."]\bIt's said that some Pokémon evolve from this, but I can't figure it out. You take it."5\bCome show me your new evolved friend sometime."B\bYou'll need at least two Pokémon if you want to battle us."+\bAh, looks like a chance to show off.",\bAt least I still have the restaurant."b\rDid you come all the way here for the Wallace Cup? Or are you early for the Grand Festival?"\bI'm having so much fun!"What a blast."\bI love the beach!"\rSlaking" The Seven Stars Restaurant!"B\rYou'll need at least two Pokémon if you want to battle us.")\rI was almost bored. Are you ready?"7\rMy partner will just keep training here with me."k\bWe don't have a Center here, but some people have taken it upon themselves to give travelers a rest."$\rCan you take me to the water?"I can wait."\rI want to go swimming,"Twinleaf"Veilstone"Cancel"Celestic[*"g\bJ'ai toujours voulu aller visiter le lac, mais j'ai entendu dire qu'un Pokémon dangereux y vit."TSalle de Concours du Lac Courage\nLe choix de cette année pour la Coupe Marc !"g\bMerci d'avoir trouvé Marc ! Pourquoi ne pas participer à la Coupe Marc pendant que tu es là ?"k\bExcusez-moi. Pensez-vous pouvoir trouver Marc pour moi ? Le concours ne peut pas commencer sans lui."^\bRivamar est tout près. Le Champion n'est pas très accueillant envers les challengers."S\bJe me demande quand Marc va apparaître ? Il est l'un des juges après tout."�\rTerry: ...Un Dresseur qui vise le titre de Maître Pokémon, n'est-ce pas ? Comment je le sais ? L'observation est la clé de tout, mon enfant. Laisse-moi te montrer."�\rTerry: Dans l'ensemble, tu t'en es très bien sorti. N'oublie pas de prêter attention à tout, on ne sait jamais ce qui peut nous échapper."S\bJ'ai entendu dire qu'il s'entraîne au Lac Courage. Je me demande pourquoi ?"\bAbra"c\bEs-tu \PN ? Un garçon nommé Barry m'a dit de t'envoyer à Bonaugure si tu passais par ici."i\bIl y a une surtension venant de là-bas. Je suis désolé, mais vous ne pouvez pas passer par ici."1Venez soigner vos Pokémon à l'intérieur !";\bSalut. Tu veux que mon Abra t'emmène quelque part ?""\bSi jamais l'envie te prend."~\bOn raconte que certains Pokémon évoluent grâce à ça, mais je n'arrive pas à compre