e is famous. Not many places have such a complex bridge."2Sunnyshore City Pokémon Gym Leader:\nVolkner"The Shining, Shocking Star"!\bSo, you want to try again.""\bWell done. Until next time."Sunnyshore Tower"\bDewgong"M\bFlint: You look like a strong Trainer. Are you here to battle Volkner?"�\bThe guy slipped into a funk. No one gives him a challenge anymore, and Volker is about ready to quit and fight the Elite Four."z\bWhy not fight me? It may just inspire my friend to give it another go. By the way. I'm Flint, an Elite Four member."*\bSo what do you say? Want to battle?"0\bThat's fine. Come back when you're ready."V\bFlint: That was a great battle! What do you think, Volkner? Give the kid a try."5\bVolkner: I suppose I will. Meet me in the Gym."D\bFlint: This is great. Be sure to give Volkner a tough battle."(\rI'm so embarassed. I lost my key."\bHow did you get here?"`\bVolker often gets bored. He occasionally causes power blackouts from his gym experiments."s\bVolkner has lost his motivation. I've known him since he was a kid. It's frustrating to watch him like this."_\bVolkner is full of energy these days. It warms my heart to see him full of spirit again."\rSmeargle"Lake Verity"Lake Valor"Lake Acuity"	Exit"Lily of the Valley"Yes"No[<"%\bTanguy : Ne me dérange pas..."(\bTanguy: Je te verrai à l'Arène."ABoutique de Pierres.\nPour tous vos besoins en évolutions !"&Motismart: Appel entrant de Goh :"�\bGoh: \PN, il y a une nouvelle mission du Projet Mew. Pourrais-tu me rejoindre aux Ruines du Colosse dans le Désert Délassant ?"B\bJe suis sur le point de partir à la recherche de trésors."6\bQuel Dresseur impressionnant. Tu mérites ceci."[\bJe suis un chasseur de trésors. Un jour, je veux devenir professeur d'archéologie."0\bMon oiseau peut voler partout. Et alors ?"C\bJe suppose qu'on peut t'emmener en volant. Où allons-nous ?"\\rLa Tour de Rivamar ressemble à celle que l'on trouve à Johto, mais en moins grande."�\rAurore: \PN ! Devine quoi ? J'ai par