ill of the World Coronation Series."k\bYour first match has been decided. You will be facing Steven. Please speak to me when you are ready."F\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Vanilla Cream Alcremie?"\bMaybe next time, then."7\bAlright, let's give it a quick clockwise spin..."N\b...And done! Now just give it a sweet and level it up for it to evolve."G\bSorry, I can't do anything for you if you don't have an Milcery."D\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Macha Cream Alcremie?"G\bRaihan: I don't care what type of challenge it is. I won't lose."4\bGoh: This wasn't as bad as I thought it'd be."�\bFirst, ranked eighth: The shining first Champion of the Alola region's first-ever league. Hailing from Pallet Town, Competitor \PN!"C\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Ruby Cream Alcremie?">\bAlright, let's give it a quick counterclockwise spin..."E\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Salted Cream Alcremie?"~\bRanked seventh: Aiming to be a Dragon Master, and still growing even stronger. The young Champion of Unova, Competitor Iris!"C\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Mint Cream Alcremie?"?\bAlright, let's give it a longer counterclockwise spin..."C\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Ruby Swirl Alcremie?"�\bRanked sixth: An adventurer renowned for excavating Mega Stones. The winner of the Kalos League Lumiose Conference, Competitor Alain!"D\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Lemon Cream Alcremie?"8\bAlright, let's give it a longer clockwise spin..."F\bWant to make your Milcery evolve into a Caramel Swirl Alcremie?"�\bRanked fifth: A world-renowned actress enters the stage. Just as skilled in battle as on camera, she is the Champion of Kalos, Competitor Diantha!"}\bRanked fourth: The new Champion of Kanto and Johto. One of the Pokémon G-Men fighting evil far and near. Competitor Lance!"i\rOpal: Ah, you decided to show up after all. I've decided it's time for a cake battle. Let's begin."H\rOpal: I see you're quite the battler. Well