ock: Wonderful battle. I imagine Misty will be even harder."N\bGary: Impressive work. You might be good enough for Project Mew. Might."9\bGoh: I... think I'll join. I won't be left behind."z\bGary: Ha. We'll see. A qualifying mission will be sent to you soon. See you don't fail it. I'll be rooting for you."4\bGoh: I won't! I'll prove myself and find Mew.";\bThanks for helping, \PN. Let's head back to the lab."a\rMisty: It's about time I get to see you again. It's been far too long since I've beat you."J\rMisty: It's good to see you every now and then. Stop by more often."\bPhanpy"\bDonphan"\bBoldore"\bKrby!"\bKingler!"\bLeavanny"C\bGoh: A Moltres. I'd like to see that. Let's try and find it."Z\bKukui: Are you surprised? Professor Oak asked these two here for the demonstration."d\bKukui: That's it for our lesson. I hope everyone had fun here. Let's all head back to school."\bNoctowl!"4\bGoh: This Moltres is tough. Help me out, \PN."\bSnor..lax"C\rLillie: What an amazing place! So many Pokémon to discover."\bTorkoal"\bPalpitoad"\bGengar"\\bGary: \PN, good to see you again. Let's catch up more after I deal with this Moltres."\bTorterra"\bKrookodile!"\bLucario"7\bKiawe: So many Fire types! It's almost too much!"\bGlalie"8\bPaul: I heard you made it into the Masters Eight."�\bWhat am I doing here? I came to study under Professor Oak. Any Trainer wishing to understand Pokémon better would do the same thing."<\bDo you understand your Pokémon? Show me in a battle."J\bPaul: I think you might be ready. Don't disappoint me, okay? Later.")Rotom Phone: Incoming call from Goh:">\bGoh: Hey \PN. Could you meet me at Cerise Park? Thanks."\bStaraptor"\bHeracross!"#\rLana: I want to go swimming."\bScraggy"\bSirfetch'd"
