d sometime. The waves are great there."6\bSiebold: Let me cook you up something tasteful."c\bSiebold: If I wasn't up to your tastes try one of the other members of the Kalos Elite Four."0\bGiovanni: This time victory will be mine."%\bGiovanni: Leave while you can.")\bBrandon: You don't stand a chance."7\bBrandon: Continue to love and support your team."\rDrasna: Back for more?"+\rDrasna: I suppose you won this time."$\bMarlon: Let's ride the waves."&\bMarlon: That was a sick battle."7\rCissy: I've trained hard. I think I can do this."'\rCissy: I'm going to get tougher." \bNanu:... So, you're back?"'\bNanu: Give me some time to rest."%\bBrock: Time for a battle, \PN.")\bBrock: Good to see you again, \PN."(\bWulfric: Think you can handle it?"1\bWulfric: Your power is always at its peak.">\bLance: We meet again. It's time I tested you in battle."D\bLance: I'm impressed. You're deserving of the Champion title."Y\bWikstrom: It is a pleasure to see you again. Let us fight with chivalry and honor."A\bWikstrom: I enjoyed our fight. Continue to train yourself."*\bClay: You think you stand a chance?"-\bClay: It was all luck and you know it.".\rAnabel: Does your connection beat mine?"4\rAnabel: Even my psychic powers were no match."\bLeon: Champion time!"F\bLeon: As strong as ever. The rush you give me is like no other."&\bLt. Surge: So the punk is back.">\bLt. Surge: So you beat me again. It won't happen again."\rMaylene: Full power!"+\rMaylene: I just need to work harder.")\rRoxie: Let's turn it up to eleven."+\rRoxie: That battle spoke to my soul."$\bDanny: Good to see you again."4\bDanny: Don't worry about it. I'll get better."9\rHapu: Maybe this time I can give you a good fight."\rHapu: Come back soon."$\bRoark: Let's bring the power."@\bRoark: That battle was intense. Can't wait for next time."#\bBrycen: Let's set the stage."5\bBrycen: This is very different from the stage.")\bAlder:... Oh, is it time to fight?"\bAlder:..."%\bBlaine: Back for more are you?"C\bBlaine: Not even the best tricks can get me out of that one."\bSpenser: Let us begin."B\bSpenser: Don't get frustrated. Let your partners guide you."0\bWattson: Wahahaha. About time we do this.")\bWattson: Wahaha. I just can't win."*\rWhitney: Don't make me get serious.".\rWhitney: Don't think that this is over."3\bSteven: Well \PN, let's test each other out.""\bSteven: Please return soon."*It's your spot. Don't you feel proud?"1\rRoxanne: See if you can teach me anything."=\rRoxanne: Stop by and visit the school anytime you can.";\rCandice: What are we waiting for? Let's get started!"9\rCandice: I guess I battled a little too seriously."f\bDrake: I'm ready whenever you are. I'll represent the entire Hoenn Elite Four in their absence."4\bDrake: Don't think my age has slowed me down."\bKoga: Strike swiftly."'\bKoga: Victory goes to the swift."2\bDrake: Let's see what two champions can do."9\bDanny: It's always good to find a good challenger."2\bChili: I'm gonna serve up a scorching meal."+\bChili: You served up a real beating."*\rNurse Joy: You should take a break."H\rOh, good! You and your Pokémon are looking great. Take care now!"@\bVolkner: Good to see you again. Let's make this exciting."4\bVolkner: That was a rush. Come back any time.",\bNorman: Welcome. I hope you're ready."#\bNorman: You did a great job."R\bWallace: I may love contests, but I can battle just as well as anyone else."4\bWallace: We should do a performance together."'\bGrant: Time to climb to the top."3\bGrant: You've climbed high up in this world.""\bPryce: Don't hold back now."9\bPryce: It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."+\rBertha: I figured I'd see you again."6\rBertha: You won't catch me off guard next time."O\bDrayden: You hold a lot of potential. Let me see if I can help you grow."%\bDrayden: You've gotten better."*\bRudy: Don't think I'm holding back."/\bRudy: Come back when you're even better."/\rIris: Hi \PN! Back to battle a Champion?"T\rIris: I think we're both improving. Try to b