i's Lab"\rSweet!".\bI fished this up. Feel free to take it."=\bCome back some other time. I might have something new."\bZipp: Yo yo yo."The door is locked."3\bProfessor Kukui focuses on Pokémon attacks."%\bYo, don't bother us right now."\bNot cool."Alolan Blimp Service"_\rMom: This has been a great vacation. The town was just lovely. Ready to head home, dear?"b\rYou want to study here? Why, that's a wonderful idea. I guess we can head home without you."1\rMom: I guess we can head home without you.">\bKukui: Don't worry about him \PN. I'll take care of it."Pokémon School"%\bThe All-Out Brothers will win!"%\bThe Alola Champion is awesome!">\bThe forest is scary. Only students are allowed in here."~You are about to enter a battle with a legendary that will be unobtainable until the post game if it is not caught here. Save?"�\bIlima: Thanks for your help. I didn't really need it, but it's nice to see an act of kindness. I'm a graduate of this school. I came back to speak with Kukui."o\bHe informs me an Alola League is being set up. Having tried the Kalos League, I'm looking forward to it.";Rotom Dex: That didn't take too long. Time to go home."p\rMom: Oh \PN, doesn't this place look amazing? I'm going to go explore. Don't forget to drop off that egg."`\bKukui: So, you've come to battle me because I decided to start the Alola Pokémon League."q\bGuzma: You think too small. I've come to destroy you. You think replacing old customs will be a good idea?"b\bBut a League? That's a waste of time. Everybody already knows who the strongest Trainer is."G\bKukui: If you think that join the league and prove it in battle."~\bGuzma: Like I'd fall for that trick. I'll beat you right here, and if you still make the league, I'll destroy that too."u\bWhat's the matter kid? Think I'm being too hard on him? Fine, I'll take you down first. I could use a warm up."�\bGuzma: You call that a challenge? If this is the best one of your students can do then the whole league is going to be 