n't take too long. Time to go home."p\rMom: Oh \PN, doesn't this place look amazing? I'm going to go explore. Don't forget to drop off that egg."`\bKukui: So, you've come to battle me because I decided to start the Alola Pokémon League."q\bGuzma: You think too small. I've come to destroy you. You think replacing old customs will be a good idea?"b\bBut a League? That's a waste of time. Everybody already knows who the strongest Trainer is."G\bKukui: If you think that join the league and prove it in battle."~\bGuzma: Like I'd fall for that trick. I'll beat you right here, and if you still make the league, I'll destroy that too."u\bWhat's the matter kid? Think I'm being too hard on him? Fine, I'll take you down first. I could use a warm up."�\bGuzma: You call that a challenge? If this is the best one of your students can do then the whole league is going to be a joke. I'll just crush you there."J\rLana: I'm going to fish up the biggest Pokémon. Just wait and see."W\rLana: Hi \PN. You just missed my new friend, Dewpider. I didn't catch it though."ARotom Dex: Mallow will be in her dad's shop in Hau'oli City."9\rLana: Let's battle again soon. I know you like it."P\bSophocles: Don't bother me right now. I'm working on something important."9\rYou're the new student? The school isn't this way."�\bKukui: You didn't have to step in there; I could have handled him. Keep your eyes open. I doubt that's the last we'll see of Guzma."(\bFor now, why don't you head home?"\rPopplio"\rPikipek"\rTrumbeak"\rToucannon">Zeraora seems to want to come with you. Will you take it?"\bMr. Mime"\rTogedemaru"g\bTupp: Yo, what's this? You think you're better than us? I say instead you give us your Pokémon."I\bI love living so close to the beach. Nice to come home and unwind."\bTurtonator" Rotom Dex: Let's head home."nRotom Dex: ...I just received a message from the professor. He said to head to the school for a surprise."KRotom Dex: ...Wait, did you hear that in the school? Head back inside."aRotom Dex: I just received word of another Ultra Beast being spotted. Let's head to Route 3."\rYo yo."\rThat isn't fair."U\rI wish they would get rid of that grass already. Makes it so hard to get home.".\bKiawe: Let's try that again Turtonator."G\bKiawe: Lillie wanted to talk with you. I'll be ready afterwards."r\bKiawe: I'm going to take you to my home on Akala Island. I know you've wanted to explore the other islands."1\bTalk to Charizard when you're ready to go."Akala Island"	Exit"Paniola Ranch"Paniola"Wela Volcano"Ten Carat"Yes"No"Hau'oli City"Manalo StadiumIu;␀*[[
