ice to see someone standing up to those Team Skull punks. You deserve this."\bUse it well.":\bI'm always willing to teach this move to travelers." \bWant to learn Giga Drain?"\bCome back anytime!"�\bHold it! That Pokémon destroyed my golden safe. There's no way I'm letting anyone get in my way to make it pay for what it did."6\bEh, get lost. I'll earn it back some other way."\rLana: You finally showed up. I'm going to take you to an island so we can find some cool Water Pokémon. Are you ready to go?"\rHurry up and get ready."I\rLana: I had fun today. Talk to Lapras if you ever want to go back."F\rThe restaurant here is so good. You should try it out for sure."Lana's house"6Hau'oli City\nA city overflowing with gentle joy."Q\rLana: \PN, what a surprise. You caught me just before I shipped out again."6\rI could use a break and stretch my legs though."@\rLana: I guess it's time I got back out there with my dad."\bLapras":Rotom Dex: Great work. Let's head back to the school."B\bTupp: Yo, you again. Beat it, this girl's Pokémon is ours."@\bTupp: No way. Yo, this isn't cool. Let's get out of here."\bOricorio"5\bYou seem like a nice person. Please take this."\bSpread the joy."Sophocles's house"Litten ignored you."\rPrimarina"\b... You are not ready."\bZipp: Yo yo yo."\bGrimer"Lillie's house"\bLitten"YIt's the wild Litten that's been roaming around. Would you like to take it with you?"\bEevee"0\rRapp: Yo, what do you think you're doing?"\bRatatta"Paniola"	Exit"Aether"Vast Poni Canyon"Yes"No"Tapu Village"Seafolk Village"Manalo Stadium"Hau'oli Outskirts"Kukui's House[D"(\rBonjour. Tu voudrais des fruits ?"&\rJ'espère que Flamiaou va bien."%\rPrends bien soin de Flamiaou !"Maison de Barbara"A\bNous ne prenons pas de passagers pour le moment. Désolé."+\bBienvenue. Où voudriez-vous aller ?"q\bBienvenue. Où voudriez-vous aller ?\ch[1,-1, Ohana, Æther, Grand Canyon de Poni, Mont Lanakila, Quitter]"@Cette balle contient un Marshadow. Voulez-vous le pr