fey"E\rMy Ralts can Teleport you. However, he is too tired right now."5\rMy Ralts can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Iki,Cancel]"=\rMy Ralts can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Iki,Paniola,Cancel]"D\rMy Ralts can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Iki, Paniola,Royal,Cancel]"I\rMy Ralts can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Iki, Paniola,Royal,Tapu,Cancel]"Q\rMy Ralts can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Iki, Paniola,Royal,Tapu,Seafolk,Cancel]"W\rMy Ralts can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Iki, Paniola,Royal,Tapu,Seafolk,Malie,Cancel]"\bRalts"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"�\bBrock: \PN, you wouldn't believe how good the Nurse Joy is here. She let me help her out with taking care of the Pokémon. I even got a gift from her."\bHere, let me show you."^\bBrock: Ah, what a lovely region. I think I'm going to go see if I can meet Olivia next."MRotom Dex: That was enough for one day, wasn't it? Let's head back home."S\rIn Alola we have our Mart inside the Centers. We like to make things simple."\rBlissey"Yes"No[#"\rGuérilande"W\rMon Tarsal peut te téléporter. Cependant, il est trop fatigué pour le moment."A\rMon Tarsal peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1, Lili'i, Annuler]"H\rMon Tarsal peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1, Lili'i, Ohana, Annuler]"Y\rMon Tarsal peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1, Lili'i, Ohana, Rue Dôme Royal, Annuler]"g\rMon Tarsal peut te téléporter.\ch[1,-1, Lili'i, Ohana, Rue Dôme Royal, Village Toko, Annuler]"y\rMon Tarsal peut te téléporter.\ch[