 what you have." \bMine are not rare enough."?\bYou shouldn't have come down here. This place is sacred."\bJust stay out of here."E\bSophocles: So what did you think? Pretty cool place, isn't it?"�\bI'm impressed that you even made it this far. I guess we can battle now; I hear you're into that kind of thing. I'll heal your team first though."K\bSophocles: I guess you had some good luck. Are you ready to go back?"\bHurry up."\bDon't test me."$\bI have some bugs to work out."'\bI could go for a practice dummy.""\bIt's good to train in here."Yes"NoIu;␀	[["\bHalt."3\bGood battle. I guess you deserve to advance."FRotom Dex: That's both of them. Let's head back to the professor."9\rYou need permission from Hala to enter this trial."%\bMy Butterfree will never lose."G\bHow did Butterfree lose? I've had it since I started my journey."S\bKukui: Hey cousin. I see you beat your first trial. What did you get for it?"�\bA Normalium Z, huh? With that you can finally use Z-Moves. Your Pokémon can use Z-Power now! But you can only use it once in a battle."~\bEach crystal is specific in what it can do. The one you just got will turn any Normal type move into a powerful attack."Z\bKukui: Your Pokémon can use Z-Power now! But you can only use it once in a battle."-\rI wonder what is out there in the sea."F\rI want to travel to Hoenn. I hear they have a lot of water too."Verdant Cavern"$\rThe island trial is up ahead."1\rI've beaten it before. It was fun I guess."'\rI'm getting ready for the trial."L\rHala gives everyone a chance to try the trial. All you need is spunk.["\bHalte."<\bBeau combat. Je suppose que tu mérites de continuer."JMotisma-Dex: Voilà pour ces deux-là. Retournons voir le professeur."T\rTu as besoin de la permission de Pectorius pour participer à cette Épreuve."'\bMon Papilusion ne perdra jamais."T\bComment Papilusion a-t-il pu perdre ? Je l'ai depuis le début de mon voyage."l\bEuphorbe: Hé, cousin ! Je vois que tu as réussi ta première Épreuve. Qu'est-ce que tu as obtenu ?"�\bUne Normazélite, hein ? Avec ça, tu peux enfin utiliser les Capacités Z. Tes Pokémon peuvent libérer leur Force Z maintenant ! Mais tu ne peux l'utiliser qu'une seule fois par combat."�\bChaque cristal est spécifique à ce qu'il peut faire. Celui que tu viens de recevoir transformera n'importe quelle capacité de type Normal en une attaque dévastatrice."f\bEuphorbe: Tes Pokémon peuvent utiliser la Force Z ! Mais une seule fois par combat, d'accord ?"4\rJe me demande ce qu'il y a là-bas, au large."`\rJ'aimerais voyager jusqu'à Hoenn. On m'a dit qu'il y avait beaucoup d'eau là-bas aussi."Grotte Verdoyante"-\rL'Épreuve de l'île est juste devant."7\rJe l'ai déjà réussie. C'était plutôt sympa."&\rJe me prépare pour l'Épreuve."k\rPectorius donne à tout le monde une chance de tenter l'Épreuve. Tout ce qu'il faut, c'est du cran.;["\bHalt."3\bGood battle. I guess you deserve to advance."FRotom Dex: That's both of them. Let's head back to the professor."9\rYou need permission from Hala to enter this trial."%\bMy Butterfree will never lose."G\bHow did Butterfree lose? I've had it since I started my journey."S\bKukui: Hey cousin. I see you beat your first trial. What did you get for it?"�\bA Normalium Z, huh? With that you can finally use Z-Moves. Your Pokémon can use Z-Power now! But you can only use it once in a battle."~\bEach crystal is specific in what it can do. The one you just got will turn any Normal type move into a powerful attack."Z\bKukui: Your Pokémon can use Z-Power now! But you can only use it once in a battle."-\rI wonder what is out there in the sea."F\rI want to travel to Hoenn. I hear they have a lot of water too."Verdant Cavern"$\rThe island trial is up ahead."1\rI've beaten it before. It was fun I guess."'\rI'm getting ready for the trial."L\rHala gives everyone a chance to try the trial. All you need is spunk.Iu;␀�
[["lRotom Dex: That didn't take too long. Let's visit some other friends today. Kiawe might be at the farm."Y\bMy friend is looking for nectar right now. Don't think I'm gonna let you steal it."-\bI'm getting ready for my island trial."3\bYou're challenging it too! No wonder I lost."W\bSophocles: You want to help me rescue the Ultra Beast? Too bad this one is mine."0\bSophocles: I guess you can take this one."{\rMallow: Good to see you \PN. I need to find some nectar for a recipe of mine. It should be in the meadow next to us."�\rMallow: Good job getting the nectar. You can keep that one. I found my own. My Bounsweet actually evolved in the process. Let me show you."4\rMallow: That's all I had for you. Thanks \PN.":Rotom Dex: Great work. Let's head back to the school.""\bNo one is going to stop me."4\bI can't slow down. It goes against my nature."\bEver seen my show?"G\bIt's a great show. Really, stop what you're doing and go see it.""\rWhere are all the Raticate?"7\rNever stop looking. They all show up eventually."0\bSo someone finally made the trip up here."=\bWhat a great hike that was. Can't wait to do it again."7\bIt's always a bonus to feel bonded to your team."8\bGive it to a friend to increase their friendship." \bThey call me Dragon Rage.")\bYou're good. It's time I moved on.["wMotisma-Dex: Ça n'a pas été trop long. Allons voir d'autres amis aujourd'hui. Kiawe est peut-être à la ferme."\\bMon ami cherche du nectar en ce moment. Ne crois pas que je vais te laisser le voler."2\bJe me prépare pour mon Épreuve de l'île."A\bToi aussi, tu la relèves ! Pas étonnant que j'aie perdu."Z\bChrys: Tu veux m'aider à sauver l'Ultra-Chimère ? Trop tard, celle-ci est à moi."7\bChrys: Je suppose que tu peux prendre celle-là."�\rBarbara: Contente de te voir, \PN. Je dois trouver du nectar pour une de mes recettes. Il devrait y en avoir dans le pré juste à côté."�\rBarbara: Beau travail pour le nectar. Tu peux garder celui-là, j'ai trouvé le mien. Mon Croquine a même 