OtherIu;␀�[["X\rMy husband is from Hoenn. He insists that gyms are better than the island trials."Y\bHala: Welcome to Iki Town, \PN. I heard you want to challenge the trials in Alola."v\bIs that a Z-Ring on your wrist? Yes, it looks very familiar. That must be the one that Tapu Koko stole from me."l\bDo not worry, you can keep it. If our guardian sees potential in you I see no reason to take it back."c\bI'll give the guard the ok to let you challenge your first trial. You'll find it on Route 2."[\bHala: I'll give the guard the ok to let you challenge it. You'll find it on Route 2."c\bMy wife won't stop saying gym battles are inferior. The island trial is the one that's lame.["n\rMon mari vient de Hoenn. Il insiste sur le fait que les arènes sont mieux que les épreuves des îles."u\bPectorius : Bienvenue à Lili'i, \PN. J'ai entendu dire que tu voulais relever le défi des Épreuves d'Alola."}\bEst-ce un Bracelet Z à ton poignet ? Oui, il me semble très familier. Ce doit être celui que Tokorico m'a dérobé."}\bNe t'inquiète pas, tu peux le garder. Si notre gardien voit du potentiel en toi, je ne vois aucune raison de le reprendre."x\bJe vais donner le feu vert au garde pour te laisser tenter ta première Épreuve. Tu la trouveras sur la Route 2."~\bPectorius: Je vais donner le feu vert au garde pour te laisser tenter ta première Épreuve. Tu la trouveras sur la Route 2."}\bMa femme n'arrête pas de dire que les combats d'Arène sont inférieurs. C'est l'Épreuve de l'île qui est ringarde.;["X\rMy husband is from Hoenn. He insists that gyms are better than the island trials."Y\bHala: Welcome to Iki Town, \PN. I heard you want to challenge the trials in Alola."v\bIs that a Z-Ring on your wrist? Yes, it looks very familiar. That must be the one that Tapu Koko stole from me."l\bDo not worry, you can keep it. If our guardian sees potential in you I see no reason to take it back."c\bI'll give the guard the ok to let you challenge your first trial. You'll find it on Route 2."[\bHala: I'll give the guard the ok to let you challenge it. You'll find it on Route 2."c\bMy wife won't stop saying gym battles are inferior. The island trial is the one that's lame.Iu;␀�
