me."d\bAh, yes, this is it. Yes, very interesting. Wonderful, thank you \PN. Take this as my thanks."-\bIf you find one please bring it to me."J\bOak: I see we made it. Your mother and I are here to watch you win."8\rOlivia: I'm a referee. I hope to see you advance."9\rAcerola: Ah, you're here too. Should have guessed."2\rAcerola: I'm battling Kiawe. Sounds spooky."J\rAcerola: I may be out, but that just means I can cheer everyone on."+\rAcerola: I'm pumped for your battle."\rComfey">\rHello. Here you can register for the Manalo Conference.""\rWould you like to register?",\rGreat! Let's set you up for a battle."<\rYour first battle will be to the far left. Good luck!"#\rNo problem. Have a good day."#\rYou have already registered."�\rOh my, is that Alola's Champion and World Monarch \PN? Are you sure you want to register for the Manalo Conference? It might be too easy for you..."�\rOk then... well, we've changed the format a little bit, being that the Battle Royale ends when there's 32 contestants left, instead of 16."�\rFor you specifically, you also have to battle 4 trainers, including one of your classmates, in order to move on. Don't ask me why, I have no idea either."6\rGood luck! Though you probably won't need it..."1\rLana: I bet the first round will be tough.""\rLana: The Top 16. I did it!"2\rLana: Guzma looks scary. I hope I beat him."6\rLana: Guzma beat me easily. Get revenge for me."?\rLana: A battle between you and Gladion. Sounds exciting."3\bThis is where the Battle Royale takes place."5\bThis is where the beginning rounds take place."\bAre you ready?"\bRight this way."\bVery well."k\bKukui: Excited? I am! The first round is a Battle Royale. Be one of the last 16 standing to move on."M\bIf you end up the Champion you'll even get to battle the Masked Royal."2\bKukui: Top 16, huh? I knew you could do it."1\bKukui: Top 8, huh? I knew you could do it."`\bKukui: Semi Finals, huh? And you're battling Guzma at that. Don't let him intimidate you."=\bKuku